<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 Krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow aming tukah dowi chekhai; nachepaw Ezra naown kown mih sakowmra uowi, now arui khin dow 400 BC khe kowh chekhai. 1 hai 2 Krungchakuüa bowih mih auown khe dow pabowih sang chowdiah; tawkche akung kowi dow ta changah pre bowih khai. Mami bowih kowi kowh arui lang uowi mih dow pre pren kowi kowh maru-uüa lawnguan, mang Sawlawmawn chowm mang mih auown pra hai achur pra kowh lawnguan chekhai, now Thurai chup kim thawp hai Jerusalem marow piak mih lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tawkche mami bowih kowi kowh lang pankri mih lawnguan dow mang David krungchak luk kowi Thurai kowh sanara uowi mih chekhai. Mami bowih kowi dow tawngphak pra kowh Israel lawnguan kowi khowt pat tekla dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami pren kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi dow Israel ching pahai tuakla dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi kowbüah lawnguan dow khowt pat tekla dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Nowng changra: Nowng changra pami dow auan uowi pre buk chekhai. Lowk dow maru kowi krawi chang nowng powng mih chekhai, now alowk mih dow lowra sia nowng chang mih kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Sangbowk laitawm tawkpla: Sangbowk laitawm tawkpla pami dow Thurai ana hown kowh thawpah mih singh hown kowh tawkpla chekhai. Nami tawkpla kowi dow kuh hown sowah khai. Nami dow iawng pami tawkpla nadowi chekhai. Nami tawkpla lak kowi dow Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm huapher hai Arawn kowh raitua uowi chekhai. Nami tawkpla re-e dow Israeluüa hown Thurai uang taklang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Ari aiang hai ari arow: Ari aiang hai ari arow dow achap sang mih chaing nadowi chekhai. Ari aiang dow paprenma nachünah kownkow chowra hownia kowh thawpah mih chekhai, now ari arow dow lowkkowlowk chenchap nachünah kownkow lowkkowlowk chenchap thawpah mih chekhai. Rirow dow chen lang now rirow paw lang bowk chekhai. Tawkche ari aiang dow parenma vüi kowi achaing sang chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Piati: Piati pami dow maru chownglawng kowi angak naphaw kown mih lai krawi tek mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Sawlawmawn mang chowng 1:1-9:31</para>
  <para style="io2">Uown khe kowh ning 1:1-17</para>
  <para style="io2">Thurai chup kim thawp lawnguan 2:1-7:10</para>
  <para style="io2">Achur prakowi kowh ning 7:11-9:31</para>
  <para style="io1">Tawngphak pra kowh chenchapuüa kowi kingküa mih 10:1-19</para>
  <para style="io1">Judauüa pren 11:1-36:12</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem marow piak mih 36:13-23</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CH 1" />
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn lü chanlaira mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 1:1" />David kowh chapa Sawlawmawn dow aia kowh mangra mih akhawtma changah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai dow aia tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai, now aia kowi kri kraingma changah khai.<verse eid="2CH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 1:2" />Akat khe Sawlawmawn dow Israeluüa maten, 1,000 ia siphai luk kowi kowh aluchowuüa, 100 ia siphai luk kowi kowh aluchowuüa, tara chet miuüa hai Israel chenchap kowi kowh chowlowkkow krungchak aluchowuüa kowi arasang nauang takua talawm kownkow lawt ana khai. <verse eid="2CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 1:3" />Nami kung kowi amatni dow Gibeawn kowi kowh alowngma mih arah kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowkowi khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow süngrüp süngkangma kowi uowi khe kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi thawpah mih CHAKRAMANG kim dow nakowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 1:4" />Tawkche nami CHAKRAMANG kim kowi dow Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla uowi dowi chekhai. Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla dow Kiriat-Jearim marow hownia Jerusalem marow kowi kowh thawpah mih tangbung lak kowi David uang pawla khai bowt. <verse eid="2CH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 1:5" />Nachenganchepaw Uri chapa Bezalel thawpah mih kri hown kowh phuchuara dow Gibeawn marow kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kim pur kowi chekhai. (Uri kowh pa dow Hur chekhai). Naiawng rakowi Sawlawmawn hai maru maten dow Gibeawn marow kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="2CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 1:6" />Nakhowk khe Sawlawmawn dow nami phuchuara re-e kowkowiah hanow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi tawncher 1,000 pum hown tikah mih uanap chang khai.<verse eid="2CH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 1:7" />Nami iak khe mang lak kowi Sawlawmawn tut-e Thurai uangah hanow tek pe mih, “Lowra sia ang tut-e en awr lü mih ang nape en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 1:8" />Nakhowk khe Sawlawmawn klangah mih, “Apa David kowi en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura en tüng pe khai, now aia kowh mang chowm rah kowi en pe chowm ang mang khai. <verse eid="2CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 1:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, apa tut-e kowh en takhamah mih kawmat pe tachiah diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en pe chowm ang mang mih dow chenchap aiukma mih luk kowi chekhai; amatni dow maru iun kawm krang lusa kowi kowh sema nowng rüaah dowi mih iawng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 1:10" />Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi aiungma nakruitownla kownkow chanlaira hai tukra pe ang diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maiawng khowt kawm mih en kowh maru-uüa kowi nowng kruitown mih dow miapaw uowi dowi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 1:11" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Sawlawmawn mih, “Chowngdawng sakklangra ün, kowmatia vüi dawngthawnguan ün hai kowmatia ransu-uüa piakra en lü dowi kowi ang maru-uüa kowi nakruitownla kown mih vüi <char style="w">chanlaira</char> hai tukra chowtaih en lü khai. <verse eid="2CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 1:12" />Naiawng rakowi chanlaira hai tukra ang peta en khowk. Dawngthawnguan hai ringkawra paw ang pela en khowk. En hown tale mih dow en dowi rawn kowh manguüa paw uowi dowi, now en kung kowi paw nauowi kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 1:13" />Nami kung kowi Sawlawmawn dow Gibeawn kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kim hownia Jerusalem marow kowi uang mang khai bowt, now Israeluüa luk kowi chowm mang khai bowt.<verse eid="2CH 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn kowh dawngthawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 1:14" />Sawlawmawn dow kawrnga kari hai kawrnga mih ahuma kramta khai. Aia kowh kawrnga kari kawm dow 1,400 klüng, now kawrnga kawm dow 12,000 pum chekhai. Naiawngün dow kawrnga kari towk rah marow kowi ne, now Jerusalem marow kowi ne aia towah khai. <verse eid="2CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 1:15" />Mang Sawlawmawn chowm mang mih khin khe Jerusalem marow kowi kowh kuh hai tai hu krang dow hua iawng towbowt, now sidar sing hu krang paw awkaw kowi kowh uidut singh iawng towbowt. <verse eid="2CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 1:16" />Mang Sawlawmawn kowh kawrnga dow Aigupta pren hai Kilikia marow hownia kowh uang pawla mih chekhai. Mang kowh kun chang miuüa naiawngün dow Kilikia hownia kowh uang ranla mih chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 1:17" />Aigupta pren hownia kowh uang ranla mih kawrnga hai kawrnga kari sung dow lowk kowi tai 7 set hown 800 gram chi chekhai. Naiawngün kawrnga hai kawrnga kari dow kun chang miuüa mih Hituüa hai Siriauüa kowh manguüa tut-e cham sumah reng chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CH 2" />
  <para style="s">Nathawp Thurai chup kim kown mih kamrüt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 2:1" />Mang Sawlawmawn dow CHAKRAMANG kowi nachupiiala kownkow nathawp pe CHAKRAMANG chup kim lowk kown mih hai aia vüi nathawp pe mang kim lowk kownkow lawt ana khai. <verse eid="2CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 2:2" />Aia dow nachang kurdik lup kown mih maru iun 70,000 ia, hungh kowi nabawp hua kown mih 80,000 ia, now naiawngün lup chang miuüa kowi kowh mingkhet kown mih 3,600 ia kowi towah khai.<verse eid="2CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 2:3" />Sur pren mang Hiram kowi Sawlawmawn krawi tek pe mih, “Apa David chang kim khe en uang krawi sa pe sidar singh iawng dow ang vüi paw uang krawi sa ang dit. <verse eid="2CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 2:4" />CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai kowi nachupiiala kownkow ang tarowng thawp pe kim thüm khowk. Nahanow maru kawmuüa dow aia pur kowi anam iungma mih maikhük naia towk bowt kown, now nakowi dow chimsaima mih kawm atungma nauowi kown towbowt. Nami klen kowi rau towng hai iak pra towng, Tanai Ni khe, Lacher Pawi khe hai CHAKRAMANG khowm bowkta mih pawi khe tikah mih phuchua naia chang kown towbowt. Naiawngün dow chowngchowng saksakma Israeluüa vüi nachünah kown mih rirow chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 2:5" />“Ang nathawpah kown mih Thurai chup kim dow kri kraingma naown kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow anging kowh Thurai dow thuraiuüa maten lak-e kri kraing chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 2:6" />CHAKRAMANG chup kim nowng thawp mih mia chow uowi? Tawngplawng kowchow panow mukuang kowi khowm aia uowi rah takowi dowi chekhai. Aia pur kowi kowh phuchuaah mih uanap tik rah chowtaih ang nowng thawp. Tawkche aia uowi rah kim dow tawng iawng chow ang nowng thawpah kown?<verse eid="2CH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 2:7" />“Naiawng rakowi kuh, tai, kri hai lawngha hown lowra lup tuk chang mih kowi uang chin ang lowk ia diah. Aia dow aringma mih, aingma mih hai aruama mih la hown lowra lup paw pacham tuk chang lah. Nami maru dow apa David klola mih Juda hai Jerusalem kowi kowh uowi mih lup chang miuüa hown natawi chang lup kown. <verse eid="2CH 2:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="2CH 2:8-9" />En kowh maru-uüa dow singh tuk akiakma mih ang tuk. Naiawng rakowi Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh sidar singh, karpowng singh hai algum singh uang krawi sa ang diah. Ang kowh maru-uüa paw en kowh maru-uüa kowi natawi khowngah kown taih. Nahanow amatni dow ang nauah mowr naka ang singh kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG chup kim mih aiukma panow klangiungma ang nathawpah kown. <verse eid="2CH 2:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 2:10" />Tu ang singh mih en kowh maru-uüa kowi dow püm 120,000 mawn ngia, iakmow 120,000 mawn ngia, grep tui 12,000 mawn ngia hai kanrawn sau 12,000 mawn ngia ang napeah kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 2:11" />Nami laiklow ta hanow mang Hiram dow chasak hown mang Sawlawmawn kowi krawi klangah khai. Mang Hiram tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa kowi sakrau rakowi aia maru-uüa luk kowi aia pe chowm en mang khai. <verse eid="2CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 2:12" />Mukuang hai lusa thawp miia CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai dow akiow pauowi lah. Aia dow mang David kowi chanlaira hai tukra uowima mih chapa peah lowk ia khai. Nami David chapa dow CHAKRAMANG chup kim lowk, now aiamat vüi kim lowk nathawp kown.<verse eid="2CH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 2:13" />“Akiakma panow lowra sia tuk chang mih Huram pami kowi ang uang chin en lowk ia khowk. <verse eid="2CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 2:14" />Aia kowh u dow Dan krungchak, now aia kowh pa dow Sur marowchak chekhai. Huram dow kuh, tai, kri, lawngha, singh hai hua hown kowh lowra lup tuk chang mih chekhai. Now aia dow aring, aing hai aringma mih la hown paw lowra lup tuk chang chekhai. Nami klen kowi lowra chap luk kowi naher kown mih lup paw akiakma, now akuh rowprowp lowra sia nathawp kown mih paw atukma chekhai. Aia dow en kowh lup chang miuüa hai ang kowh chakramang en pa David kowh lup chang miuüa hown natawi chang lup kown.<verse eid="2CH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 2:15" />“Naiawng rakowi en tekta iawng püm, iakmow, kanrawn sau hai grep tui mih uang krawi sa anging diah. <verse eid="2CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 2:16" />Singh dow en nau mowr anging krawi tu hanow Lebanawn hungh hownia Jopa aw mowr naiu kla en sow. Nami hownia naiawngün singh mih Jerusalem marow kowi pawla büah towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 2:17" />Sawlawmawn dow a-pa David iawng Israel pren kowi kowh prenlang maru-uüa kowi rüaah khai. Now naiawngün maru iun dow 153,600 ia chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 2:18" />Naiawngünuüa pungmadawng hownia aia dow nachang kurdik lup kown mih maru iun 70,000 ia, hungh kowi nabawp hua kown mih 80,000 ia, now naiawngün lup chang miuüa kowi kowh mingkhet kown mih 3,600 ia kowi towah khai.<verse eid="2CH 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CH 3" />
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn thawp CHAKRAMANG kim mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 3:1" />Akung kowi mang Sawlawmawn dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Moria hungh kowi CHAKRAMANG kim thawp tarowng khai bowt. A-pa David kowi CHAKRAMANG tüng pe mukmang mih dow nami Moria hungh kowi kowh Arauna te re-e chekhai. Arauna dow Jebus chenchap chekhai. David dow nami arah mih CHAKRAMANG kim chang müa vüi khowmah bowkah khai. <verse eid="2CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 3:2" />Mang Sawlawmawn uown tarowng CHAKRAMANG kim chang mih dow aia chowm mang mih tali ning nga kowi kowh pre la kowi kowh lacher pre ni khe chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 3:3" />Aia dow Thurai kim thawp müa auown khe kowh nowkta iawng areng klang 60 muk hai adowng phia 20 muk thawpah khai. <verse eid="2CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 3:4" />Now CHAKRAMANG kim pur kowi kowh kimpuk dow kim downg phia mowr 20 muk, now aluk kro 120 muk aia thawpah khai. Now alak kowi dow achangma mih kuh hown aia sowah khai.<verse eid="2CH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 3:5" />Now towklak lang iuk mih kowi dow karpowng singh phen hown aia phaiah khai. Nami kung kowi dow nami kimbang kowi mih achangma mih kuh hown aia krawi sowah khai. Now nami kimbang kowi dow chekmarawng singh rup hai kri leng rup aia her pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 3:6" />Nami klen kowi nami kim dow asung khakma mih hua hown aia tawngah khai. Aia tawngah mih kuh dow Parvaim pren hownia kowh chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 3:7" />Kimbang kowi dow Cherup rup aia krawi her pe khai, now kim mawm, kimplawt mawm, kimbang hai kimbüng kowi dow kuh hown aia krawi sowah khai.<verse eid="2CH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 3:8" />Nami kung kowi mang Sawlawmawn dow Lang Chimsai mih Arah thawp khai. Nami kim dow kim downg phia uowi mowr adowng phia 20 muk hai areng klang 20 muk aia thawpah khai. Now alak pra kowh kimbang kowi dow achangma mih kuh 585 mawn hown aia sowah khai. <verse eid="2CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 3:9" />Kuh hown kowh khir dik dow 650 gram chekhai. Now aluk krowng kowi kowh towklak bang kowi paw kuh hown aia krawi sowah khai. <verse eid="2CH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 3:10" />Now nami Lang Chimsai mih Arah kowi dow aia thawp pe Cherup rup pre buk khai, now nami dow kuh hown aia sowah khai. <verse eid="2CH 3:10" /><verse number="11-13" style="v" sid="2CH 3:11-13" />Naiawngün Cherup rup kowh dow alap uowi pre buk chi chekhai, now nami lap klang dow tanga muk chi chekhai. Cherup rup lowk mih kowh alap papra dow mapra kowh kimbang kowi takak khai, now alowk mih kowh alap paw papra mih dow alowk mih pra kowh kimbang kowi takak khai. Now akeng pra kowh lap dow lowkkowlowk alap chem takak khai. Nami Cherup rup kowh dow alap pre buk trui iangta hüah khe aklang 20 muk chekhai. Nami pre buk mih Cherup rup dow hing iowng hüah chekhai, now amatchi kowh lumowr dang mih dow towklak lang iuk mih prakowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 3:11-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 3:14" />Now mang Sawlawmawn dow aruama mih la, mintau pau rawng la, aringma mih la hai adipükchow mih la hown uaniang mih kawngah khai. Now nami uaniang kowi dow sawt pe Cherup rup khai.<verse eid="2CH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 3:15" />CHAKRAMANG kim pur kowi dow aia thawpla pe kimchüng pre buk khai. Naiawngün kimchüng dow aklang 35 muk chi, now alu iuk dow tanga muk chi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 3:16" />Now aia dow thawp pe lawngha leng hanow nami pre buk mih kimchüng lu kowi patah khai, now dalim uih iawng thawp pe 100 klüng hanow nami lawngha leng kowi krawi tanah khai. <verse eid="2CH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 3:17" />Nami pre buk mih kimchüng dow CHAKRAMANG kim pur kowi mrawkphak prakowi lowk, now tawngphak prakowi lowk aia phükah khai. Mrawkphak prakowi kowh phükah mih kimchüng kowi dow Jachin pahai aia chap pe ming khai. (Jachin pami dow “Achowk miia” pami chekhai). Now tawngphak prakowi kowh chowkah mih kimchüng kowi dow Boaz pahai aia chap pe ming khai. (Boaz pami dow “Aia tut-e kür uowi” pami chekhai).<verse eid="2CH 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CH 4" />
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim kowi tawngah kown mih uanh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 4:1" />Mang Sawlawmawn dow kri hown thawp phuchuara lowk khai. Nami phuchuara dow areng klang 20 muk, adowng phia 20 muk hai aluk kro 20 muk chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 4:2" />Nami kung kowi dow natowla tui kownkow kri hown tuipam aiukma Sawlawmawn thawp lowk khai. Nami tuipam dow mami uer hownia atengma paimi uer mowr khaiah hanow hamüt muk chekhai. Abüp dow tanga muk, now aiuk dow 30 muk chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 4:3" />Nami tuipam uat pra dow auer dakchow kowi tapat lut kri hown kowh thawpah mih uih<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">uih rup </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami mami bowih kowi kowh arui prim kowi tawngbak mih dow uih takcha chiala pahai arui uowi chekhai. </char></note> rup uowi pre tan chekhai. Naiawngün uih rup dow pamuk e taruk klüng ngia chi thawpah khai. Naiawngün uih rup dow klaiah khe hownia aiawng uowi mih chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 4:4" />Now nami tuipam dow kri hown kowh thawpah mih chiala laipre pum mih luk kowi chowmah khai. Naiawngün chiala dow tawngphak pra dang sum pum, satkup pra dang sum pum, mrawkphak pra dang sum pum, now satlawt pra dang sum pum chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 4:5" />Nami tuipam tat dow tali met chekhai. Nami tuipam mowr dow bia chah mowr iawng chekhai, now lili pau powm iawng uat prakowi awr talown khai. Nami tuipam kowi tui takowi mih dow 1,800 mawn ngia chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 4:6" />Aia dow thawp biatum hamüt klüng khai. Nami biatum dow Thurai chup kim mrawkphak prakowi tanga klüng, now tawngphak prakowi tanga klüng aia towah khai. Nami biatum dow tikah mih uanap sau müa chekhai. Tawkche uamowuüa saula rut khawk mih dow tuipam tui hown chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 4:7" />Mang Sawlawmawn mih kuh hown thawp maibu towng hamüt klüng khai. Nami maibu towng dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh towklak lang iuk mih kowi mrawkphak prakowi tanga klüng, now tawngphak prakowi tanga klüng aia towah khai. <verse eid="2CH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 4:8" />Nami klen kowi aia dow thawp pawitang hamüt klüng khai. Nami pawitang dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh towklak lang iuk mih mrawkphak prakowi tanga klüng, now tawngphak prakowi tanga klüng aia towah khai. Now bia paw kuh hown aia thawp 100 klüng khai.<verse eid="2CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 4:9" />Aia dow uamowuüa vüi thawp viadawng pre buk khai. Nami viadawng dow aiukma lowk, now asowmchow lowk aia thawpah khai. Nami viadawng vüi aia thawp pe aplawt hanow kri hown aia sowah khai. <verse eid="2CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 4:10" />Now Thurai chup kim mrawkphak pra hai satlawt pra kowh nui kowi dow tuipam aiukma mih aia towah khai.<verse eid="2CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 4:11" />Nami klen kowi Sawlawmawn kowh uanh thawp sara Hiram mih maivia towk rah puh ün, uaibak ün hai bia ün thawpla khai. Naiawng hai Hiram mih mang Sawlawmawn vüi Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup maten uownah mih dow churta khai bowt. <verse eid="2CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 4:12" />Mang Sawlawmawn thawpah mih uanh dow kri hown kowh kimchüng pre buk, kimchüng luk kowi kowh chowmah mih alumpuma mih alu pre buk, alu pre buk mih kowi kowh umah mih kri leng pre rüa, <verse eid="2CH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 4:13" />naiawngün kri leng kowi natanah pre tan kown mih dalim uih 400 klüng, <verse eid="2CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 4:14" />tawkpla, tawkpla luk kowi kowh chowmah kown mih biatum, <verse eid="2CH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 4:15" />tuipam aiukma mih, tuipam aiukma mih chowm müa kri hown kowh chiala laipre buk, <verse eid="2CH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 4:16" />plawi kuak müa puh, plawi vür müa uaibak hai tawncher vi towng müa biatum ün chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 4:16">Thurai chup kim vüi kowi kowh kri hown Hiram thawpah mih uanh maten dow tawk pluplup chekhai. Naiawngün uanh maten dow mang Sawlawmawn ana pek iawng Hiram thawpah mih kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 4:17" />Naiawngün uanh maten dow Jawrdan lawngrawi re-e kowh Sukawt hai Jerethan marow takra kowi bawnnai kowi klai pe kri kowh mang Sawlawmawn pe thawpah mih kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 4:18" />Naiawngün uanh dow hu lai bowt kowh mang Sawlawmawn khaiah dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün kri uanh dow mün khowt chow adik uowi mih tukah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 4:19" />Thurai chup kim vüi kowi kowh mang Sawlawmawn thawpah mih uanh dow kuh hown kowh phuchuara, chimsaima mih kawm towk rah hai kuh hown kowh pawitang, <verse eid="2CH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 4:20" />kuh achangma mih hown kowh thawpah mih maibu towngh ün chekhai. Naiawngün maibu towngh dow lang chimsai mih arah pur kowi aia towah khai. <verse eid="2CH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 4:21" />Nami klen kowi kuh hown kowh thawpah mih pau, bia hai kep, <verse eid="2CH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 4:22" />kuh achangma mih hown kowh thawpah mih bia chah, bawthi kep müa kaingkep, nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa biatum, uaibak hai mairing towk müa puh, Lang Chimsai Mih Towklak hai Thurai chup kim kowi kowh towklak lang iuk mih kimplawt klia müa kuh hown kowh akli ün paw aia thawpla khai.<verse eid="2CH 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 5:1" />Naiawng hai mang Sawlawmawn mih Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup maten dow ki changta khai bowt. Nami kung kowi dow aia mih CHAKRAMANG vüi a-pa David lang kraah mih uanh maten Thurai chup kim kowi uang pawla khai. Naiawngün dow kuh, tai hai achap kawm uanh chekhai. Naiawngün dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah kowi aia towah khai.<verse eid="2CH 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim kowi uang pawla sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 5:2" />Now Thurai chup kim kowi kowh uanh ki thawpta bowk kung kowi dow Mang Sawlawmawn mih David marow (Zaiawn) kowi kowh towah mih sangbowk laitawm tawkpla Thurai chup kim kowi nauang pawla kownkow kamrüt khai. Aia dow Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa hai Israel kowh laipre krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa kowi Jerusalem marow kowi kuaah lawmah khai; amatni dow Israel kowh machak aluchowuüa chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 5:3" />Nami khin khe Israeluüa dow nasun <char style="w">Te Pawi</char> kownkow nakowi uowi khai. Nami akhin dow Ethanim pami la ranit la khe chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="2CH 5:4-5" />Now aluchowuüa maten uang taküm kung kowi dow uamowuüa hai Leviuüa mih sangbowk laitawm tawkpla, taklowp taklangra te hai chimsaima mih uanh maten Thurai chup kim kowi kowpawla khai bowt. <verse eid="2CH 5:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 5:6" />Now mang Sawlawmawn hai aia hown kowh tawi mih maru kawmuüa maten dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla pur kowi chia hai ruapur ahuma hown Thurai kowi phuchua khai. Amatni changla phuchua mih chia hai ruapur dow hu lai kowh nowng rüaah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 5:7" />Nami kung kowi dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih Thurai chup kim lak kowi kowh Lang Chimsai Mih Towklak kowi uamowuüa uang pawla khai, now nami dow Cherup rup kowh lap krüa kowi towah büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 5:8" />Nahanow nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla hai akawtlawng maten dow Cherup rup kowh lap hown tatung bowk khai. <verse eid="2CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 5:9" />Naiawngün akawtlawng dow klang lai rakowi naiawngün chem dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh chimsaima mih towklak hownia ia khi khai. Nachenganchepaw chimsaima mih towklak uat hownia dow ia khi dowi chekhai. (Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla dow akawtlawng hailawm kawmat pat nami Thurai chup kim lak kowi uowi reng chekhai). <verse eid="2CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 5:10" />Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla lak kowi dow Mosi towah mih sangbowk laitawm huapher pre buk klen kowi tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai. Nami sangbowk laitawm huapher dow Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa uang lawt kung kowi Sinai hungh re-e uowi khe amatni kowi CHAKRAMANG peah mih chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 5:11" />Nami kung kowi uamowuüa dow chimsaima mih towklak hownia prang kowi uang lawt büah khai bowt. Nami dowi rawn amatni dow chowlowkkow kowi tachim tasai büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 5:12" />Levi krungchak kowi kowh tünteu hown tek meng reng mih Asaf, Heman, Jeduthun, amatni kowh chapauüa hai amatni kowh tainau-uüa dow adipükchow mih uan hown kowh kawngah mih kowrmow khupma hown phuchuara satlawt prakowi iowng büah khai, now klingchow, tingteng hai taraw tep büah khai. Nakhowk khe baw tum mih akeng mih uamowuüa 120 ia dow meng sarauüa hown tawi iowng khai. <verse eid="2CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 5:13" />Uamowuüa hai meng sarauüa baw tün hown, klingchow hai akeng mih tünteu hown akrowksang Thurai kowi tek awmrawm lai hai kiowah büah khai. Nakhowk khe amatni tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 5:13">“CHAKRAMANG dow aiungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 5:13">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 5:13">Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG chup kim lak kowi uangnim mih uang tek mawp khai. <verse eid="2CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 5:14" />Now naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra dow Thurai chup kim lak kowi uangnim iawng atekma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi uamowuüa mih tawng lup paw nowng chang dowi bowt.<verse eid="2CH 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 6:1" />Nakhowk khe Sawlawmawn tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, ‘Uangnim atatma mih kowi ang uowi kown,’ padow en tek khai.<verse eid="2CH 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 6:2" />“Kawmat dow en vüi kowi kim klangiungma ang thawpta en lowk khowk. Mami kim dow chowngchowng saksakma en vüi uowi rah naown bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 6:3" />Naiawng ki tek kung kowi dow mang Sawlawmawn mih aia ria kowi kowh iowng rimrim mih maru kawmuüa prakowi haitaplan hanow peah prasi khai. <verse eid="2CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 6:4" />Nami kung kowi dow aia tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai dow akiow pauowi lah. Aia dow apa David tut-e kowh aiamat nawr hown takhamta mih uang pe tachiah khai bowt. Aia dow tek mih, <verse eid="2CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 6:5" />‘Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla kung kowi nachupiiala ang kownkow ang kowh chup kim thawp rah Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia mia iawng mih krungchakuüa kowh marow paw ang ruiah dowi chekhai. Now ang maru Israeluüa luk kowi nachowng mang kown mih paw tawng iawng mih maru kowi paw ang ruiah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 6:6" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow ang nauowila kownkow Jerusalem marow kowi ang ruiah khai, now ang kowh maru Israeluüa kowi nakruitownla kownkow David kowi ang ruiah khai,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 6:7" />CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai vüi nathawp pe chup kim lowk kownkow apa David kowh sak kowi uowi chowdiah. <verse eid="2CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 6:8" />Nachenganchepaw apa David kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Ang vüi nathawp ang kim lowk kown en sak kowi uowi mih iung. <verse eid="2CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 6:9" />Tawkchedow ang vüi chup kim mih en nathawp kown nadowi; en matia kowh chapa chowtaih nathawp kown. Ang vüi chup kim dow aia chowtaih nathawp kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 6:10" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh laikham uang pe tachiah khai bowt. Aia dow apa kowh mang rah pe ang khai, now CHAKRAMANG kowh laikham iawng Israel pren mang chowm rah kowi dow ang chowm khai bowt. Now CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai vüi mami chup kim dow ang thawp pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 6:11" />Now nami chup kim kowi dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla towk rah ang thawp pe khai. Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla lak kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm laiklow uowi mih huapher uowi chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ap Thurai chup kim khe kowh chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 6:12" />Nami kung kowi dow mang Sawlawmawn mih nakowi kowh takua talawm mih Israeluüa pur kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh phuchuara re-e iowng pah chawkla rut se chup Thurai khai. <verse eid="2CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 6:13" />(Mang Sawlawmawn mih kri hown areng klang tanga muk, adowng phia tanga muk hai akro sum muk mih prowng thawpah lowk hanow viadawng dawnglang kowi towah khai. Now aia dow nami prowng luk kowi kowphütah hanow Israeluüa maten pur kowi tua kung se rut pre pra trui kuang prakowi chawkla now chup Thurai khai). <verse eid="2CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 6:14" />Aia tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai, krawng hai mukuang kowi en iawng mih Thurai miapaw uowi dowi bowt. En dow en kowh sangbowk laitawm en townah reng. En dow plawng hown sak hown en tiama kowi mang mih en kowh naruüa luk kowi en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura en tüng pe reng. <verse eid="2CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 6:15" />En kowh nar apa David tut-e kowh en takhamta mih en uang pe tachiah khai. En dow nawr hown kowh en tekta mih iawng en chang mih ani anging khi khai bowt.<verse eid="2CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 6:16" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai, en kowh nar apa David tut-e kowh en takhamta mih laiklow townah diah. Aia kowi en tek pe mih, ‘En kowh chapauüa che en iawng ang kowh ari aiang kowi uowi iawng mang hai pe ching khai hanow Israel pren mang chowm rah kowi nachowm kown mih en krungchak hownia maru nakhawr kown nadowi,’ pakhai. <verse eid="2CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 6:17" />Aw CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai, en kowh nar David tut-e kowh en takhamta mih laiklow uang pe tachiah diah.<verse eid="2CH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 6:18" />“Nachenganchepaw Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, lusa kowi maru-uüa hown en tawi uowi nowm kown bow? Kuang dawng hai mukuang pren kowi khowm padow en uowi rah takowi dowi mih tawng iawng chow ang thawp en mih mami kim kowi en natakowi kown chow? <verse eid="2CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 6:19" />Nachenganchepaw aw CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai, en kowh nar awr lü awr leng mih hawt sünta ang diah. <verse eid="2CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 6:20" />Mami en kowh chup kim prakowi ni chut uar prowt chi uang iu müah reng diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami arah dow nachupiiala en kownkow en lang kloah mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi mami en kowh chup kim prakowi dang se ang uang lü mih khin khe hawt sünta ang diah. <verse eid="2CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 6:21" />Mami arah prakowi dang se en kowh nar hai en kowh maru Israeluüa uang lü uang leng mih khin khe hawt sünta pe diah. Naiawng uang lü uang leng mih dow en uowi rah mukuang pren hownia hawt sünta pe diah, now amatni kowh angak dow lawtta pe diah.<verse eid="2CH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 6:22" />“Now maru lowk mih akeng mih maru luk kowi tawita mata mih aprek ka kowh aia tawi dowi ma dowi mih sawi natakham kownkow mami en kowh chup kim re-e phuchuara ria kowi uang chepaw naia kown. <verse eid="2CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 6:23" />Nakhowk khe en mih mukuang hownia nami maru kowh laiklow hawt sünta pe diah, now chet pe tara nowm diah. Now chang ngak mih maru kowi dow aia kowh angak sung peah ripra diah, now chang angak dowi mih maru kowi dow lawtta diah.<verse eid="2CH 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 6:24" />“En kowi kingküala mih angak changta rakowi en kowh maru Israeluüa mih ransu-uüa tut-e tasen sum khe amatni che en tut-e uang plan hai mami en kowh chup kim kowi rowsi en hai en tut-e uang lü uang leng khai hanow <verse eid="2CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 6:25" />nakhowk khe amatni awr lü awr leng mih dow en mih mukuang pren hownia hawt sünta pe diah, now en kowh maru Israeluüa kowi amatni kowh angak lawtta pe hanow amatni pipu-uüa kowi en peah mih pren kowi uang plan pawla iawk diah.<verse eid="2CH 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 6:26" />“En kowh maru-uüa mih en kowi kingküala mih angak changta rakowi mukuang hownia en peah uang dowi mih khin khe amatni che mami en kowh chup kim prakowi uang dang khai, rowsi en khai, en tut-e awr lü awr leng khai, now en hownia ka ripra kowh angak hownia uang plan büah khai hanow <verse eid="2CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 6:27" />amatni awr lü awr leng mih mukuang pren hownia en hawt sünta pe diah, now en kowh nar Israeluüa kowh angak lawtta pe diah. Amatni kowi dow chownglawng kowi anowmma naia mangla kownkow tüngsangah diah, now nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow amatni kowi en peah mih pren luk kowi peah uang diah.<verse eid="2CH 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 6:28" />“Pren kowi che khown hai kowng hawi uang kla khai, luprak keula mih rawka phaw khai, luprak kowi plawng hai tuiselengkeng nammow hawmh krawi cha khai, amatni kowh tawngbak mih marow kowi chünchü ransu-uüa uang rumah khai, lowra mih phih hai rawka uang ting khai chepaw <verse eid="2CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 6:29" />en kowh maru Israeluüa mih nami khin khe tarip kowh sak kowi rauma hown mami en kowh chup kim prakowi chawk rut se awr lü awr leng khai hanow <verse eid="2CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 6:30" />nami dow en kowh uowi rah mukuang pren hownia hawt sünta pe diah. Amatni kowi dow en mih lawtta diah. Amatni kowi dow amatni changah mih lup iawng chet pe tara diah. (Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru maten kowh sak kowi tawng chow uowi mih tuk mih dow en chowtaih chekhai). <verse eid="2CH 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 6:31" />Nahanow anging pipu-uüa kowi en peah mih pren kowi chownglawng prat en kowh maru-uüa nakram en hai en tiama kowi namang kown towbowt.<verse eid="2CH 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 6:32" />“Nami klen kowi en kowh maru Israeluüa nadowi mih prenlang maru-uüa paw en kowh ming kri kraingma mih hai en kowh akürma mih rut hown en kowh ransu-uüa kowi en ripah mih laiklow tawi ta chepaw naia. Nahanow nachupiia en kownkow pren lakma hownia uangah now mami en kowh chup kim prakowi dang se naawr lü naawr leng chepaw naia. <verse eid="2CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 6:33" />Nakhowk khe en kowh uowi rah mukuang pren hownia en mih hawt sünta pe diah. Lusa kowi kowh maru maten naia tukla en kownkow, en kowh maru Israeluüa iawng amatni paw ringkawma hown nakram en kownkow hai ang thawpah mih mami kim dow en kowh kim chekhai pami naia tukla kownkow amatni awr lü mih iawng chang pe diah.<verse eid="2CH 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 6:34" />“Ransu-uüa hown nacham tasen kownkow en cham chinah mih khin uowi chepaw naia. Nakhowk khe amatni cham uowi rah hownia en lang kloah mih marow prakowi hai en vüi kowi kowh ang thawpah mih en kowh chup kim prakowi dang se awr lü awr leng büah chepaw naia. <verse eid="2CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 6:35" />Nakhowk khe amatni awr lü awr leng mih dow mukuang pren hownia hawt sünta pe diah, now amatni kowi tawi tangila diah.<verse eid="2CH 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 6:36" />“Chang angak dowi mih maru dow miapaw uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en kowh maru-uüa changta angak mih khin khe amatni luk kowi en sak-ih dowi kowh ransu-uüa rut kowi en nacham ap-ah chepaw naia, now amatni kowi dow atawnchow rah kowi lah, alakma rah kowi lah nachangla nar kownkow ransu-uüa nacham pawla chepaw naia. <verse eid="2CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 6:37" />Now amatni cham <char style="w">takhangra</char> pren kowi tarip kowh, ‘Anging changta angak khai, anging tawita mata khai bowt,’ pahai en tut-e awr taphuang chepaw naia. <verse eid="2CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2CH 6:38" />Now nami pren kowi plawng hown sak hown en prakowi uang dang hai amatni pipu-uüa kowi en peah mih pren pra, en lang kloah mih marow pra, en vüi kowi kowh ang thawpah mih chup kim prakowi dang se en tut-e awr lü awr leng büah chepaw naia. <verse eid="2CH 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2CH 6:39" />Nakhowk khe en uowi rah mukuang pren hownia amatni awr lü mih dow hawt sünta pe diah, en kowi kingküala mih angak changta mih en kowh maru-uüa kowi lawtta diah.<verse eid="2CH 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2CH 6:40" />“Aw ang kowh Thurai, mami arah kowi kowh uang lü uang leng kown mih prakowi en kowh mik hai param mih kawmat hownia pacham uowi reng lah.<verse eid="2CH 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2CH 6:41" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, en kowh tanaira kowi uang uowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 6:41">en kowh kür amatra, en kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kowi uang kupla bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:41">Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, en kowh uamowuüa mih lawngra tawnguat pacham khup bowt lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 6:41">en chang anging aiung mih maten rakowi en kowh naruüa pacham piaw bowt lah.<verse eid="2CH 6:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2CH 6:42" />Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, en nümnapta khowk mih mang kowi hangkow nuata diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 6:42">en kowh nar David kowi en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura en tüng pe mih ka tuakah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 6:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CH 7" />
  <para style="s">Mukuang hownia maih uang kla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 7:1" />Sawlawmawn ki chup Thurai hown krowksang mukuang pren hownia maih uang kla hanow tikah mih uanap hai akeng mih uanap kowi kowh uanh uang kamta bowk khai, now Thurai chup kim kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kraingra atekma uang uowi khai. <verse eid="2CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 7:2" />Naiawng rakowi uamowuüa dow Thurai chup kim lak kowi kownowng kup büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 7:3" />Mukuang hownia maih uang kla mih hai Thurai chup kim kowi CHAKRAMANG kraingra uang uowi mih khita hanow Israeluüa dow krawng kowi tabawk krawm se CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiiaah khai, now aia kowi tek pe awmrawm lai büah khai. Amatni tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 7:3" />
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 7:3">“Aia dow aiungma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 7:3">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai!” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2CH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Ap Thurai chup kim mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 7:4" />Nami kung kowi dow mang Sawlawmawn hai aia hown kowh Israeluüa maten mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi chang phuchua pawi khai. <verse eid="2CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 7:5" />Nami khin khe mang Sawlawmawn mih chia 22,000 pum hai ruapur 120,000 pum hown chang uanap pawi khai. Naiawng hai mang Sawlawmawn hown Israeluüa maten mih ap Thurai chup kim khai. <verse eid="2CH 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 7:6" />Nakhowk khe uamowuüa dow amatni iowngra kowi iowng khai, now Leviuüa paw CHAKRAMANG vüi nachang tünteu kownkow tünteu chang müa uanh dowkma hown amatni iowngra kowi iowng khai. Leviuüa hown tatang klowk iowng hanow uamowuüa tum baw khai, now Israeluüa dow iowngla rim khai. Naiawngün tünteu chang müa uanh dow narowsila CHAKRAMANG kownkow Leviuüa kowi David pe thawpah mih chekhai. Now naiawngün tünteu chang müa uanh dow, “CHAKRAMANG kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai,” pahai aia kiow CHAKRAMANG mih khin khe tawngah reng mih chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 7:7" />Ap Thurai chup kim mih ni khe mang Sawlawmawn mih Thurai chup kim pur kowi kowh kimpuk dawnglang kowi CHAKRAMANG vüi chimsaiah parah khai. Nami aia lang kraah mih arah kowi aia dow tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap chang pe khai, now taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh tawncher sau dow changla phuchua müa khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh uowi mih kri hown kowh phuchuara dow naiawngün phuchua maten nachang kownkow arah sowmchow chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 7:8" />Now mang Sawlawmawn hai Israeluüa maten dow ranit ni mowr chang Te Pawi khai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow maru iun lainowmma kawm khai; amatni dow Hamat süng hownia Aigupta pren kowi kowh tui kangma mih aw mowr süng maten hownia kowh uang mih chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 7:9" />Now ranit ni mowr amatni ap phuchuara mih kung kowi paw plan chang Te Pawi ranit ni khai iawk. Now pawi chur ni khe dow amatni chang Taprai Pawi khai. <verse eid="2CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 7:10" />Now pawi chur kowh auai ni dow mang Sawlawmawn mih maru maten kowi pe mangta khai bowt. Anar David kowi hai aia kowh maru Israeluüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG iungra maten peah rakowi maru maten mang Sawlawmawn kowi tekla pe awmrawm lai now awmrawmma hai apiawma kim prakowi mang büah khai bowt.<verse eid="2CH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn tut-e CHAKRAMANG uang tatüng pe mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 7:11" />Naiawng hai mang Sawlawmawn dow Thurai chup kim, aia kowh kim hai aia nau iawng nathawpah kown mih maten ki thawpta khai bowt. <verse eid="2CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 7:12" />Nami kung kowi akat khe CHAKRAMANG dow Sawlawmawn tut-e uang tatüng pe khai. Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Ang tut-e en uang lü uang leng mih ang ta khowk chekhai. Now mami chup kim dow naphuchuala ang kown mih arah ang lang ruita khowk.<verse eid="2CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 7:13" />“Ang taingta uang mih khin khe lah, nauang piak luprak kownkow ang uang chin plawng hawmh mih khin khe lah, ang maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi ang uang chin makowng hawi mih khin khe lah, <verse eid="2CH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 7:14" />ang kowh maru-uüa che khamsum khamdaw khai, ang prakowi mü hai ang tut-e awr lü awr leng khai, now angak hownia tarip büah khai hanow mukuang pren hownia ang iu sünta pe kown. Nahanow amatni kowh angak ang nalawtta pe kown, now amatni kowh pren mih auown khe kowh iawng aiungma ang naplan chang pe kown. <verse eid="2CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 7:15" />Mami chup kim kowi kowh awr lü awr leng mih dow kaneuma ang nasünta pe kown. <verse eid="2CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 7:16" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami chup kim dow ang lang kloah mih chekhai, now chowngchowng saksakma nauang chupiiala ang kownkow ang lang krata mih chekhai. Mami chup kim luk kowi dow ang kowh mik hai ang kowh sak mih atungma nauowi kown.<verse eid="2CH 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 7:17" />“En che en pa David iawng kaah sakowmma hown ang tiama kowi en mang khai, now ang kowh ana pek maten, ari arow hai ari aiang chün khai hanow <verse eid="2CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 7:18" />Israeluüa luk kowi en kowh mang chowm rah mih chowngchowng saksakma ang natow en kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami lawnguan kowi en pa David hown ang tatow sangbowk laitawm khowk. Nami sangbowk laitawm kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Israel pren mang chowm rah kowi nachowm mang kown mih maru en krungchak hownia mapaw nakhawr kown nadowi,’ pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 7:19" />“Nachenganchepaw enni che powtta ang khai, ang kowh ana pek hai ari arow chün dowi, now akeng mih thuraiuüa kowh lup cham tawi chang hai cham tawi chupiia khai hanow <verse eid="2CH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 7:20" />enni Israeluüa kowi kowh ang pe enni mih pren hownia ang naprütta enni kown. Now mami chup kim ang kowh uowi rah ang vüi ang lang klota khowk mih paw ang mik hownia ang namata pe kown. Nakhowk khe dow Israeluüa mih akeng chenchapuüa tut-e kharera hai rensi kau nachowng kown. <verse eid="2CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 7:21" />Now mami chup kim mih kawmat kri kraingma chepaw nakhowk khe dow mami ria iawng mang miuüa mih natakrow kown, now khareah se natek kown mih, ‘Tawngplawng kowchow mami pren hai mami Thurai chup kim luk kowi naiawng CHAKRAMANG tuk changah khai chow?’ napa kown. <verse eid="2CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 7:22" />Nakhowk khe akeng mih maru-uüa naklangah kown mih, ‘Naiawng CHAKRAMANG changah mih auan dow amatni pipu-uüa kowi kowh Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla mih CHAKRAMANG amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai kowi nuata büah rakowi chekhai. Amatni dow akeng thuraiuüa kowi cham chupiia hai tawi chang pe lup khai. Naiawngün piakra amatni luk kowi CHAKRAMANG uang pawla pe mih dow naiawng rakowi chowbowt,’ napape kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 7:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CH 8" />
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn changah mih akeng lup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 8:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kim hai aiamat kowh kim chang kowi 20 ning mang Sawlawmawn tating khai. <verse eid="2CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 8:2" />Nami lup chang chur kung kowi aia dow Sur pren kowi kowh mang Hiram peah mih kua maten plan thawpah khai iawk. Now naiawngün kua kowi dow Israeluüa kowi aia pe uowiah khai. <verse eid="2CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 8:3" />Nami kung kowi mang Sawlawmawn dow Hamat-Zoba marow kowi kowkowi hanow nami marow dow powngta pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 8:4" />Aia dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Tadmawr marow hai Hamat süng kowi dawngthawnguan towk rah marow plan thawpah khai. <verse eid="2CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 8:5" />Now aluk kowi kowh Bet-Hawrawn marow hai adak kowi kowh Bet-Hawrawn marow tap mih tapplawt hai aklia müa hailawm akhawtma aia thawpah khai. <verse eid="2CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 8:6" />Nami klen kowi Balat marow hai chakkham nungra marow maten, kawrnga kari hai kawrnga luk kowi kowh chowm miuüa vüi marow ün aia thawp pe khai. Aia dow Jerusalem, Lebanawn hai aia krüa kowi kowh uowi mih pren maten kowi aia nau thawpah kown mih srui krawi thawpta bowk khai.<verse eid="2CH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 8:7" />Nami khin khe paw Israel krungchak nadowi mih Hituüa, Amawruüa, Perizuüa, Hivuüa hai Jebus chenchapuüa dow pren kowi ta sing uowi reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 8:8" />Amatni kowi dow Israeluüa saita bowk dowi chekhai. Amatni kowi dow mang Sawlawmawn mih pe changah nar lup khai. Amatni dow ani mowr paw chang nar lup büah reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 8:9" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa kowi tarapdow aia pe changah nar lup dowi chekhai. Nami takcha Israeluüa kowi dow tasen mih siphai, aia kowh maru iuk, aia dak kowi kowh pren kruitown mih, aia kowh siphai aluchow, aia kowh kawrnga kari te mih hai kawrnga luk kowi kowh chowm mih siphai hawmh aia thawpah khai. <verse eid="2CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 8:10" />Nami klen kowi nar lup chang miuüa kowi kowh mingkhet mih maru iukuüa paw mang Sawlawmawn kowh dow uowi 250 ia chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 8:11" />Now Faraw chama Sawlawmawn kowh masi dow David marow hownia lawt hanow aia vüi kowi kowh mang Sawlawmawn thawp pe mih kim kowi uang uowi khai bowt. Nakhowk khe Sawlawmawn tek mih, “Ang kowh masi dow Israel mang David kowh kim kowi nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla krawi uowiah mih rah maten dow chimsaima chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 8:12" />Thurai chup kim kimpuk re-e kowh mang Sawlawmawn thawpah mih CHAKRAMANG kowh phuchuara luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap pawi chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 8:13" />Aia dow Mosi ana pek iawng Tanai Ni, Lacher Pawi hai paning kowi sum kat mih pawi chang reng chekhai. Paning kowi sum kat mih pawi dow The pe tuah dowi mih kawm Pawi, Bowthowk Pawi hai Te Pawi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 8:14" />Mang Sawlawmawn dow a-pa David ana pek iawng uamowuüa kowi natawi khowngah lup chang kownkow Leviuüa kowi athum athumchow bakah khai. Now ni towng kowh lup uowi iawng natek rowsi meng kownkow hai uamowuüa kowi natawi khowngah lup chang kownkow aia mih Leviuüa kowi towah khai. Now tapplawt towng nachawng kang kownkow kangchawng miuüa kowi athum athumchow bakah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng nachang kown mih ana dow Thurai maru David pela pe mih chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 8:15" />Uamowuüa hai Leviuüa dow uanh towk rah lawnguan kowi hai akeng mih lawnguan kowi kowh mang David kowh ana pek iawng chün büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 8:16" />Amatni dow mang Sawlawmawn kowh lup maten CHAKRAMANG chup kim vüi uown phük kimchüng hownia achur pat klangiungma changah khai. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG kowh kim thawp dow chur khai.<verse eid="2CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 8:17" />Nami kung kowi mang Sawlawmawn dow Eziawn-Geber hai Elawt pami arah kowi kowkowi khai. Naiawngün arah uowi mih dow Edawm pren kowi kowh sata pang kowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 8:18" />Mang Hiram dow chawnlawng pre sum buk hai chawnlawng te kiakma miuüa kowi mang Sawlawmawn kowi nakowsa pe kownkow aia kowh maru-uüa kowi kowchinah khai. Amatni bowkbowk dow Ofir pren kowi chawnlawng hown kowkowiah hanow mang Sawlawmawn vüi uang pawla pe kuh 16,200 set ngia khai.<verse eid="2CH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CH 9" />
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn tut-e Seba pren masiuüa mang uang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 9:1" />Seba pren kowi kowh masiuüa mang dow mang Sawlawmawn kowh ming iung nang iung tawi ta khai. Naiawng rakowi nami masiuüa mang dow Sawlawmawn kowi nauang chaingah kownkow uang khai. Aia dow maru kawm hai ut hawmh ün uang pawla now Jerusalem marow kowi uang khai. Ut luk kowi dow nam iungma mih chap, kuh hai asung khakma mih hua ahuma aia uang pawla khai. Aia dow mang Sawlawmawn tut-e uang ting hanow aia sak kowi kowh lüntakra uowi mih maten lüntaah khai. <verse eid="2CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 9:2" />Now Sawlawmawn dow nami masiuüa uang lüntaah mih maten hawt tek pe khai. Aia nowng klangah dowi mih akratma mih tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 9:3" />Nahanow nami masiuüa mang dow Sawlawmawn chanlaima pami tuk khai bowt. Aia dow Sawlawmawn thawpah mih mang kim paw khi khai. <verse eid="2CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 9:4" />Nami klen kowi pawitang kowi kowh chakkham ün, aia maru iukuüa kowh uowi rah ün, aia maru-uüa khupah mih tawnguat klangiungma mih ün, aia kowh tui pek mih maru-uüa kowi ün hai CHAKRAMANG kim kowi changla tikah mih uanap mih tawncher hu mih ün paw nami masiuüa mang khila khai. Naiawngün khita hanow aia dow awda khai.<verse eid="2CH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 9:5" />Mang Sawlawmawn kowi aia tek pe mih, “Ang matia pren kowi ang uowi khe kowh en kowh lup hai en kowh chanlaira lawnguan kowi ang ta mih na khai nowm! <verse eid="2CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 9:6" />Nachenganchepaw makowi uangah khükhü ang mik hown ang uang khi dowi matchang naiawngün lawnguan ang owm dowi chekhai. En lawnguan kowi kowh ang tawi taah mih dow dawnglang khowm uowi dowi tak chekhai. En kowh chanlaira hai dawngthawnguan dow maru uang tek ang mih lak-e lang hu chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 9:7" />En kowh maru iukuüa dow lainowmma kaucha iuk! Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow en pur uowi reng chekhai, now en kowh chanlaira laiklow ta reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 9:8" />CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai dow akiow pauowi lah. Aia dow awmrawm en kowh Israel kowi kowh mang chowm rah kowi pe chowm en khai. Aia dow Israeluüa kowi chowngchowng saksakma sakrauah reng rakowi tara nowm hai achinawmma nauowila reng kownkow thawp en mang mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 9:9" />Seba pren mang mih mang Sawlawmawn kowi kuh 100 mawn lak-e hu, nam iungma mih chap hai asung khakma mih hua ün ahuma peah khai. Nam iungma mih chap mang Sawlawmawn kowi Seba pren mang peah mih iawng iung mih pren kowi katpaw khi dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 9:10" />(Nami klen kowi Hiram kowh chawnlawngün dow Ofir hownia kuh ün uang pawla pe khai. Now almuk singh hai asung khakma mih uanh ün uang pawla khai. <verse eid="2CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 9:11" />Mang Sawlawmawn dow naiawngün almuk singh mih CHAKRAMANG kim hai mang kim vüi changla achüng khai, now meng sarauüa vüi tingteng hai taraw paw aia thawpla khai. Naiawng khowt mih almuk singh hu dow ani mowr kowi katpaw pren kowi uang pawla dowi tak chekhai, khi paw khi dowi tak chekhai).<verse eid="2CH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 9:12" />Mang Sawlawmawn mih Seba pren masiuüa mang lüah mih maten peah khai. Aia kowi nami masiuüa uang peah mih lak-e nami masiuüa kowi aia peah mih lang hu chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow masiuüa mang mih aia kowh maru-uüa hown aiamat pren kowi kowmang khai bowt.<verse eid="2CH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn kowh dawngthawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 9:13" />Ning towng mang Sawlawmawn tut-e kuh uang ting reng mih dow 25,000 set ngia chi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 9:14" />Nami klen kowi kun chang miuüa, Arab pren manguüa hai Israel pren kowi kowh kruitown miuüa hownia paw kuh hai tai uang ting reng chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="2CH 9:15-16" />Mang Sawlawmawn dow phengah mih kuh hown kawngma aiukma mih 200 klüng hai achachow mih 300 klüng thawpla khai. Naiawngün aiukma mih kawngma lowk kowi kuh lakke mih dow raiat set ngia chi, now kawngma achachow mih kowi dow lowk kowi pre set ngia chi chekhai. Naiawngün dow Lebanawn Kaurawng Kim kowi aia towah khai.<verse eid="2CH 9:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 9:17" />Akung kowi mang Sawlawmawn mih ngasai sa hown mang chowm rah aiukma mih thawp lowk khai, now nami mang chowm rah dow kuh achangma mih hown sowah khai. <verse eid="2CH 9:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="2CH 9:18-19" />Nami mang chowm rah dow apün müa abowk uowi taruk bowk chekhai. Nami chowm rah pur kowi dow khawk tangra uowi lowk chekhai. Naiawngün abowk towng mapra ret lowk paipra ret lowk chi krangsi rup uowi laipre buk chekhai. Nami mang chowm rah kung pra kowh tane müa aluk prakowi dow uilumma chekhai. Now chowm rah hawmlawm pra hai lakuai prakowi dow bawng tangra uowi chekhai, now bawng tangra ria kowi dow krangsi rup iowng dawnglawng chekhai. Naiawng mih mang chowm rah dow akeng pren kowi miapaw thawp dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 9:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 9:20" />Sawlawmawn kowh tui kham bia dow kuh hown kowh thawpah mih kangowh chekhai. Now Lebanawn Kaurawng Kim kowi kowh pu bia aikam paw achangma mih kuh hown kowh thawpah mih kangowh chekhai. Mang Sawlawmawn chowm mang mih khin khe dow tai mih mapaw asung uowi dowi. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh dow tai hown kowh thawpah mih uanh tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 9:21" />Mang Sawlawmawn kowh chawnlawng paw cham tawi chang kun kownkow mang Hiram kowh chawnlawng hown cham tawi kowi reng chekhai. Mang Hiram kowh chawnlawng te miuüa mih mang Sawlawmawn kowh chawnlawng te miuüa kowi tawi khowng te pe chawnlawng reng chekhai. Naiawngün chawnlawng dow sum ning e pakat chi uang plan hanow kuh, tai, ngasai sa, iuk hai uahaw ün uang pawla reng chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 9:22" />Naiawng rakowi mang Sawlawmawn dow lusa kowi kowh akeng mih manguüa maten lak-e lang kureng hai lang chanlai chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 9:23" />Sawlawmawn kowi kowh Thurai peah mih chanlaira hownia kowh laiklow nauang tawi sünta kownkow pren maten hownia manguüa uang khai. <verse eid="2CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 9:24" />Uang miuüa maten dow kuh uanh tai uanh, khupdip tawngklai, tasen müa rutchün khawkleng, nam iungma mih chap, kawrnga hai kawrngaramchük ün mang Sawlawmawn vüi uang pawla pe reng chekhai. Aia dow naiawng ning towng hawt ka reng chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 9:25" />Naiawng hai Sawlawmawn kowh dow kawrnga kari hai kawrnga mih ahuma uowi khai. Aia kowh kawrnga kawm dow 12,000 pum chekhai. Naiawngün kowi dow kawrnga kari towk rah marow kowi ne, now aia uowi rah Jerusalem marow kowi ne aia towah khai. <verse eid="2CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 9:26" />Aia dow Iufratis aw hownia Filistinuüa kowh pren hai Aigupta pren sünghi mowr kowi kowh mang uowi mih maten luk kowi aia kruitownah khai. <verse eid="2CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 9:27" />Mang Sawlawmawn chowm mang mih khin khe Jerusalem marow kowi kowh tai hu krang dow hua iawng towbowt, now sidar sing hu krang paw awkaw kowi kowh uidut singh iawng towbowt. <verse eid="2CH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 9:28" />Now mang Sawlawmawn kowh kawrnga dow Aigupta pren hownia hai akeng pren hownia kowh uang pawla mih chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Sawlawmawn kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 9:29" />Mang Sawlawmawn changah mih lup lawnguan maten dow chabowih sum buk mih kowi arui uowi chekhai. Naiawngün dow Risi Nathan ruiah mih bowih, Silo marow hownia kowh Ahija ruiah mih bowih hai Nebat kowh chapa mang Jeroboam lawnguan kowi kowh risi Ido kowh mukmang bowih kowi arui uowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 9:30" />Mang Sawlawmawn dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Israel chenchap maten luk kowi 40 ning mowr chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 9:31" />Nami kung kowi aia dow kowng hanow David marow kowi maru dupah khai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Rehoboam mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2CH 9:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CH 10" />
  <para style="s">Mang Rehoboam kowi Israel hamüt chenchap kingküaah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 10:1" />Rehoboam kowi nathawpah mang kownkow Israeluüa maten mih Sekem marow kowi kowkowi khai. Naiawng rakowi Rehoboam paw Sekem kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="2CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 10:2" />Rehoboam chowm mang kown mih satang tata hown krowksang Nebat kowh chapa Jeroboam dow Aigupta pren hownia uang plan khai bowt. (Aigupta pren kowi Jeroboam cham uowi mih dow Sawlawmawn hownia cham powt rakowi chekhai). <verse eid="2CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 10:3" />Tawngphak pra kowh Israeluüa dow Jeroboam kowi kowhawah khai, now amatni bowkbowk dow mang Rehoboam tut-e kowkowiah hanow tek pe mih, <verse eid="2CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 10:4" />“En pa Sawlawmawn dow sing uowi reng tak khe lup akratma mih kür hown pe chang anging reng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw en dow anging luk kowi kowh akratma mih lup eta anging nown diah. Nahanow anging nachang en lup reng kown taih,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2CH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 10:5" />Nakhowk khe Rehoboam klangah mih, “Pe ang khin büah sum ni diah, ang paw pe tuak tak. Sum ni kowh ni khe uang büah iawk,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa dow plan mang khai.<verse eid="2CH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 10:6" />Now Rehoboam mih a-pa Sawlawmawn chowng khe kowh prengia pek mih lawngtang aluchowuüa tut-e krawi paw prengia khai. Lawngtanguüa kowi aia lüntaah mih, “Maru kawmuüa kowi tawng iawng chow ang naklangah kown? Pe ang prengia büa madiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 10:7" />Nakhowk khe lawngtang aluchowuüa tek pe mih, “En che amatni kowi saksing sanaah khai, now amatni kowi che klangiungma en klowpah klangah khai hanow amatni dow atungma nachang en nar lup reng kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 10:8" />Nachenganchepaw Rehoboam dow lawngtang aluchowuüa kowh prengia laiklow chün dowi chekhai. Aia dow aia hown asawn sang mih aia kowh prengia pek mih auiuauüa tut-e krawi paw prengia khai. <verse eid="2CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 10:9" />Aia kowh prengia pek mih klanguüa hawmh kowi aia tek pe mih, “Maru kawmuüa tek ang mih, ‘En pa pe chang anging mih lup akratma mih eta anging nown diah,’ pakhai. Nami lawnguan kowi tawng iawng chow enni pe ang prengia kown? Maru kawmuüa kowi tawng iawng chow a-i naklangah kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 10:10" />Nakhowk khe klanguüa hawmh tek pe mih, “Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘Apa kowh kelang lak-e ang kowh rut chah lang iuk. <verse eid="2CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 10:11" />Apa pe chang enni mih lup klen kowi ahuma tak ang pe chang enni kown. Apa dow leng hown taih tak hup enni. Tawkche ang dow chuh uowi mih lawngha leng hown ang nahup enni kown,’ pape bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 10:12" />Now mang kowh laiklow iawng sum ni kowh ni dow Jeroboam hai Israeluüa maten mih Rehoboam tut-e kowkowi khai iawk. <verse eid="2CH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 10:13" />Nakhowk khe mang Rehoboam dow lawngtang aluchowuüa kowh prengia pek nuata hanow maru kawmuüa kowi angakma klangah khai. <verse eid="2CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 10:14" />Aia dow klanguüa hawm kowh prengia pek iawng tek pe maru kawmuüa mih, “Apa pe chang enni mih lup klen kowi ahuma tak ang nape chang enni kown. Apa dow leng hown taih tak hup enni. Tawkche ang dow chuh uowi mih lawngha leng hown ang nahup enni kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="2CH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 10:15" />Naiawng hai mang Rehoboam dow maru kawmuüa kowh laiklow sünta pe dowi chekhai. Naiawng phaw mih dow CHAKRAMANG pe phawah kowh chekhai. Nami dow Nebat chapa Jeroboam lawnguan kowi kowh Silo marowchak risi Ahija tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow iawng uang tachih mih chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh pren tabak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 10:16" />Mang Rehoboam mih amatni kowh laiklow sünta pe kown nadowi pami tukta hanow Israeluüa tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 10:16" />
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">“David luk kowi tawngpaw a-i kowh alow uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 10:16">Jese chapa tut-e tawngpaw a-i kowh kakbak uowi dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">Aw Israeluüa, chowlowkkow kim kowi plan büa diah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 10:16">Aw Rehoboam, en matia krungchakuüa kowi ta kruitown bowt!” pabüah khai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 10:16" />
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 10:16">Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa dow chowlowkkow kim kowi plan bowk khai. <verse eid="2CH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 10:17" />Rehoboam nimkrüa kowi ta uowi mih dow Juda krungchakuüa marow kowi kowh Israeluüa krowngchow towbowt.<verse eid="2CH 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 10:18" />Adoniram dow kür hown maru kawmuüa kowi pe changah lup mih kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. Israeluüa kowi nauang planla kownkow Adoniram kowi mang Rehoboam kowchinah chowdiah. Tawkche Adoniram kowi kowng pat hua hown maru kawmuüa hawt kuakah khai. Naiawng rakowi mang Rehoboam dow alenma aia kowh kawrnga kari kowi pün now Jerusalem marow kowi powt khai. <verse eid="2CH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 10:19" />Naiawng hai tawngphak pra kowh Israeluüa dow ani mowr David krungchakuüa kowi kingküaah reng chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CH 11" />
  <para style="s">Rehoboam kowi risi Semaia hangah tasen mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 11:1" />Rehoboam dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowting hanow Juda krungchakuüa hai Benjamin krungchakuüa maten kowi kuaah khai. Now siphai lang iung miuüa kowi 180,000 ia aia lang ruiah khai. Naiawng aia chang mih dow tawngphak pra kowh Israeluüa kowi senah hanow amatni kowh pren aia powngta pe kown nau rakowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 11:2" />Nachenganchepaw risi Semaia kowi Thurai uang tek pe mih, <verse eid="2CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 11:3" />“Juda pren mang Sawlawmawn kowh chapa Rehoboam, Juda krungchakuüa, Benjamin krungchakuüa maten hai akeng miuüa maten kowi en natek pe kown mih, <verse eid="2CH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 11:4" />‘Enni kowh tainau Israeluüa hown nakowtasen kownkow hangkow tarü büa diah; enni mih chowlowkkow kim kowi plan büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maiawng phaw mih dow ang nauah kowh chekhai,’ pape diah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng Jeroboam hown tasen dowi kowi kim prakowi plan bowk khai.<verse eid="2CH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rehoboam krawi chang tap mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 11:5" />Rehoboam dow Jerusalem marow kowi ta uowi khai. Aia dow Juda krungchakuüa hai Benjamin krungchakuüa kowh marow kowi akhawtma krawi chang pe tap khai. <verse eid="2CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 11:6" />Naiawngün marow dow Bethlehem, Etam, Tekoa, <verse eid="2CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 11:7" />Betzur, Soko, Adulam, <verse eid="2CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 11:8" />Gat, Maresa, Zif, <verse eid="2CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 11:9" />Adoraim, Lakhis, Azeka, <verse eid="2CH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 11:10" />Zora, Aijalawn hai Hebrawn chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 11:11" />Naiawngün marow dow akhikhawtma aia changah khai, now naiawngün arah towng kowi dow siphai aluchowuüa kowi aia tow pe khai. Now naiawngünuüa vüi dow chakkham, kanrawn sau hai grep tui aia tow pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 11:12" />Nami klen kowi naiawngün marow nakhawtla ngamlam kownkow marow towng kawngma hai reh ün aia krawi tow pe khai. Naiawng hai Juda krungchakuüa hai Benjamin krungchakuüa dow aia nimkrüa kowi uowi khai.<verse eid="2CH 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi uamowuüa hai Leviuüa uang powt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 11:13" />Israel pren kowi kowh uamowuüa maten hai Leviuüa maten dow Rehoboam kowi tangila rakowi aia tut-e Juda pren kowi uang büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 11:14" />Jeroboam hai aia kung kowi kowh uang ta uowi mih Israel pren manguüa dow Leviuüa kowi pe changah uamow lup dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Leviuüa dow amatni kowh marow hai tawncher thing rah dowm ta towla hanow Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow kowi uang powt büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 11:15" />Jeroboam dow arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi nape changah uamow lup kownkow aia nau mih maru kowi towah khai. Naiawngün uamowuüa dow Jeroboam thawpah mih chia chah rup kowi chupiia khai.<verse eid="2CH 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 11:16" />Israel krungchakuüa maten hownia CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowi süngürma hown cham miuüa dow Leviuüa hown Jerusalem marow kowi uang tawi powt khai. Naiawngün Israeluüa uang tawi mih dow CHAKRAMANG amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai vüi naia chang phuchua kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 11:17" />Amatni rakowi sum ning mowr dow Juda pren hai Sawlawmawn kowh chapa Rehoboam kowh mangra mih akhikhawtma uang phaw khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami sum ning mowr dow amatni mih David hai Sawlawmawn tiama kowi mang reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rehoboam kimchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 11:18" />Rehoboam dow Mahalat hown tachawng khai. Mahalat kowh pa dow David chapa Jerimawt chekhai, now aia kowh u Abihail dow Jese chapa Eliab chama chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 11:19" />Mahalat hown kowh Rehoboam kaah mih chapauüa dow Jeus, Semaria hai Zaham büah chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 11:20" />Akung kowi Rehoboam dow Absalawm chama Maka hown plan tachawng khai. Maka hown kowh aia kaah mih chapauüa dow Abija, Atai, Ziza hai Selomit büah chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 11:21" />Rehoboam kowh dow masi 18 ia, changla masi mih narma 60 ia, chapa 28 ia hai chama 60 ia chekhai. Naiawngün masi hai changla masi mih narmauüa pungmadawng kowi Absalawm chama Maka kowi aia lang sakrauah khai.<verse eid="2CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 11:22" />Rehoboam dow Maka chapa Abija kowi atainau-uüa pungmadawng kowi aluchow thawpah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kung kowi nauang ta chowm mang kown mih Abija kowi aia nau rakowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 11:23" />Aia dow chanlaima hown achapauüa kowi peah kurdik hanow Juda krungchakuüa süng hai Benjamin krungchakuüa süng kowi kowh tap uowi mih marow kowi cham chinah ne khai. Now amatni kowi dow chakkham ahuma aia peah khai, now masi akawmma aia paw pe khai.<verse eid="2CH 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CH 12" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowi mang Sisek senah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 12:1" />Akung kowi Rehoboam chowm mang mih anikma mih khin khe hai aia uang kür ngamlam mih khin khe aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ari aiang nuata khai, now Israeluüa maten paw aia kung tawi krawi khai. <verse eid="2CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 12:2" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG luk kowi owmsak dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Rehoboam chowm mang mih tanga ning khe Aigupta pren mang Sisek dow Jerusalem marow mih uang senah khai. <verse eid="2CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 12:3" />Aigupta pren hownia mang Sisek uang tarü mih khin khe aia hown kowh tawi uowi mih dow kawrnga kari 1,200 hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih siphai 60,000 ia chekhai. Nami klen kowi Libia siphaiuüa, Sukawt siphaiuüa hai Ethiawpia siphaiuüa paw aia hown tawi uowi khai. <verse eid="2CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 12:4" />Juda pren kowi kowh tap tapat lut mih marow ün aia powngta pe mih dow Jerusalem marow mowr uang towm khai bowt.<verse eid="2CH 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 12:5" />Nakhowk khe Juda aluchowuüa dow mang Sisek kowi kram rakowi Jerusalem marow kowi uang takua talawm khai. Nakhowk khe risi Semaia dow Rehoboam hai Juda aluchowuüa tut-e uangah now tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Enni nuata ang khai. Naiawng rakowi ang paw kawmat mih mang Sisek rut kowi ang apta enni khowk,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 12:6" />Nahanow mang Rehoboam hai Israel aluchowuüa dow khamsum khai bowt. Now tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG dow tara nowm chet mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 12:7" />Now CHAKRAMANG dow amatni khamsum mih khi hanow risi Semaia kowi uang tek pe mih, “Amatni uang khamsum mih dow ang khi khowk. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow ang napiakah kown nadowi bowt; amatni kowh ripra dow ang na-eta pe nown kown. Jerusalem marow luk kowi kowh ang kowh kunmaraura maten ang nahüngah kown mih dow mang Sisek kowi ang natawngah kown nadowi. <verse eid="2CH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 12:8" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow Sisek nimkrüa kowi nauowi kown. Nahanow amatni dow ang vüi lup chang krang hai akeng manguüa vüi lup chang krang tawng iawng chow lang mih natuk büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 12:9" />Now Aigupta pren mang Sisek dow CHAKRAMANG kim hai mang kim kowi kowh uowi mih dawngthawnguan maten pawla bowk khai. Aia dow kuh hown kowh Sawlawmawn thawpah mih kawngma ün khowm padow pawla bowk khai. <verse eid="2CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 12:10" />Naiawng rakowi mang Rehoboam dow kuh hown kowh kawngma takcha kowi kri hown kawngma mih thawpah khai. Now naiawngün kawngma nachawng kownkow aia dow mang kimplawt chawng mih siphaiuüa kowi peah kurdik khai. <verse eid="2CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 12:11" />CHAKRAMANG kim kowi mang kowkowi mih khin khe kangchawng mih siphaiuüa dow naiawngün kawngma dowkla se mang tut-e tawi reng chekhai. Now akung kowi amatni dow naiawngün kawngma mih kangchawngra kim kowi uang towah büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 12:12" />Mang Rehoboam khamsum khai rakowi aia luk kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura dow taing khai, now aia dow asaima pat piakah dowi chekhai. Nakhowk khe paw Juda pren kowi mih tawngbak mih arah kowi dow aiungma tak chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 12:13" />Now Jerusalem kowi chowm mang mih dow Sawlawmawn kowh chapa Rehoboam chekhai. Aia dow 41 ning khe chowm mang khai, now aia dow lairanit ning mowr chowmla mang khai. Nami khin khe aia dow aia kowh mangra mih pani kowh pani akhawtma changah khai. Israel chenchapuüa kowh arah maten hownia CHAKRAMANG aiamat nauowiah kownkow kloah mih dow Jerusalem marow chekhai. Rehoboam kowh u dow Amawnuüa chenchap Naima chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 12:14" />Mang Rehoboam dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow CHAKRAMANG naukrang tuk kown nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 12:15" />Mang Rehoboam kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan dow auown hownia chur pat risi Semaia ruiah mih bowih kowi hai risi Ido ruiah mih ming tang bowih kowi arui uowi chekhai. Now Rehoboam kowh siphai hawmh hai Jeroboam kowh siphai hawmh dow atungma tasen reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 12:16" />Akung kowi Rehoboam dow kowng hanow a-pa David marow kowi maru dupah khai. Aia takcha dow achapa Abija mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2CH 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CH 13" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren mang hai Israel pren mang tasen mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 13:1" />Juda pren kowi Abija chowm mang mih dow Israel pren kowi Jeroboam chowm mang mih lairaiat ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 13:2" />Abija mih Jerusalem marow kowi sum ning mowr chowm mang khai. A-u dow Gibeah marowchak Uriel kowh chama Mikhai chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 13:2">Akung kowi Abija hai Israel pren mang Jeroboam iüah dow tadowk tasen khai. <verse eid="2CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 13:3" />Nami tasen kowi Abija pawla siphai mih dow tasen kiakma mih 400,000 ia chekhai, now Jeroboam pawla siphai mih dow tasen kiakma mih 800,000 ia chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 13:4" />Nakhowk khe Efraimuüa süng kowi kowh Zemaraim hungh kowi kowiowngah now Abija tek mih, “Jeroboam hai Israeluüa maten ang laiklow sünta büa diah. <verse eid="2CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 13:5" />Israel pren mangra David hai aia krungchakuüa kowi chowngchowng saksakma vüi napeah kownkow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai mih akhawtma takhamta khowk mih enni tuk khowk nadowi bow? <verse eid="2CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 13:6" />Nachenganchepaw David kowh chapa Sawlawmawn kowi Nebat kowh chapa Jeroboam mih kingküaah khai. Aia dow Sawlawmawn kowh maru iuk chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 13:7" />Aia dow aia kowh maru asung uowi dowi miuüa kowi kuaah lawmah hanow Sawlawmawn kowh chapa Rehoboam kowi kingküaah khai. Nami khin khe Rehoboam dow klanguüa krowngchow, now tukra paw a-echow taih tak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Rehoboam dow amatni kowi nowng hangah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 13:8" />“Now David krungchak kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih pren kowi kawmat enni paw kingküaah khai. Enni kowh siphai hawmh dow akawmma chekhai nowm, now enni kowh thurai nachowng kownkow Jeroboam thawpah mih kuh hown kowh chia chah rup paw uowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 13:9" />Enni dow chang uamow lup mih Arawn kowh chapauüa hai Leviuüa kowi enni prütta khai, now akeng chenchapuüa iawng kowmatia vüi iawngpa mih maru-uüa kowi enni peah uamow rah khai. Lowra mih maru kowi uang pawla chia chah apum hai ruapur ranit pum mih kowi dow Thurai ching nadowi mih thuraiuüa kowh uamow lup enni pe changah khai.<verse eid="2CH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 13:10" />“Nachenganchepaw anging dow naiawng nadowi chekhai. Anging kowh Thurai dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih. Anging dow CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai kowi anging nuata dowi. Anging kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh lup chang miuüa dow Arawn krungchakuüa hai Leviuüa chowtaih. <verse eid="2CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 13:11" />Anging kowh uamowuüa dow ni towng rau-e hai iak prakowi CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap chang reng hai nam iungma mih maikhük towk reng chekhai. Amatni dow chimsaita mih pawitang luk kowi chimsaima mih kawm tow pe reng, now ni towng iak prakowi kuh hown kowh maibu towngh kowi towk maibu reng. Anging dow CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai ana pek iawng chang lup reng. Nachenganchepaw enni dow aia kowi nuata khai. <verse eid="2CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 13:12" />Anging tut-e dow Thurai tawi uowi; aia dow anging kowh aluchow chekhai. Enni hown natadowk tasen kownkow tum baw hanow nahaw anging kown mih aia kowh uamowuüa dow anging tut-e tawi uowi chekhai. Aw Israeluüa, CHAKRAMANG enni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai hown hangkow tasen diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami tasen kowi dow enni nanowng kown nadowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 13:13" />Nachenganchepaw Jeroboam dow aia kowh siphai pathum kowi Judauüa kung prakowi kowchinah khai. Nahanow amatni kowh siphaiuüa dow Judauüa kung prakowi uowi pathum, now pur prakowi uowi pathum khai. <verse eid="2CH 13:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="2CH 13:14-15" />Nami khin khe Judauüa dow kung pra hai pur prakowi Israel siphaiuüa uowi mih khi büah khai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e nguk hown kar hown lü khowng büah khai, now uamowuüa mih tum baw khai bowt. Nami kung kowi dow Juda siphaiuüa mih atünma hekla se Abija kruitownra krüa kowi Israeluüa senah khai. Naiawng hai Thurai mih Jeroboam hai Israeluüa maten kowi pe sumah khai. <verse eid="2CH 13:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 13:16" />Naiawng rakowi Israel siphaiuüa dow Juda siphaiuüa pur hownia powt khai. Israel siphaiuüa kowi mih Judauüa rut kowi CHAKRAMANG ap-ah khai. <verse eid="2CH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 13:17" />Nami khin khe Abija hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow Israel siphaiuüa kowi ahuma saita khai. Nakhe Israeluüa kowh tasen kiakma mih siphaiuüa nget kowng 500,000 ia chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 13:18" />Naiawng hai Israeluüa dow Judauüa tut-e sum khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Judauüa dow CHAKRAMANG amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai luk kowi neplawng nesak khai.<verse eid="2CH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 13:19" />Abija hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow Jeroboam kowi kawikrawiah hanow Bethel marow, Jesana marow, Efrawn marow hai naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten krawi powngta pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 13:20" />Abija chowm mang mowr dow Jeroboam mih aia kowh mangra akhawtma ia uowi dowi bowt chekhai. Now akung kowi CHAKRAMANG uang ripah hanow aia dow kowng khai bowt. <verse eid="2CH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 13:21" />Nachenganchepaw Abija dow uang kür ngamlam khai. Aia kowh dow masi uowi laitali ma, chapa uowi pirmi laipre ia, now chama uowi laitaruk ia chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 13:22" />Abija kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan hai aia tekah mih laiklow maten dow Risi Ido Ruiah Mih Bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2CH 14" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Asa chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 14:1" />Akung kowi Abija dow kowng hanow David marow kowi maru dupah khai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Asa mih ta chowm mang khai. Asa chowm mang mih khin khe hamüt ning mowr dow Juda pren kowi thaulangma chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 14:2" />Asa dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 14:3" />Aia dow prenlang arup aren phuchuara ün, arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara hai changla phuchua mih hua ün aia krawi piakta khai, now Asera limpu ün paw aia krawi kripta khai. <verse eid="2CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 14:4" />Now Judauüa kowi aia tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG enni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai kowi cham büa diah, now aia kowh ari arow hai aia kowh ana pek mih chün büa diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="2CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 14:5" />Juda pren kowi kowh marow towng kowi arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara hai maikhük towk müa phuchuara ün aia krawi piakta khai. Now Juda pren dow aia nimkrüa kowi thaulangma chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 14:6" />Asa chowm mang mih khin khe Judauüa kowi dow Thurai peah prasi rakowi amatni mih thaulangma uowi khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Judauüa kowh marow mih krawi rawah khai.<verse eid="2CH 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 14:7" />Judauüa kowi aia tek pe mih, “Chu, a-i thawp marow hai ariaret kowi a-i krawi thawp tap diah sik. Now nami tap kowi kimkrowng, tapplawt hai aklia müa akhawtma thawpah diah sik. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai nau iawng a-i chang reng chekhai, now aia dow ransu-uüa maten hownia pe a-i thaulangra khai,” pakhai. Naiawng hai amatni dow naiawngün lup chang mih krawi churta khai.<verse eid="2CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 14:8" />Juda krungchak hownia mang Asa kowh kawngma iuk dowk mih hai reh dowk mih siphai dow 300,000 ia chekhai, now Benjamin krungchak hownia kawngma hai leba dowk mih siphai dow 280,000 ia chekhai. Naiawngün siphaiuüa dow tasen kiakma kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ethiawpiauüa kowi Judauüa senah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 14:9" />Nami kung kowi Ethiawpia pren hownia Zera dow Judauüa kowi nauang senah kownkow siphai 1,000,000 ia hai kawrnga kari 300 klüng hown Maresa marow mowr uang büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 14:10" />Now mang Asa paw aia kowh siphaiuüa hown nakowdowk tasen kownkow kowtarü khai. Nahanow pre thumchak maru-uüa dow nadowk tasen kownkow Maresa marow re-e kowh Zefatha lawngrawi kowi kamrüt büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 14:11" />Nami khin khe Asa chup Thurai mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, akürma mih maru rut hownia kür uowi dowi mih maru kowi nowng khowng mih dow en chowtaih. En klen kowi dow miapaw nowng khowng mih uowi dowi bowt. Aw CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai, khowng anging diah. Anging dow en luk kowi neplawng nesak reng chekhai, now en ming hown nadowk tasen kownkow anging uang mih chekhai. Aw CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai, mia iawng mih maru kowi en luk kowi hangkow pe awngah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 14:12" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG dow Asa hai Judauüa tut-e Ethiawpia siphaiuüa kowi pe sumah khai. Nahanow Ethiawpiauüa dow Judauüa hownia powt büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 14:13" />Nakhowk khe Asa hai aia kowh siphai hawmuüa dow Ethiawpia siphaiuüa kowi Gerar marow mowr kawikrawiah khai, now Ethiawpiauüa kowi dow ahuma saiah khai. Naiawng rakowi Ethiawpiauüa dow nadowkla tasen kown mih kür hing uowi dowi bowt chekhai. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG hai aia kowh siphaiuüa pur kowi hing chum khai. Nahanow Judauüa dow amatni kala mih uanh ahuma uang pawla khai. <verse eid="2CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 14:14" />Judauüa dow Gerar marow riaret kowi kowh kua uowi mih maten krawi nowng piakta bowk khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Gerar marow riaret kowi kowh kuachakuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi lainowmma kram khai. Now nami kua kowi dow napawah kown mih dawngthawnguan ahuma uowi khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow nami kua hownia ahuma dawngthawnguan uang pawla khai. <verse eid="2CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 14:15" />Nami klen kowi tawncher thing miuüa kowh tangbung paw piakta pe bowk khai, now amatni kowh ruapur hawmh, rua hawmh hai ut hawmh mih ahuma uang pawla pe khai. Nami kung kowi amatni dow Jerusalem kowi uang plan büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2CH 15" />
  <para style="s">Mang Asa kowh lup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 15:1" />Thurai kowh lümla dow Obed kowh chapa Azaria luk kowi uang ting khai. <verse eid="2CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 15:2" />Nakhowk khe Azaria dow mang Asa hown nakowtakrum kownkow kowkowi khai. Now aia tek pe Asa mih, “Aw Asa, aw Juda hai Benjamin krungchakuüa maten, ang laiklow sünta büa diah. CHAKRAMANG tut-e enni uowi mowr CHAKRAMANG paw enni tut-e natawi uowi kown. Aia kowi che enni krawi cham khai hanow aia kowi enni nakrum kown. Tawkchedow aia kowi che enni nuata khai hanow aia paw nanuata enni kown. <verse eid="2CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 15:3" />Israeluüa hown dow Thurai ching tawi uowi dowi mih akrama khowk chekhai: Amatni tut-e dow Thurai lai tüngsang mih uamowuüa hai Thurai kowh ari aiang uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 15:4" />Nachenganchepaw akrat pusa hown amatni uowi mih khin khe dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai prakowi uang plan büah hanow Thurai kowi krawi cham büah khai, now amatni dow Thurai kowi krum büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 15:5" />Nami khin khe dow cham mang cham kat kown mih mapaw <char style="w">thaulang</char> dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow arah maten kowi dow mapaw thaulangra uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 15:6" />Chenchapuüa mih lowkkowlowk chenchap kowi tachang anowng apowng khai, now marow ün lowkkowlowk marow krawi tapiak khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow piakra maiow hown Thurai towkah ngare khai. <verse eid="2CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 15:7" />Tawkchedow enni mih sakkhawtma uowiah büa diah, hangkow sak piak büa diah. Enni changah mih lup sung dow enni naka kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 15:8" />Risi Azaria kowh naiawngün laiklow tata hanow Asa dow ka sakkraingra khai. Now aia dow Juda hai Benjamin süng hownia, aia powngah mih Efraim hungma mawng süng kowi kowh marow ün hownia suiiai kaniaima mih arup aren maten piakta bowk khai. Now aia dow CHAKRAMANG kim kimpuk re-e kowh towah mih CHAKRAMANG kowh phuchuara rawah khai.<verse eid="2CH 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 15:9" />Nami kung kowi Asa dow Juda hai Benjamin süng maru maten kowi arasang kuaah lawmah khai. Nami klen kowi aia dow Efraim, Manase hai Simiawn krungchak maru-uüa kowi paw kuala khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Asa tut-e CHAKRAMANG Thurai tawi uowi mih tuk hanow Israel hownia kowh maru dow powt hanow Juda pren mang Asa prakowi akawmma uang tawi tabawng khai.<verse eid="2CH 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 15:10" />Naiawngün maru-uüa Jerusalem marow kowi uang takua talawm mih dow Asa chowm mang mih laitanga ning nga kowi kowh sum la khe chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 15:11" />Nami khin khe amatni dow amatni uang rupla mih uanh hownia chiala 700 pum hai ruapur 7,000 pum CHAKRAMANG vüi phuchua büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 15:12" />Now amatni dow takham se tek mih, “Sak maiow hown CHAKRAMANG anging pipu-uüa kowh Thurai kowi anging nacham kown; <verse eid="2CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 15:13" />aiuk asowm lah, kachakuüa masiuüa lah CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai low iawng uowi dowi mih kowi dow nasaita kown,” pabüah khai. <verse eid="2CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 15:14" />Naiawng hai amatni dow howla se hai tumla baw se CHAKRAMANG tut-e atün atünma kham sawi büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 15:15" />Nami sawi kham rakowi Juda prenchakuüa maten dow awmrawm khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami sawi kham dow sak maiow hown kowh amatni khamah mih chekhai. Amatni dow Thurai kowi cham büah khai rakowi Thurai kowi ka büah khai. Now CHAKRAMANG dow bowkbowk prakowi amatni kowi peah thaulangra khai.<verse eid="2CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 15:16" />Mang Asa pa kowh u Maka dow suiiai kaniaima mih Asera limpu thawp khai rakowi aia kowi dow mangra hownia Asa klata khai. Now nami Asera limpu dow kripta naknak hanow Kidrawn lawngrawi kowi cham pawla now cham tikah khai. <verse eid="2CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 15:17" />Asa dow Israel pren kowi kowh arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara piakta dowi chepaw chownglawng prat CHAKRAMANG luk kowi kowh aia kowh ringkawra saktuak mih atekma chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 15:18" />Thurai vüi kowi kowh a-pa Abija matchi lang towah mih kuh, tai hai akeng mih uanh Thurai chup kim kowi aia kowpawla khai.<verse eid="2CH 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 15:19" />Asa chowm mang mih 35 ning mowr dow katpaw tasen dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 15:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2CH 16" />
  <para style="s">Judauüa kowi Israel mang Basa senah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 16:1" />Juda pren kowi Asa chowm mang mih 36 ning khe Israel pren mang Basa mih Judauüa kowi kowsenah hanow Rama marow mih kowpowngta pe khai. Now aia dow Rama marow kowi Judauüa ia kup lawtla dowi kownkow aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi towah khai. <verse eid="2CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 16:2" />Naiawng rakowi Asa mih aia kim kowi kowh hai Thurai chup kim kowi kowh kuh hai tai pawah hanow aia kowh maru iuk rut kowi peah khai, now Siria pren mang Ben-Hadad tut-e kowchinah khai. Nakhowk khe Ben-Hadad uowi mih dow Damaska marow kowi chekhai. Ben-Hadad kowi Asa krawi tek pe mih, <verse eid="2CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 16:3" />“Chu, apa hai en pa iüah iawng achi paw tatow sangbowk laitawm diah sik. Naiawngün kuh hai tai dow awmrawm sung iawng hai ang krawi sa en mih chekhai. Israel pren mang Basa hown kowh en tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm kawmat piakta diah, nahanow aia dow ang hownia napowt kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 16:4" />Juda pren mang Asa kowh laiklow tata hanow Ben-Hadad dow nauta khai. Now aia dow aia kowh siphai aluchowuüa kowi Israeluüa kowi nakrawi sen kownkow krawi chinah khai. Nami khin khe amatni dow Ijawn marow, Dan marow, Abel-Bet-Maka marow hai Naptali süng kowi kowh chakkham krümra marow maten krawi powngta khai. <verse eid="2CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 16:5" />Nami satang tata hanow Israel mang Basa mih Rama marow kowi akhawtma nachangah kown mih lup taingta khai bowt. <verse eid="2CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 16:6" />Nami kung kowi dow Rama marow akhawtma changla kownkow Basa tawngah mih hua hai singh nakowkawt kown mih Juda prenchakuüa maten kowi Asa peah ana khai. Now naiawngün singh hai hua maten hown Asa mih Mizpa kua hai Benjamin süng kowi kowh Geba marow akhawtma changah khai.<verse eid="2CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren mang Asa kowi risi Hanani tüng pe atawi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 16:7" />Nami khin khe risi Hanani mih Juda pren mang Asa tut-e uangah now tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai luk kowi en neplawng nesak dowi kowi Siria pren mang luk kowi en neplawng nesak khai. Naiawng rakowi Siria siphaiuüa mih en hownia nowng powt khai. <verse eid="2CH 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 16:8" />Ethiawpiauüa hai Libiauüa kowh kawrnga kari hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih siphaiuüa akawmma nadowi bow? Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG luk kowi en neplawng nesak rakowi naiawngün siphaiuüa kowi en rut kowi CHAKRAMANG ap en khai. <verse eid="2CH 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 16:9" />Lusa kowi lowra mih re-e cham uowi chepaw aia kowi ringkawah miuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG peah kür reng chekhai. En dow bualama mih maru iawng en chang lup khai. Naiawng rakowi kawmat hownia dow ransu-uüa hown atungma en natasen reng kown towbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="2CH 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 16:10" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Asa dow risi Hanani luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow risi Hanani kowi towah thawng khai. Nami klen kowi aia dow aia maru-uüa kowi paw mapaw sana dowi kowi changah nowng ne khai.<verse eid="2CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Asa kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 16:11" />Asa kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan dow auown hownia achur pat “Juda hai Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 16:12" />Aia kowh dow aia chowm mang mih 39 ning khe khawk kowi rawka phaw pachap chekhai. Nami rawka dow lainowmma nga chepaw aia mih CHAKRAMANG tut-e lü khowng dowi kowi daktawruüa tut-e taraw khai. <verse eid="2CH 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 16:13" />Akung kowi dow aia chowm mang mih 41 ning khe aia mih kowng khai bowt. <verse eid="2CH 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 16:14" />Now paingbawng nam iungma mih achap huma tow pe mih tadupra puk kowi aia kowh uak dow maru towah khai. Now David marow kowi aia kowh tadupra aia thawpla mih kowi aia kowh uak dow maru dupah khai. Now aia kowi ringkawah mih amat müa maih ahuma maru towk pe khai.<verse eid="2CH 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2CH 17" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Jehosafat chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 17:1" />Asa kowng kung kowi dow achapa Jehosafat mih Juda pren kowi ta chowm mang khai. Aia dow Israeluüa kowi nanowngla kownkow aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi akhawtma changah khai. <verse eid="2CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 17:2" />Aia dow Juda pren kowi kowh tap uowi mih marow maten kowi krawi tow pe siphai hawmh khai, now Juda süng kowi tawngbak mih arah kowi paw krawi tow siphai hawmh ne khai. Nami klen kowi a-pa Asa krawi powngla mih Efraimuüa süng kowi kowh marow kowi paw tow pe siphai hawmh khai. <verse eid="2CH 17:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="2CH 17:3-4" />Jehosafat tut-e dow CHAKRAMANG tawi uowi reng chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow mang David iawng mang reng chekhai. Aia dow Baal thuraiuüa kowi chupiia dowi kowi aia pipu-uüa kowh Thurai kowi chowtaih chupiia khai, now Israeluüa iawng chang lup ngak dowi kowi Thurai ana pek iawng chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 17:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 17:5" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh pren mih anikma tow pe reng chekhai. Aia kowi dow Juda prenchakuüa maten uang peah awmrawm sung khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh dow dawngthawnguan hai ringkawra mih uang hu ngamlam khai. <verse eid="2CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 17:6" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG tiama kowi namang kown mih lainowmma süngür khai. Nami klen kowi aia dow Juda pren hownia arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi hai Asera limpu ün krawi piakta bowk chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 17:7" />Jehosafat dow aia chowm mang mih sum ning khe Juda pren kowi kowh kua hai marow maten kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh ari aiang natüngsangah kownkow aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi krawi chinah khai. Naiawngün maru iukuüa dow Benhail, Obadia, Zekaria, Nethanel hai Mika büah chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 17:8" />Amatni hown dow Levi krungchak Semai, Nethania, Zebadia, Asahel, Semiramawt, Jehonathan, Adonija, Tobija hai Tawb-Adonija büah mih tawi khai. Amatni hown uamow Elisama hai Jehoram büah paw tawi khai. <verse eid="2CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 17:9" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ari aiang chabowih mih pawla khai. Now Juda pren kowi kowh marow towng krawi kowiah hanow maru-uüa kowi krawi tüngsangah büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 17:10" />Now Juda pren riaret kowi kowh akeng prenchakuüa luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG uang pawla pe kramra khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Jehosafat hown tasen dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 17:11" />Now Filistinuüa dow mangmu iawng Jehosafat tut-e tai hai akeng mih awmrawm sung uang pawla pe ne khai, now Arabuüa dow ruapur 7,700 pum hai ruala 7,700 pum uang pawla pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 17:12" />Naiawng hai Jehosafat dow uang kür ngamlam khai, now Juda pren kowi akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim ün hai uanh nungra marow ün aia thawpah khai.<verse eid="2CH 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 17:13" />Aia dow Judauüa kowh marow kowi uanh ahuma nungah khai, now Jerusalem marow kowi dow tasen kiakma miuüa kowi towah khai. <verse eid="2CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 17:14" />Mami dow amatni chowlowkkow krungchakuüa taken iawng amatni kowh maru iun hai siphai aluchowuüa ming chekhai:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 17:14">Juda krungchak hownia kowh lang kri mih siphai aluchow dow Adna chekhai. Aia kowh tasen mih siphaiuüa dow 300,000 ia chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 17:15" />Nami kung kowi kowh siphai aluchow dow Jehohanan chekhai, now aia kowh tasen mih siphaiuüa dow 280,000 ia chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 17:16" />Nami kung kowi kowh siphai aluchow dow Zikri chapa Amasia chekhai, now aia kowh tasen mih siphaiuüa dow 200,000 ia chekhai. Amasia dow CHAKRAMANG lup chang kowi aiamat low hown hing tape mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 17:17" />Benjamin krungchak hownia kowh lang kri mih siphai aluchow dow Eliada chekhai. Aia kowh dow leba dowk mih hai kawngma dowk mih siphaiuüa 200,000 ia chekhai. Eliada dow tasen kiakma mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 17:18" />Nami kung kowi kowh siphai aluchow dow Jehozabad chekhai, now aia kowh tasen mih siphaiuüa dow 180,000 ia chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 17:19" />Naiawngün siphaiuüa dow Jerusalem hownia mang kowi chang pe lup miuüa chekhai. Naiawngünuüa klen kowi paw Juda pren kowi kowh tap uowi mih marow kowi ün krawi towla siphai ne tak chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 17:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2CH 18" />
  <para style="s">Mang Ahab kowi risiuüa kuanah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 18:1" />Juda pren mang Jehosafat dow lainowmma kureng khai, now lainowmma ka ringkawra khai. Aia kimchak dow Israel pren mang Ahab kimchak hown tachawng hanow tatow sangbowk laitawm khai. <verse eid="2CH 18:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="2CH 18:2-3" />Now pre sum ning kung kowi dow Ahab hown kowtakrum kownkow Samari marow kowi Jehosafat kowkowi khai. Nakhowk khe Ahab dow Jehosafat hai aia hown kowh uang tawi miuüa vüi ruapur hai chia ün ahuma hawt ngen pe khai. Now Ahab dow aia kowsen Ramawt-Gilead süng kown mih kowi natawi khowngah kownkow Jehosafat kowi hawt chiaah khai. Aia tek pe Jehosafat mih, “Ramawt-Gilead marow kowi kowsen kown mih ang hown en tawi tak ü?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:2-3">Nakhowk khe Jehosafat klangah mih, “Tawng tawi dowi chow? Ang hai en, now ang kowh maru-uüa hai en kowh maru-uüa dow katsang towbowt. <verse eid="2CH 18:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 18:4" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG tut-e rik paw prengia diah sik,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 18:5" />Naiawng rakowi Ahab mih risi maten kowi kuaah lawmah khai. Nakhowk khe risiuüa uang takua talawm mih dow maru iun 400 ia chekhai. Now naiawngün risiuüa kowi Ahab lüntaah mih, “Ramawt-Gileaduüa kowi anging kowsen kown bow, kowsen dowi bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:5">Nakhowk khe risiuüa klangah mih, “Kowsen bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami süng dow en rut kowi CHAKRAMANG naap en kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 18:6" />Nachenganchepaw Jehosafat tek pe mih, “Nami lawnguan CHAKRAMANG tut-e naia lüntaah kownkow mami re-e CHAKRAMANG kowh risi uowi dowi bowt bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 18:7" />Nakhowk khe Jehosafat kowi Ahab klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG tut-e naia lüntala kownkow risi uowi lowk ia tak. Tawkchedow nami risi kowi ang sui chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami risi mih ang nangala kown mih lawnguan kangowh tek; katpaw ang iung müa laiklow tek dowi. Aia ming dow Mikha, now a-pa ming dow Imla chekhai,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:7">Nakhowk khe Jehosafat tek pe mih, “Mangkri, naiawng mih laiklow hang tek snow,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 18:8" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh maru iuk lowk ia kowi hawah now Ahab tek pe mih, “Kawmat alenma Imla kowh chapa risi Mikha kowi kowhaw madiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 18:9" />Now Israel pren mang Ahab hai Juda pren mang Jehosafat iüah mih khupla mang tawnguat now Samari marow tapplawt re-e kowh püm thuara kowi kowh mang chowm rah kowi chowm iüah khai, now risiuüa dow amatchi pur kowi pur pra kowh naphaw kown mih laiklow tekla prung khai. <verse eid="2CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 18:10" />Nakhowk khe Kenana kowh chapa Zedekia mih lawngha hown thawp nang lowk hanow tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek Siriauüa chum bowk dowi mowr maiawngün lawngha nang hown en nakrawi tingah rengreng kown pe,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 18:11" />Nakhowk khe akeng mih risiuüa paw nami laiklow powm iawng tawi tek khai. Naiawngün risiuüa tek mih, “Ramawt-Gilead marow kowi kowsenah bowt, en awng kown taih. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami marow dow CHAKRAMANG mih naap en kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 18:12" />Now Mikha kowi kowhaw mih maru tek pe Mikha mih, “Sünta, akeng mih risiuüa dow mangkri iung müa lawnguan kowi tek bowk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en paw kowbüah iawng natawi tek kown takla; mangkri iung müa lawnguan chowtaih en natawi tek kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 18:13" />Nachenganchepaw Mikha tek pe mih, “Masing CHAKRAMANG ming hown takham se ang tek khowk. Ang kowh Thurai tek mih chowtaih ang natek kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 18:14" />Now Mikha uang ting khe mang Ahab hawt lüntaah mih, “Mikha, tek ang madiah. Ramawt-Gilead marow kowi ang kowsen kown bow, kowsen dowi bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:14">Nakhowk khe Mikha klangah mih, “Ow, kowsen bowt, kowsen bowt, en awng kown taih. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami marow dow en rut kowi CHAKRAMANG apta khowk chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 18:15" />Nakhowk khe Ahab tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG ming hown takham se lainowm chowtaih en natek kown pami mün kat tak chow ang natek en kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 18:16" />Mikha klangah mih, “Mukmang kowi ang khi mih, Israel siphaiuüa dow athing mih uowi dowi mih ruapur hawmh iawng hungh kowi cham tauet plawt khai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Naiawngün siphaiuüa kowh aluchow uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni mih chowlowkkow kim kowi pacham mang lah,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 18:17" />Nakhowk khe Jehosafat kowi Ahab tek pe mih, “Khi bow kow! Nami risi dow ang nangala kown mih laiklow klen kowi tawngpaw tek dowi pami ang tek en khowk nadowi bow kow?” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 18:18" />Now Mikha plan tek iawk mih, “Naiawng chekhai hanow CHAKRAMANG laiklow sünta diah. Mukmang kowi ang khi mih, aia kowh mang chowm rah kowi CHAKRAMANG chowm phülü khai, now aia hawmlawm hai lakuai pra dow kramamu-uüa maten iowngla rim khai. <verse eid="2CH 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 18:19" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Ahab kowi kuanla now Ramawt-Gilead marow kowi nakowngta kownkow amia chow nakowkuanah kown?’ pakhai. Nakhowk khe kramamu-uüa mih lowk ia e achap chi CHAKRAMANG kowi tek pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 18:20" />Nachenganchepaw achur kowi lümla lowk mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uangah now tek pe mih, ‘Ang kowkuanah now ang kowpawla sow,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:20">“Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG lüntaah mih, ‘Tawng iawng chow en nachangah kown?’ pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 18:21" />“Nami lümla klangah mih, ‘Ang kowkowiah now aia kowh risiuüa tut-e nadaila kown mih lümla ang nakowchowng pe kown,’ pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:21">“Now CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, ‘En naia nowm kown, kowkowi now kowkuanah dit,’ pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 18:22" />“Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih kawmat en kowh naiawngün risiuüa nawr kowi natek dai lai kown mih lümla peah mih chekhai. En napiak kownkow CHAKRAMANG phuangta khai bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 18:23" />Nakhowk khe Kenana kowh chapa Zedekia mih Mikha kowi phekah pawp now tek pe mih, “En hown nauang taklang kownkow ang hownia CHAKRAMANG kowh Lümla powt mih tawng khe chowbowt chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 18:24" />Now Mikha klangah mih, “Natapet kownkow kim lak kowi en cham kup mih khin khe nami dow en natuk kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 18:25" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi mang Ahab peah ana mih, “Marow kowi kowh kruitown mih Amawn hai mang chapa Joas tut-e Mikha kowi kowsaah dit. <verse eid="2CH 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 18:26" />Now enni natek pe kown mih, ‘Mangkri tek mami maru kowi thawng kowi towah dit pe, now tasenra hownia klangiungma mangkri uang plan dowi mowr mami maru kowi kawm hai tui ditchowchi klen kowi tawngpaw hangkow peah pe,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 18:27" />Nakhowk khe mang Ahab kowi Mikha tek pe mih, “En che klangiungma uang ia plan khai hanow ang hownia CHAKRAMANG tek lai dowi pami tukah diah,” pape khai. Nami klen kowi maru kawmuüa kowi Mikha plan tek pe mih, “Enni bowkbowk ang kowh laiklow matah büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ramawt-Gilead marow kowi Ahab kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 18:28" />Nami kung kowi dow Israel pren mang hai Juda pren mang mih Ramawt-Gilead marow kowi kowsenah kownkow tarü khai bowt. <verse eid="2CH 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 18:29" />Nakhowk khe Jehosafat kowi Ahab tek pe mih, “Maru natuk matla ang dowi kownkow tasenra kowi iawngpa mih tawnguat khupma ang natawi kown. Nachenganchepaw en dow mang tawnguat khupla diah,” pakhai. Now Israel mang dow iawngpa mih tawnguat khupma tasenra kowi tawi tarü khai.<verse eid="2CH 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 18:30" />Now kawrnga kari kowi kowh chowm mih aia kowh siphai aluchowuüa kowi Siriauüa kowh mang peah ana mih, “Israel mang hown klen kowi aiuk asowm mia hown paw enni naia tasen kown nadowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="2CH 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 18:31" />Now tasen thüm khe Jehosafat kowi Siriauüa kowh siphai aluchowuüa khita kowh Israel mang chowbowt padow ka tuak büah khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Jehosafat kowi nakowsenah kownkow kowtarü khai. Nakhowk khe Jehosafat dow atünma hawt tüng klow khai. Nahanow aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG lawngah khai; aia dow siphai aluchowuüa kowi akeng prakowi henta pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 18:32" />Siriauüa kowh siphai aluchowuüa dow Israel mang nadowi pami tukta khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Jehosafat kowi krawi senah dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 18:33" />Nachenganchepaw Siriauüa kowh siphai lowk ia dow tawngah kaneu dowi kowi aia kowh leba vüiah now plawtta suat khai. Now nami leba sek dow Ahab sakmowr dakchow kowi kowtatawng khai. Nakhowk khe aia kowh kawrnga kari te mih kowi Ahab tek pe mih, “Ang ka arau khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi kawrnga kari planah now tasenra hownia powtla ang bowt,” pape khai. <verse eid="2CH 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 18:34" />Naiawng hown Siriauüa hai Israeluüa dow ni chut tasen khai. Now mang Ahab kowi dow Siriauüa hown tatang klowk kawrnga kari kowi chowmta hüah khai. Now iak prakowi mang Ahab dow kowng khai bowt.<verse eid="2CH 18:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2CH 19" />
  <para style="s">Jehosafat kowh atawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 19:1" />Juda pren mang Jehosafat dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh aia kim kowi aiungma uang plan khai. <verse eid="2CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 19:2" />Nakhowk khe Hanani chapa risi Jehu dow uang lawt hanow aia tut-e uang khai. Now Jehosafat kowi tek pe mih, “Maru ngakuüa hai CHAKRAMANG kowi sui miuüa kowi tawngplawng kowchow en tuk sakrauah khai? Naiawng en chang rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih lainowmma kunmarau en khai bowt. <verse eid="2CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 19:3" />Tawkche lup iung paw en changla ne khai. Pren kowi kowh maru kawmuüa chupiiaah mih Asera limpu dow en piakta khai, now Thurai kowi nacham kown mih en towsak khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jehosafat tow tara chet miuüa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 19:4" />Jehosafat dow Jerusalem marow kowi uowi khai. Tawkche aia dow Ber-Seba hownia Efraim süng mowr mih maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi krawi kowi reng chekhai. Now CHAKRAMANG amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai prakowi nauang plan kown mih maru kawmuüa kowi aia krawi tek pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 19:5" />Juda pren kowi kowh tap uowi mih marow maten kowi dow tara chet miuüa kowi aia krawi tow pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 19:6" />Tara chet miuüa kowi aia tek pe mih, “Tara chetra kowi aiung angak naphuang kown chowbowt khe kaneu büa diah . Tawngplawng kowchow panow nachet tara kownkow lusa maru tow enni mih nadowi, CHAKRAMANG tow enni mih chekhai. Tara chetra kowi aiung angak laiklow phuang mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG tawi uowila enni reng kown taih. <verse eid="2CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 19:7" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kramah büa diah, now tara mih kaneuma chetah büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai dow lup ngak kowi nowng mü dowi chekhai. Aia dow amia iawng mih pra paw lang tangila rowt dowi, now cha büm cha sua dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 19:8" />Jehosafat dow Jerusalem kowi nachet tara kownkow uamowuüa, Leviuüa hai Israel krungchakuüa kowh aluchowuüa kowi towah khai. Naiawngünuüa kowh lup dow CHAKRAMANG kowh rirow tawita mata khe nachet tara kown mih hai takhowk taran khe nachet tara kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 19:9" />Amatni kowi aia tek pe mih, “Enni kowh lup mih CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown, kaah sakowmma hown, now saktuak maiow hown enni nachang kown takla. <verse eid="2CH 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 19:10" />Enni Israel tainau-uüa dow tasai mih lawnguan kowi lah, now CHAKRAMANG kowh rirow, ana pek, alow pek hai ari aiang lawnguan kowi lah enni tut-e nauang chet tara kown. Nakhowk khe amatni mih tek dai lai hown CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih lup nachang büah dowi kownkow tek pe kaneu diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng che amatni chang khai hanow enni hai amatni luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura nauang ting kown chekhai. Tawkche naiawng che enni chang khai hanow enni kowh aprek nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="2CH 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 19:11" />“Kawngmu lawnguan kowi kowh tara chetra kowi aiung angak laiklow naphuang enni kown mih dow uamow lang kri mih Amaria, now akeng mih lawnguan maten kowi kowh tara chetra kowi aiung angak laiklow naphuang kown mih dow Ismael chapa Zebadia chekhai. Zebadia dow Juda krungchakuüa kowh aluchow chekhai. Tara chet kowi kowh phuangta mih iawng nachang lup kown mih kowi Leviuüa mih natawi khowng enni kown. Enni mih sakkhawtma hown chang lup diah. Lup nowm chang miuüa tut-e dow CHAKRAMANG pacham tawi uowi reng lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 19:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2CH 20" />
  <para style="s">Jehosafat chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 20:1" />Akung kowi dow Moabuüa, Amawnuüa hai Meuniuüa mih Jehosafat kowi kowsenah khai. <verse eid="2CH 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 20:2" />Nakhowk khe maru pre sum ia uangah now Jehosafat kowi uang tek pe mih, “Nauang sen en kownkow Sata Kowng paipra pown hownia Siria pren siphai hawmh akawmma uang tarü pathum. Now kawmat amatni dow Hazazun-Tamar (En-Gedi) pami arah kowi uang ting khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 20:3" />Nami satang tata hanow Jehosafat dow kram kowh CHAKRAMANG kruitownra nakala kownkow aia tut-e awr lü awr leng khai. Nami kung kowi aia dow Juda pren paprenma kowi nakhang hawm kownkow krawi phuang khai. <verse eid="2CH 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 20:4" />Nahanow Juda pren kowi kowh marow maten hownia maru kawmuüa mih CHAKRAMANG tut-e nalü khowng kownkow Jerusalem marow kowi uang takua talawm khai.<verse eid="2CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 20:5" />Nakhowk khe Jehosafat mih CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi kowh viadawng sar kowi Juda prenchak hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa pur kowi iowng khai. <verse eid="2CH 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 20:6" />Now aia tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG anging pipu-uüa kowh Thurai, en dow mukuang kowi kowh Thurai chekhai. En dow chenchap maten kowh pren kruitown mih chekhai. Nowng changra hai kür dow en rut kowi chowtaih, now en kowi dow miapaw nowng hang en dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 20:7" />Aw anging kowh Thurai, en kowh maru Israeluüa pur hownia mami prenchakuüa kowi en prütah hanow mami pren mih en kowh auiua Abraham kowh krungchakuüa kowi chowngchowng saksakma vüi en peah khai. <verse eid="2CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 20:8" />Now amatni dow mami pren kowi uowi khai, now en vüi chimsaima mih kim thawp en büah lowk khai. <verse eid="2CH 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 20:9" />Now tek büah mih, ‘Anging luk kowi che — tasenra lah, ripra lah, makowng hawi lah, khown lah — lowra mih phih uang kla khai hanow nami khin khe mami kim pur kowi anging naiowng kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami kim kowi dow maru-uüa chupiiala en reng chekhai. Akrat pusa hown anging uowi khe en tut-e anging nakar kown, now anging kowh laiklow en ta hanow en nalawng anging kown,’ pabüah khai.<verse eid="2CH 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 20:10" />“Now kawmat mih nauang sen anging kownkow Amawnuüa, Moabuüa hai Seir hungh kowi kowh maru-uüa dow makowi uang thüm khowk. Amatni kowi dow Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa uang lawt khe en pe senah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow Israeluüa piakla dowi kowi powtta khai. <verse eid="2CH 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 20:11" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow tawng iawng chow amatni chang anging mih sam mü madiah! Nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow en pe anging mih pren hownia naprütta anging kownkow amatni dow uang tarü khai. <verse eid="2CH 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 20:12" />Aw anging kowh Thurai, amatni kowi en chet pe tara dowi tham bow? Pai iawng khowt siphai kawm nauang sen anging kownkow uang tarü miuüa kowi nahawt sen kown mih anging kowh kür uowi dowi chekhai. Tawng chow achang takla mih anging tuk dowi. Nachenganchepaw naka khowng kownkow en prakowi anging tang mü reng,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 20:13" />Nami khin khe Juda pren kowi kowh kachakuüa maten dow amatni kowh masiuüa hai chauüa hailawm nami re-e CHAKRAMANG pur kowi iowngla rim khai. <verse eid="2CH 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 20:14" />Nakhowk khe amatni pungmadawng kowi Levi krungchak kowi kowh Asap machak maru lowk ia luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla uang ting khai. Nami maru ming dow Jahaziel, now a-pa ming dow Zekaria chekhai. Zekaria kowh pa dow Benaia, Benaia kowh pa dow Jeiel, now Jeiel kowh pa dow Matania chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 20:15" />Jahaziel tek mih, “Aw mangkri Jehosafat hai Juda pren hown Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uowi miuüa, enni bowkbowk sünta büa diah. Enni vüi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Paimi siphai kawm kowi khita hanow hangkow kram büah, now sak paw hangkow nen büa diah. Mami tasen dow CHAKRAMANG kowh chowtaih; enni kowh nadowi. <verse eid="2CH 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 20:16" />Tharau khe amatni kowi kowsen kownkow enni nakowtarü kown. Amatni dow Ziz pami hungh kowi kowh tiama iawng nauang tarü kown, now Jeruel pami süngrüp süngkangma re-e kowh lawngrawi chur kowi amatni kowi dow enni nakrum kown. <verse eid="2CH 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 20:17" />Tawngpaw enni asen kla dowi. Aw Juda pren hai Jerusalem maru-uüa, atanma iowng büah rimrim now na taih, now tawng iawng chow CHAKRAMANG lawng enni mih phai mü büah phülü. Tawngpaw hangkow kram büah, now sak paw hangkow nen büa. Ang tek iawng phai chang büah now na taih. Tharau khe tarü büa, now CHAKRAMANG mih enni hown natawi uowi kown taih,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 20:18" />Nakhowk khe Jehosafat mih krawng kowi tabawk krawm khai, now Juda prenchak hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa maten paw CHAKRAMANG kowi tüng pe ringkawra kownkow krawng kowi tabawk krawm hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi chupah khai. <verse eid="2CH 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 20:19" />Nami kung kowi dow Levi chenchap kowi kowh Kohat krungchak hai Kora krungchakuüa mih akawmma awr iowngah hanow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowi atün atünma rowsiah khai.<verse eid="2CH 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 20:20" />Now auai rau dow murpa amatni mih Tekoa süngrüp süngkangma prakowi tarü khai. Amatni tarü dowi rawn khe Jehosafat awr rüah now tek pe mih, “Aw Juda prenchak hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa, ang laiklow sünta büa diah. CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai luk kowi neplawng nesak büa diah, nahanow anikma enni naia uowi kown taih. Aia kowh risiuüa kowi owm büa diah, nahanow enni kowh lup nachawn kown taih,” pakhai. <verse eid="2CH 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 20:21" />Now maru kawmuüa tut-e krawi paw prengia hanow Jehosafat mih rui maru sangrum khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow chimsaima mih tawnguat khupma CHAKRAMANG kiow müa meng natek kown mih chekhai. Amatni dow siphaiuüa pur kowi rik mang hanow,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 20:21">“CHAKRAMANG kowi tek pe awmrawm lai diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 20:21">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai,” pahai tek meng khai.<verse eid="2CH 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="2CH 20:22-23" />Now naiawngün maru-uüa tek meng hai rowsi CHAKRAMANG mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG dow nauang dowk tasen kownkow uang mih Amawnuüa, Moabuüa hai Seir hungh hownia kowh maru-uüa kowi amatni lala natasen kown mih iu chang pe khai. Naiawng rakowi Amawnuüa hai Moabuüa dow Seir hungh hownia kowh maru-uüa kowi senah hanow asaima kowngta khai. Nami kung kowi dow Amawnuüa hai Moabuüa mih amatni lala tadowk tasen khai.<verse eid="2CH 20:22-23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 20:24" />Nakhowk khe Juda prenchakuüa dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh kimkrowng kowi uangah hanow naiawngün siphai kawm prakowi haimü khai, now krawng kowi uak takuakla pan mih khi büah khai. Now amatni dow amatni kowh ransu-uüa lowk ia paw plai dowi mih tuk büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 20:25" />Nakhowk khe Jehosafat hai aia kowh maru-uüa dow asung uowima mih uanh nakrawi paw kownkow uak dawng kowi kowkrawi kowi khai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow tawncher hawmh, dawnguan hai akeng mih uanh ün asung khakma mih ahuma ka büah khai. Naiawngün uanh dow hu lai kowh sum ni mowr krawi paw büah khai. Nachenganchepaw uanh hu lai rakowi amatni dow nowng pawla bowk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 20:26" />Now tali ni mih ni khe dow Beraka lawngrawi kowi takua talawm büah hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsi kiowri büah khai. Naiawng rakowi nami arah ming dow kawmat paw Beraka pahai uowi reng chekhai. (Beraka pami auan dow “Prasi” pami chekhai).<verse eid="2CH 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 20:27" />Nami kung kowi dow Juda prenchak hai Jerusalem marowchak maten piawla se Jehosafat kung kowi mang iualua se Jerusalem marow kowi kowplan khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG mih amatni kowh ransu-uüa kowi pe sumah khai. <verse eid="2CH 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 20:28" />Amatni dow tepla taraw, tingteng hai tumla baw se Jerusalem marow kowi uang plan hanow CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="2CH 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 20:29" />Now Israeluüa kowh ransu-uüa kowi tawng iawng chow CHAKRAMANG senah mih lawnguan dow akeng pren kowi kowh maru maten tawi ta khai bowt. Nami tata hanow akeng prenchak maten dow CHAKRAMANG kowi kram khai bowt. <verse eid="2CH 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 20:30" />Nahanow Jehosafat kowh pren dow thaulangma uowi khai bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi dow aia kowh ransu-uüa maten hownia Thurai mih peah thaulangra khai.<verse eid="2CH 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jehosafat kowh mangra chur mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 20:31" />Jehosafat dow 35 ning khe uown chowm mang khai, now 25 ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. Aia kowh u ming dow Azuba chekhai, now Azuba kowh u ming dow Silhi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 20:32" />Jehosafat dow lowra tia kowi a-pa Asa iawng chekhai. Aia dow katpaw a-pa changah mih sia nuata dowi chekhai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 20:33" />Nachenganchepaw pren kowi kowh arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara dow aia piakta dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakhowk khe paw amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai prakowi maru-uüa kowh sak nik dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 20:34" />Jehosafat kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow auown hownia achur pat Hanani kowh chapa Jehu mih ruiah khai. Nami dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 20:35" />Akung kowi dow Juda pren mang Jehosafat mih Israel pren mang Ahazia hown tawi tabawng khai. Ahazia dow chang lup ngak reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 20:36" />Jehosafat dow Tarsis marow kowi kowkowila kownkow aiuk aiukma mih chawnlawng Ahazia hown taiua thawp kown mih nauta khai. Now naiawngün chawnlawng dow Eziawn-Geber kowi thawp iüah khai. <verse eid="2CH 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 20:37" />Nachenganchepaw nakhowk khe Maresa marowchak Dodavahu kowh chapa Eliezer mih Jehosafat kowi kingküala mih laiklow uang tek pe khai. Eliezer tek pe mih, “Ahazia hown en tawi tabawng khai rakowi en thawpah mih maten CHAKRAMANG napiakta en kown,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi naiawngün chawnlawng dow tapiak bowk khai, now Tarsis marow kowi kownowng kowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 20:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2CH 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 21:1" />Akung kowi Jehosafat dow kowng hanow aia pipu-uüa tut-e tawi uowi khai bowt, now aia kowi dow apipu-uüa kowh tadupra David marow kowi dupah khai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Jehoram mih ta chowm mang khai. <verse eid="2CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 21:2" />Jehoram kowh tainau-uüa dow Azaria, Jehiel, Zekaria, Azariahu, Mikael hai Sefatia büah chekhai. Amatni bowkbowk dow Israel mang Jehosafat chapauüa chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 21:3" />Amatni kowi dow a-pa mih kuh, tai, asung khak khakma mih uanh, Juda pren kowi kowh tap tapat lut mih marow peah khai. Tawkche Jehoram kowi tarapdow chapa ta chekhai rakowi mang rah peah khai.<verse eid="2CH 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Jehoram chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 21:4" />Jehoram dow a-pa pren kowi kowh aia kowh mang rah mih akhawtma changah khai. Nami kung kowi aia dow aia kowh tainau-uüa maten kowi hai Israel kowi kowh aluchowuüa kowi saita ne khai. <verse eid="2CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 21:5" />Jehoram chowm mang mih dow 32 ning khe chekhai, now aia dow raiat ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 21:6" />Aia kowh masi dow mang Ahab kowh chama chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow mang Ahab kimchakuüa iawng hai Israeluüa kowh akeng mih manguüa iawng tawi chang angak khai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 21:7" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow David kowh krungchak kowi napiakta kown mih nau dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow David kowh krungchakuüa atungma nachowm mang reng kown mih David kowi CHAKRAMANG khamta khai bowt.<verse eid="2CH 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 21:8" />Juda pren mang Jehoram chowm mang mih khin khe Edawm prenchakuüa dow Judauüa kowi kingküaah khai, now amatni matia vüi lang tow mang büah lowk ia khai. <verse eid="2CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 21:9" />Naiawng rakowi Jehoram dow aia kowh siphai aluchowuüa hai kawrnga kari maten pawla now Edawm pren kowi kowkowi khai. Nakhowk khe Edawmuüa dow Jehoram hai aia kowh siphai aluchowuüa kowi uang rumah khai. Tawkche Jehoram hai aia kowh siphai aluchowuüa dow uar-e khe Edawmuüa rumah mih kowi nowng thüa büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 21:10" />Edawmuüa dow kawmat mowr pat paw Judauüa kowi kingküaah reng tak chekhai. Libna marowchakuüa paw Jehoram kowi tawi kingküaah khai. Naiawng phaw mih maten dow CHAKRAMANG aia pipu-uüa kowh Thurai kowi Jehoram nuata rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 21:11" />Aia dow Juda pren kowi arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara krawi thawp khai, now nakowi dow Jerusalem marowchakuüa kowi aia pe chupiiaah arup aren khai. Naiawng hai Juda maru-uüa kowi dow aia pe changah angak khai. <verse eid="2CH 21:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="2CH 21:12-13" />Nakhowk khe mang Jehoram dow risi Elija hownia ka chasak lowk chekhai. Nami chasak kowi arui uowi mih, “CHAKRAMANG en pipu David kowh Thurai tek mih maiawng, ‘En pa Jehosafat kowh tiama kowi hai Juda pren mang Asa kowh tiama kowi en mang dowi chekhai. Tawkche Israel manguüa kowh tiama kowi dow en mang khai. En rakowi Juda hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa mih Ahab kowh krungchak maru-uüa iawng cham tawi chupiia arup aren khai. En tainau-uüa kowi dow en saita khai. Amatni dow en hown kowh pabuk panga sang mih maru chowdiah, now iung paw en lak-e lang iung chowdiah. <verse eid="2CH 21:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 21:14" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih en kowh maru-uüa, en kowh chapauüa hai en kowh masi hawmuüa kowi akraingma ang naripah kown, now en kowh dawngthawnguan maten ang napiakta en kown. <verse eid="2CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 21:15" />En matia kowh mu paw nahing rauta hüah kown, nami arua dow pani kowh pani nanga ngamlam kown, now achur khe dow en kowh ria nauang tauai plawt kown,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 21:16" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG dow mang Jehoram kowi nakingküaah kownkow Filistinuüa kowi hai Ethiawpiauüa tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih Arabuüa kowi towkah kunmarau khai. <verse eid="2CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 21:17" />Now amatni dow Juda pren kowi uang senah hanow siphaiuüa kowi krawi nowngta khai. Now mang kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan maten, Jehoram kowh chapauüa hai aia kowh masi hawmuüa kowi pawla pe büah khai. Mang Jehoram tut-e ta uowi mih dow achapa sawi Ahazia lowk iachow towbowt. (Ahazia kowh ming uowi lowk tak mih dow Jehoahaz chekhai).<verse eid="2CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 21:18" />Naiawng bowkbowk ki phaw kung kowi CHAKRAMANG dow ia iungah dowi mih mu rau Jehoram kowi uang peah khai. <verse eid="2CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 21:19" />Now aia chowm mang mih pre ning chur prakowi dow nami mu rau hown aia kowh ria mih uang tauai plawt khai. Aia dow kowng pat lainowmma khamla arau khai. Aia kowh maru-uüa mih natüngla ringkawra kownkow aia pipu-uüa kowi towk pe maih iawng aia kowi dow towk pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 21:20" />Jehoram chowm mang mih dow 32 ning khe chekhai. Now aia dow raiat ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. Aia kowng mih khin khe amiapaw aia vüi uowi pe uiting uangtak dowi chekhai. Aia kowi dow David marow kowi dupah khai. Tawkchedow manguüa tadupra kowi aia kowi dupah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 21:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2CH 22" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Ahazia chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 22:1" />Jerusalem marow kowi kowh maru-uüa dow Jehoram takcha kowi achapa sawi mih Ahazia kowi pe chowmah mang khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Arab prenchakuüa hown kowh uang taiua thowk damra miuüa dow Jehoram kowh chapa ta maten kowi saila bowk khai. Naiawng rakowi Juda pren mang Jehoram chapa Ahazia dow ta chowm mang khai. <verse eid="2CH 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 22:2" />Aia chowm mang mih dow 22 ning khe chekhai, now aia dow paning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Israel mang Awmri kowh chu Athalia chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 22:3" />Aia dow Ahab krungchakuüa chang iawng tawi chang angak khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi dow a-u mih nachang lup ngak kown mih prengia peah reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 22:4" />Aia dow Ahab krungchakuüa iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup tawi chang khai. A-pa kowng kung kowi aia kowi peah prengia mih dow naiawngün krungchakuüa chowtaih. Naiawng rakowi aia dow hing piak khai. <verse eid="2CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 22:5" />Aia kowh prengia pek miuüa kowh laiklow hown mang Ahazia dow Israel mang Joram hown tawi tabawng hanow Siria pren mang Hazael kowi tawi senah khai. Now amatni dow Gilead süng kowi kowh Ramawt marow kowi tasen büah khai. Nakhowk khe mang Joram dow Siria siphaiuüa hownia ka arau khai. <verse eid="2CH 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 22:6" />Now aia kowh arau naiungla kownkow aia dow Jezrel marow kowi kowplan khai. Nakhowk khe aia hown nauang takrum kownkow mang Ahazia paw Jezrel marow kowi uang khai.<verse eid="2CH 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 22:7" />Thurai rik khowm bowkta khowk rakowi Joram tut-e uang hanow Ahazia mih piak khai. Jezrel marow kowi aia kowting mih khin khe Joram hown Nimsi chapa Jeho kowi kowsenah khai. Jeho kowi CHAKRAMANG nümnapah mih auan dow Ahab krungchakuüa kowi napiakah kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 22:8" />Now Ahab krungchakuüa kowi Jehu ripah mih khin khe aia dow Ahazia kowi tawi khowngah mih Judauüa kowh aluchowuüa hai Ahazia kowh tainau-uüa kowi khita kowh saita bowk khai. <verse eid="2CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 22:9" />Nami kung kowi amatni dow Ahazia kowi nasaiah kownkow krawi chamah khai, now aia kowi dow aia tapetra Samari marow kowi krawi ka khümta büah khai. Now aia kowi dow Jehu tut-e uang pawla hanow saita büah khai. Now aia kowh uak dow klangiungma dupah büah khai; tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni tek mih, “Ahazia dow Jehosafat kowh chu chekhai, now Jehosafat dow saktuak maten hown CHAKRAMANG nau iawng chang reng mih maru chekhai,” pakhai. Ahazia kowh krungchak hownia dow nachowm mang kown mih maru uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi kowh masiuüa mang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 22:10" />Juda pren mang Ahazia kowh u Athalia dow achapa kowng mih satang tawi ta khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Juda krungchak kowi kowh mang kimchakuüa maten kowi krawi saita bowk khai. <verse eid="2CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 22:11" />Nachenganchepaw mang chapauüa kowi krawi saita bowk dowi rawn mang Jehoram kowh chama (uamow Jehoiada kowh masi) Jehoseba dow arak sin Ahazia kowh chapa Joas ngiachow kowi kowku pawta khai. Now aia dow Athalia rut hownia atulung Joas naia plaila kownkow athum miia hailawm CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh mawk rah towklak lowk mih kowi petah khai. Naiawng rakowi Athalia mih Joas kowi ka saiah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 22:12" />Naiawng hai uamow Jehoiada masi Athalia chowm mang mih taruk ning mowr dow Joas kowi mih Thurai chup kim lak kowi Jehoseba petah khai.<verse eid="2CH 22:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2CH 23" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Joas chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 23:1" />Athalia chowm mang mih ranit ning khe uamow Jehoiada dow pachap dowi now pachap nachang kown mih sangkrang khai bowt. Aia dow 100 ia luk kowi kowh siphai aluchowuüa tanga ia hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khai. Naiawngün siphai aluchowuüa dow Jeroham chapa Azaria, Jehohanan chapa Ismael, Obed chapa Azaria, Adaia chapa Maseia hai Zikri chapa Elisafat büah chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 23:2" />Naiawngün aluchow tanga ia mih dow Juda pren kowi kowkowi hanow marow maten kowi kowh Leviuüa hai Israel krungchak aluchowuüa kowi arasang kuaah lawmah khai. Now naiawngünuüa hown Jerusalem marow kowi uang plan büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 23:3" />Now amatni bowkbowk dow Thurai kim kowi kowkowi hanow mang Joas hown tatow sangbowk laitawm büah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 23:3">Nakhowk khe amatni kowi Jehoiada tek pe mih, “Mow, mang kowh chapa! David krungchakuüa lawnguan kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG khamta iawng aia mih nachowm mang kown. <verse eid="2CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 23:4" />Enni mih maiawng nachang kown: Tanai Ni khe Thurai chup kim kowi nachang lup kown mih uamowuüa hai Leviuüa maten kowi nachangah sum thum kown. Pathum mih dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh kimplawt nachawng kown, <verse eid="2CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 23:5" />alowk mih thum dow mang kim nachawng kown, now alowk mih thum dow CHAKRAMANG kim hai mang kim takra kowi kowh tapplawt nachawng kown. Now akeng miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kim re-e kowh viadawng kowi nauowi kown. <verse eid="2CH 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 23:6" />Uamowuüa hai lup uowi mih Leviuüa klen kowi miapaw CHAKRAMANG kim kowi naia kup kown nadowi. Amatni kowi Thurai vüi lang krata khai bowt rakowi amatni nowng kup mih chowtaih. Tawkche akeng mih maru-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng prang kowi nauowi kown. <verse eid="2CH 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 23:7" />Enni Leviuüa dow chowlowkkow tasen müa rutchün khawkleng dowkma hown mang tavir lut nakrawi uowi kown. Now lowra kowi aia cham kowi chepaw aia re-e enni natawi takhep kown. Thurai kim kowi uang kup kown kamrüt mih maru kowi dow enni nakowngta kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 23:8" />Naiawng rakowi Leviuüa hai Judauüa maten dow uamow Jehoiada tek pe iawng chang büah khai. Amatni dow Tanai Ni kowi uang chang lup miuüa hai ki changla lup kowh plan miuüa kowi pawla now Jehoiada tut-e uang büah khai. Uamow Jehoiada dow amia kowi paw pe tanaiah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 23:9" />Nakhowk khe Jehoiada dow Thurai kim kowi kowh uowi mih mang David kowh reh hai aiukma mih hown asowmchow mih kawngma ün siphai aluchowuüa kowi ap pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 23:10" />Now kangchawng miuüa dow saidawng dowkma hown mang kowi nahawt towkala kownkow CHAKRAMANG kim pur kowi mami tap bang hownia paimi tap bang mowr atanma iowng büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 23:11" />Nami kung kowi dow Jehoiada hai aia kowh chapauüa mih mang kowh chapa Joas kowi uang lawtla khai bowt. Now aia kowi dow kruk pe mang lukruk hanow pren kruitown müa rirow bowih ap pe khai. Now Jehoiada dow aia kowi nümnapah khai. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa dow atünma tek büah mih, “Mang dow chowngdawng sakklangma pacham sing reng lah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masiuüa mang Athalia kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 23:12" />Maru kawmuüa iowmla prawn mih klow hai atünma mang kowi kiowah mih klow tata hanow masiuüa mang Athalia dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi maru kawmuüa tut-e kowkowi khai. <verse eid="2CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 23:13" />Nahanow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh tapplawt kowi kimchüng re-e mang sar Joas iowng mih aia kowkhi khai. Joas kowi dow siphai aluchowuüa hai baw tum miuüa umta lut khai. Pren kowi kowh maru maten dow piaw se how sawmlawm khai, now tum baw büah khai. Now meng sarauüa mih amatni kowh tünteu chang müa hown naiawngün maru-uüa kruitownah khai. Naiawngün maten khita hanow Athalia dow sak piak kowh aia kowh tawnguat thekah khai, now atünma tek mih, “Enni kuan ang khai! Enni kuan ang khai!” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 23:14" />Nakhowk khe siphai aluchowuüa kowi uamow Jehoiada peah ana mih, “Athalia kowi siphaiuüa takra iawng cham pawla diah. Aia kowi uang lawngah kownkow uang kawikrawi mih maru kowi enni nakowngta kown,” pakhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi Athalia kowi nakowngta dowi kown mih Jehoiada rik lawtta ana khai bowt. <verse eid="2CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 23:15" />Naiawng rakowi Athalia kowi dow khümla büah khai. Now aia kowi dow mang kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh kawrnga kupra tapplawt kowi saiah büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jehoiada tow pe sangbowk laitawm mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 23:16" />Now uamow Jehoiada dow aiamat hailawm mang hai maru maten hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khai. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh maru nachowng kownkow takham büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 23:17" />Nami kung kowi dow maru-uüa maten mih Baal thurai kim kowi kowkowi hanow kowpiakta kim khai. Amatni dow nakowi kowh phuchuara hai arup ün bawpta pe naknak khai, now Baal thuraiuüa kowh uamow Mattan kowi paw phuchuara re-e saita büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 23:18" />Nami kung kowi dow David kowh ana pek iawng uamow Jehoiada mih CHAKRAMANG kim naming nakhet kown mih kurdik uamowuüa hai akeng mih Leviuüa kowi peah khai. Amatni dow David ana pek iawng apiawma tek meng se Mosi rirow kowi uowi iawng CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap pawi chang büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 23:19" />CHAKRAMANG kim kowi asürlawkma mih maru uang nowng kupla dowi kownkow Jehoiada dow CHAKRAMANG kimplawt kowi kangchawng miuüa kowi tow pe khai.<verse eid="2CH 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 23:20" />Nami kung kowi aia dow siphai aluchowuüa, ringkawra uowima miuüa, pren kruitown miuüa hai pren kowi kowh maru maten kowi pawla hanow CHAKRAMANG kim hownia mang kowi uang lawtla khai. Now amatni dow aluk tapplawt iawng mang kim kowi kowkowi büah khai, now mang kowi dow mang chowm rah kowi pe chowmah khai. <verse eid="2CH 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 23:21" />Athalia kowi saita kung kowi prenchak maru kawmuüa dow piaw büah khai, now pren paw <char style="w">thaulang</char> khai bowt.<verse eid="2CH 23:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2CH 24" />
  <para style="s">Mang Joas krawi raw CHAKRAMANG kim mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 24:1" />Juda pren kowi Joas chowm mang mih dow ranit ning khe chekhai. Now Joas dow 40 ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Ber-Seba marow hownia kowh Zibia chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 24:2" />Uamow Jehoiada sing uowi mowr dow Joas mih CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 24:3" />Jehoiada dow mang Joas kowi paw pe masi pre ma khai, now Joas dow ka chauüa khai.<verse eid="2CH 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 24:4" />Akung kowi Joas dow CHAKRAMANG kim naraw kown pahai saktuak anikma towah khai. <verse eid="2CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 24:5" />Naiawng rakowi aia dow uamowuüa hai Leviuüa kowi kuaah lawmah hanow tek pe mih, “Enni mih ning towng CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh lup chang müa vüi nakrawi kawk mangmu kownkow Juda pren kowi kowh kua hai marow maten kowi kowkrawi kowi büa diah. Nami lup dow alenma changah büa diah,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw Leviuüa dow nami lup alenma chang pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 24:6" />Naiawng rakowi uamow lang kri mih Jehoiada kowi hawah now mang Joas tek pe mih, “Taklowp taklangra te vüi nape mangmu kown mih Israeluüa maten luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi mih khowmta bowkta khowk chekhai. Nami mangmu mih Juda pren hownia hai Jerusalem marow hownia nakrawi paw kownkow Leviuüa kowi en kowchinah dowi mih tawng rakowi chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 24:7" />Athalia kowi tangila miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowkup hanow nakowi kowh chimsaima mih uanh ün pawla khai, now naiawngün uanh dow Baal thuraiuüa vüi kowi tawngah büah khai. Athalia dow angakma mih masiuüa chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 24:8" />Leviuüa dow mang ana pek iawng thawp tawkpla lowk hanow CHAKRAMANG kimplawt uat kowi towah büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 24:9" />Now süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Israeluüa luk kowi Thurai kowh nar Mosi khowmta bowkta mih mangmu dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e maru kawmuüa nauang pawla kownkow Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow kowi krawi phuang büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 24:10" />Nami tata hanow aluchowuüa hai maru kawmuüa dow awmrawm khai, now amatni dow tawkpla tek dowi mowr amatni kowh mangmu mih uang pawla hanow nami tawkpla kowi uang towah khai. <verse eid="2CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 24:11" />Now Leviuüa dow nami tawkpla mih ni towng mang kowh maru iukuüa tut-e kowpawla reng chekhai. Now nami tawkpla kowi tangka tek mih khi khowk hanow mang kowh cha rui mih hai uamow lang kri mih kowh maru iuk dow uangah hanow uang klaita reng chekhai, now nami dow atowk rah kowi plan towla reng chekhai. Naiawng hai pani kowh pani tangka mih ahuma uang takrüm khai. <verse eid="2CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 24:12" />Now nami tangka dow CHAKRAMANG kim rawk miuüa rut kowi mang Joas hai Jehoiada iüah mih ap pe khai. Nahanow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kim naplan raw kownkow hua bawp sarauüa hai singh ngen sarauüa kowi ngaah khai, now lawngha hai kri hown kowh lup chang sarauüa kowi paw ngaah büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 24:13" />CHAKRAMANG kim rawk miuüa dow lainowmma towsak khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh lup chang dow chawn reng chekhai. Nami CHAKRAMANG kowh kim dow auown khe kowh iawng akhawtma thawpah büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 24:14" />Now lup chur kung kowi kowh ta marat mih tangka dow mang Joas hai Jehoiada iüah tut-e uang pawla büah khai. Now amatchi dow naiawngün tangka hown CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh vüi thawpla uanh khai: Tikah mih uanap chang müa uanh ün, kep ün, akeng mih kuh hai tai uanh ün chekhai. Jehoiada sing uowi mowr dow tikah mih uanap pawi CHAKRAMANG kim kowi chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 24:15" />Jehoiada dow alawngtangma mowr singla khai, now aia dow 130 ning khe kowng khai. <verse eid="2CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 24:16" />Aia dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi Thurai hai aia kim vüi kowi lup iung changla khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh uak dow David marow kowi kowh manguüa tadupra kowi dupah khai.<verse eid="2CH 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Joas kowh angak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 24:17" />Jehoiada kowng kung kowi Juda aluchowuüa dow mang Joas tut-e uangah hanow uang chupah khai. Now mang Joas kowi amatni kowh prengia pek laiklow pe süntaah khai. <verse eid="2CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 24:18" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai kowi nuata hanow Asera limpu kowi hai arup aren kowi cham chupiia büah khai. Amatni kowh nami angak rakowi Thurai kowh kunmaraura dow Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow luk kowi uang ting khai. <verse eid="2CH 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 24:19" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow aia prakowi amatni kowi nauang pawla kownkow risiuüa kowi uang chin pe khai, now nami risiuüa dow amatni Thurai prakowi nauang plan kownkow uang tek pe khai. Tawkche amatni dow nau sünta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 24:20" />Nakhowk khe Thurai lümla dow uamow Jehoiada kowh chapa Zekaria luk kowi uang ting khai. Now Zekaria dow maru kawmuüa pur kowi iowng se tek pe mih, “Thurai tek mih, ‘Tawngplawng kowchow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek enni chün dowi? Naiawng rakowi enni changah mih lup naphaw kown nadowi. CHAKRAMANG kowi enni nuata khai rakowi CHAKRAMANG paw nuata enni khai bowt,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 24:21" />Nachenganchepaw maru kawmuüa dow Zekaria kowi nakowngta kown mih sangkrang khai, now aia kowi dow mang ana pek hown CHAKRAMANG kim viadawng kowi huaklu hown kowng pat kuakah khai. <verse eid="2CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 24:22" />Aia luk kowi kowh Jehoiada kaah sakowm iawng uowi mih tuakla dowi kowi mang Joas dow Jehoiada kowh chapa Zekaria kowi saita khai. Aia kowng mih khin khe Zekaria tekla mih, “CHAKRAMANG dow mami en kowh lup nakhi hanow narip en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 24:23" />Auai ning khe dow Siria siphaiuüa mih mang Joas kowi uang kingküaah khai bowt. Amatni dow Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow kowi uang senah hanow aluchowuüa maten kowi kowngla bowk khai. Now amatni uang rupla mih uanh maten dow Damaska marow kowi kowh amatni kowh mang tut-e uang pawla büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 24:24" />Siria siphaiuüa uang mih dow a-echow taih chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw Juda siphaiuüa thum iukma mih kowi dow amatni rut kowi CHAKRAMANG ap-ah rakowi nowngta büah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Judauüa dow CHAKRAMANG amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai kowi nuata büah khai. Naiawng hai mang Joas kowi dow Siriauüa hown CHAKRAMANG ripah khai. <verse eid="2CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 24:25" />Siriauüa dow Joas kowi bawpla nak hanow powtta pe khai. Uamow Jehoiada kowh chapa kowi kowngta khai rakowi Joas kowi dow aia kowh maru iukuüa nasaita kown mih sangkrang khai, now aia kowi dow mawk rah luk kowi aia kowh maru iukuüa saita hanow David marow kowi dupah khai. Nachenganchepaw aia kowi dow manguüa kowh tadupra kowi dupah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 24:26" />Mang Joas kowi nasaita kown sangkrang mih maru iukuüa dow Zabad hai Jehozabad iüah chekhai. Zabad dow Amawnuüa chenchap Simeat pami masiuüa kowh chapa, now Jehozabad dow Moabuüa chenchap Simrit pami masiuüa kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 24:27" />Joas kowh chapauüa lawnguan, aia luk kowi kowh nauang phaw kown mih lawnguan hai Thurai kim rawk lawnguan dow “Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Amazia mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2CH 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2CH 25" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Amazia chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 25:1" />Amazia dow 25 ning khe chowm mang khai. Aia dow 29 ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Jerusalem marow hownia kowh Jehoadin chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 25:2" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai. Tawkche aia kowh sak maiow hown nadowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 25:3" />Aia dow nachowm mang kown mih alow ka hown krowksang a-pa kowi saita mih maru iukuüa maten kowi aia krawi saita bowk khai. <verse eid="2CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 25:4" />Nachenganchepaw aia dow Mosi rirow bowih kowi kowh arui uowi iawng naiawngün maru iukuüa kowh chauüa kowi saila dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Mosi rirow bowih kowi dow maiawng CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek uowi chekhai, “Chauüa changta angak rakowi u-pa kowi naia kowngta kown nadowi, now u-pa changta angak rakowi chauüa kowi paw naia kowngta kown nadowi. Chang ngak mih maru chowtaih nakowng ngengche kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 25:5" />Nami kung kowi Amazia dow Judauüa maten kowi kuaah lawmah khai, now amatni chowlowkkow krungchak iawng Juda hai Benjamin krungchakuüa hownia 1,000 ia siphai luk kowi kowh aluchowuüa kowi hai 100 ia siphai luk kowi kowh aluchowuüa kowi aia nimkrüa kowi towah khai. Aia dow pirmi ning chih mih hownia nami luk kowi kowh tasen uangh khowk mih kachakuüa nget kowi kloah khai, now naiawngün maru iun dow 300,000 ia chekhai. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow reh hai kawngma dowk kiakma chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 25:6" />Aia dow 100,000 ia Israel siphaiuüa kowi kuh 3,400 set hown ngaah khai.<verse eid="2CH 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 25:7" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai maru lowk ia mih mang tut-e uang khai. Now tek pe mih, “Aw mangkri, mami Israel siphaiuüa kowi hangkow hawla tasen diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow tawngphak pra kowh Israel chenchap Efraim krungchakuüa tut-e tawi uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 25:8" />Now kowbüah kowi pawla hanow sakkraingma hown en cham tasen chepaw Thurai dow en kowh ransu-uüa tut-e nape sum en kown taih. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ia awngla kown mih hai ia sumla kown mih kür dow Thurai tut-e chowtaih,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 25:9" />Nakhowk khe Thurai maru kowi Amazia tek pe mih, “Tawkche Israel siphaiuüa kowi ang ngala mih kuh 3,900 set mih dow tawng chow ang nachangah kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:9">Now Thurai maru klangah mih, “Nami lak-e hu Thurai nowng pe en chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 25:10" />Nahanow Amazia dow Efraimuüa süng hownia kowh ngaah mih Israel siphaiuüa kowi amatni pren kowi pe mangta khai. Naiawng rakowi nami Israel siphaiuüa dow Judauüa luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai, now atawm kunmarau hown amatni pren kowi kowmang büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 25:11" />Amazia dow sakkraingma hown aia kowh siphaiuüa hown Awisa lawngrawi kowi nakowsen Edawmuüa kownkow kowkowi khai, now aia dow 10,000 ia Edawm siphaiuüa kowi saiah khai. <verse eid="2CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 25:12" />Now Juda siphaiuüa paw 10,000 ia Edawm siphaiuüa kowi asing khümla khai, now rak luk hownia nawtah büah khai. Nahanow amatni dow hing tadi iawm khai.<verse eid="2CH 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 25:13" />Nachenganchepaw tasenra kowi pawla dowi mih Israel siphaiuüa dow Samari marow hownia Bet-Hawrawn marow mowr mih kua hai marow krawi piakta bowk khai, now maru iun 3,000 ia kowi saila büah khai. Nami klen kowi nakowi kowh dawngthawnguan paw pawla büah bowk khai.<verse eid="2CH 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 25:14" />Amazia dow Edawm siphaiuüa hown ki tasen kung kowi Jerusalem kowi uang plan khai. Nakhowk khe aia dow Edawmuüa kowh arup aren ün uang pawla pe khai. Naiawngün arup aren kowi dow aia mih changah phuchua hai nam iungma mih maikhük ün towk pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 25:15" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow aia luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai. Now aia tut-e Thurai uang chin pe risi lowk ia khai. Nami risi tek pe mih, “En rut hownia khowm padow aia maru-uüa kowi naiawngün thuraiuüa nowng lawngah dowi pache tawngplawng kowchow en tuk chupiiaah khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 25:16" />Now risi kowh laiklow chur dowi tak khe mang tek pe mih, “Mang kowh prengia pek mih ang thawp en khowk bow? Hang lai tham bowt, nadowi now ang kowngta en kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:16">Nachenganchepaw risi tek pe mih, “Thurai napiakta en kown mih kamrütta hüah khowk pami ang tuk. Tawngplawng kowchow panow akeng thuraiuüa kowi nachupiia kown mih lup en chang khai, now ang kowh prengia pek lai sünta kown en nau dowi chekhai,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi dow nami risi dow lai dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amazia kowsen Israeluüa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 25:17" />Nami kung kowi Juda mang Amazia dow aia kowh maru iukuüa tut-e pawla prengia khai, now Israel mang Jehoas tut-e kowchin pe satang phowng mih khai. Jehoas kowh pa dow Jehoahaz chekhai, now Jehoahaz kowh pa dow Jeho chekhai. Aia krawi tek pe mih, “Uang madiah, achi tadowk tasen madiah sik,” pakhai<verse eid="2CH 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 25:18" />Nachenganchepaw Israel pren mang dow laiuat hown Juda pren mang kowi krawi plan tek pe mih, “Akat khe Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh chuh mung dow Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh sidar singh kowi krawi phowng pe satang khai. Aia krawi tek pe mih, ‘En kowh chama kowi ang kowh chapa hown pe tachawngah diah,’ pakhai. Tawkche nami hungh kowi kowh kaurawng uaramchak dow nami chuh mung kowi uang thuata nak khai. <verse eid="2CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 25:19" />Edawmuüa kowi en nowngta khai kowh lainowmma en chang bawri khai. Tawkchedow kim kowi uowi phülü büah, nadowi now phih nauang ting kown. Nami phih dow en matia hai Judauüa vüi piakra naown kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="2CH 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 25:20" />Nachenganchepaw mang Amazia dow mang Jehoas kowh nami laiklow sünta pe dowi chekhai. Naiawng phaw mih dow Thurai hownia kowh chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Edawmuüa kowh thuraiuüa tut-e Amazia kowlü khowng rakowi aia kowi dow Joas rut kowi Thurai ap-ah khai. <verse eid="2CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 25:21" />Naiawng rakowi Israel pren mang Jehoas dow Amazia kowi uang senah khai. Amatchi dow siphai hawmh hown Juda pren kowi kowh Bet-Semes marow kowi tasen iüah khai. <verse eid="2CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 25:22" />Israeluüa tut-e dow Judauüa mih sum chamang sum khai. Amatni dow chowlowkkow kim prakowi powt bowk khai. <verse eid="2CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 25:23" />Israel pren mang Jehoas dow Juda pren mang Amazia kowi Bet-Semes marow kowi khümah khai. Nami kung kowi dow Amazia kowi mih Jerusalem marow kowi Jehoas kowpawla khai, now nami marow tap dow Efraim tapplawt hownia Anui tapplawt mowr 400 muk aia krawi piakta pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 25:24" />Aia dow Obed-Edawm mingkhetah mih Thurai kim hai mang kim kowi kowh kuh, tai hai akeng mih uanh maten pawla bowk khai. Nami klen kowi maru kowi paw khümla sangrum hanow Samari marow kowi aia plan khai.<verse eid="2CH 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 25:25" />Juda pren mang Amazia dow Israel pren mang Jehoas kowng kung kowi paw ta sing laitanga ning tak chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 25:26" />Amazia kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten auown hownia achur pat “Juda hai Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 25:27" />CHAKRAMANG kowi Amazia nuata kung hownia now Jerusalem marowchakuüa mih mang Amazia kowi kingküaah ne khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Lakhis marow kowi cham powt khai. Nachenganchepaw maru kawmuüa dow nakowi kowchin maru hanow aia kowi kowkrawi saita khai. <verse eid="2CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 25:28" />Now aia kowh uak dow kawrnga luk kowi tangla hanow Jerusalem marow kowi uang pawla khai, now aia kowi dow David marow kowi kowh aia pipu-uüa tadupra kowi maru dupah khai.<verse eid="2CH 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="2CH 26" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Uzia chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 26:1" />Juda pren kowi kowh maru maten dow Amazia takcha achapa Uzia kowi ta pe chowmah mang khai. Nakhowk khe Uzia dow laitaruk ning chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 26:2" />A-pa Amazia kowng kung kowi dow Uzia mih Elat marow plan ta powngta khai iawk, now nami marow mih aia plan thawpah khai.<verse eid="2CH 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 26:3" />Uzia chowm mang mih dow laitaruk ning khe chekhai. Aia dow 52 ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Jerusalem marow hownia kowh Jekolia chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 26:4" />Uzia dow a-pa Amazia iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 26:5" />Nami khin khe kowh uamow hai mang kowh prengia pek mih dow Zekaria chekhai. Zekaria sing uowi mowr Uzia dow Thurai nau iawng chang reng chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai kowi ringkaw krang mih aia kowi Zekaria tüngsangah reng chekhai. Thurai nau iawng Uzia chang mowr dow Thurai paw aia kowi peah iungra khai.<verse eid="2CH 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 26:6" />Uzia dow Filistinuüa kowi kowsenah khai. Now Gat marow tap, Jabne marow tap hai Asdawd marow tap dow aia piakta pe khai. Nami kung kowi dow Asdawd marow ria hai Filistinuüa kowh akeng mih arah kowi tap uowi mih marow aia krawi thawp khai. <verse eid="2CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 26:7" />Filistinuüa, Gur-Bal marow kowi kowh Arabuüa hai Meuniuüa hown aia tasen mih khin khe aia kowi Thurai tawi khowngah khai. <verse eid="2CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 26:8" />Amawnuüa dow aia kowi peah mangmu reng chekhai. Naiawng hai Uzia dow uang kür ngamlam khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh ming iung nang iung mih Aigupta pren kowi pat cham tahowng khai.<verse eid="2CH 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 26:9" />Uzia dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Anui tapplawt kowi, Lawngrawi tapplawt kowi hai tap nui kowi thawp kimkrowng khai. <verse eid="2CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 26:10" />Aia dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi paw kimkrowng krawi thawp khai, now tuikuam paw ahuma aia krawi thai khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow awkaw süng hai anaima mih süng kowi aia kowh tawncher thing uowi ahuma chekhai. Aia dow kheti bakan hai uih-ien pantawn chang kowi aklumma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia kowh maru-uüa kowi aiamat kowh asi uowi mih krawng kowi pe changah lup khai, now aiamat kowh hungh kowi dow pe changah grep krum khai.<verse eid="2CH 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 26:11" />Uzia kowh dow tasen kiakma mih siphai thum aiukma uowi chekhai. Amatni dow pathum pathumchow cham tasen kown mih kamrüt taiama chekhai. Naiawngün siphaiuüa mut mih hai pathum pathumchow bak mih dow Jeiel hai Maseia iüah chekhai. Amatni luk kowi kowh siphai aluchow dow Hanani chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 26:12" />Naiawngün siphaiuüa pungmadawng kowi dow aluchowuüa uowi 2,600 ia chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 26:13" />Now tasen kiakma mih siphaiuüa mut dow bowkbowk kowi 307,500 ia chekhai. Naiawngün akürma mih siphai hawmh dow mang cham sen ransu-uüa khe aia kowi lainowmma tawi khowngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 26:14" />Uzia dow siphaiuüa maten kowi kawngma, reh, akhawtma mih lukruk, kow taka müa kowrmow, leba hai iaiba ap müa hua peah reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 26:15" />Jerusalem marow kowi kowh akiakma mih uanh thawp sarauüa thawpah mih tasen müa rutchün khawkleng dow kimkrowng kowi hai tap nui towng kowi aia krawi towah khai. Nakowi aia krawi towah mih auan dow nami hownia leba hown nahawt ia apla kownkow hai aiuk aiukma mih huaklu hown nahawt ia kuakla kownkow chekhai. Aia kowh ming iung nang iung dow alakma mih pren mowr cham tahowng khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi dow lainowmma CHAKRAMANG khowngah khai, now aia dow uang kür ngamlam khai.<verse eid="2CH 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chang bawri rakowi Uzia ka ripra mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 26:16" />Nachenganchepaw aia dow uang kür ngamlam hanow chang bawri khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi aia luk kowi dow piakra uang towm khai. Pakat dow aiamat ngengche maikhük towk rah phuchuara luk kowi kowh nam iungma mih maikhük natowk kownkow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowkup khai, now naiawng hai aia dow CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai kowi kingküala mih angak changta khai. <verse eid="2CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 26:17" />Uamow lang kri mih Azaria hai sakkraingma mih uamow 80 ia dow aia kung tawi hanow alak kowi kowkup büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 26:18" />Nakhowk khe hangah se amatni tek pe mang mih, “Mangkri, CHAKRAMANG vüi nam iungma mih maikhük natowk kown mih alow en kowh uowi dowi. Nam iungma mih maikhük natowk kown mih alow uowi mih dow Arawn krungchakuüa hownia lang kraah mih uamowuüa krowngchow taih. Mami chimsaima mih arah hownia lawt diah, en changta ngak khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai kowh prasi en naka kown nadowi bowt,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2CH 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 26:19" />Nakhowk khe Uzia dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa phuchuara pur kowi chekhai, now aia rut kowi dow maikhük towk müa puh uowi lowk chekhai. Aia dow uamowuüa kowi lainowmma kunmarauah khai, now nakhowk khe linlanma aia kaubeng kowi pik rawka ngak uang phaw khai. <verse eid="2CH 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 26:20" />Uamow lang kri mih Azaria hai akeng mih uamowuüa dow aia prakowi haimü hanow kaubeng kowi kowh pik rawka ngak dow khita khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni mih aia kowi alenma lawtta khai. Now aiamat paw lenlenma lawt khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG ripah mih dow aiamat tatuk khai bowt.<verse eid="2CH 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 26:21" />Mang Uzia kowh pik rawka ngak dow aia kowng dowi mowr uowi khai. Aia dow akeng kim kowi aia malowkchow lang uowi khai, now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi aia kowi dow mapaw pe kowiah dowi bowt chekhai. Now mang kim dow achapa Jotham mih ta mingkhet khai, now aia dow ta kruitown pren khai.<verse eid="2CH 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 26:22" />Uzia kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten auown hownia achur pat rui mih dow Amawz chapa risi Isai chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 26:23" />Akung kowi Uzia dow kowng khai bowt. Aia kowi dow manguüa chengrawng ria kowi kowh dowm kowi maru dupah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru kawmuüa tek mih, “Aia kowh pik rawka ngak uowi,” pakhai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Jotham mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2CH 26:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="2CH 27" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Jotham chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 27:1" />Jotham dow 25 ning khe chowm mang khai. Aia dow laitaruk ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Zadawk kowh chama Jerusa chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 27:2" />Jotham dow a-pa Uzia iawng rowprowp CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai. Tawkche a-pa iawng CHAKRAMANG kim kowi nam iungma mih maikhük towk mih angak dow aia tawi chang dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Juda prenchakuüa dow chang angak reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 27:3" />Jotham dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh alowngma mih tapplawt krawi rawah khai, now Ofel hungh re-e kowh tap paw akhawtma aia krawi rawah khai. <verse eid="2CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 27:4" />Juda pren kowi kowh hungh kowi dow tap uowi mih marow aia krawi thawp khai, now kaurawng kowi dow akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim hai kimkrowng aia krawi thawp khai.<verse eid="2CH 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 27:5" />Jotham dow Amawnuüa kowh mang kowi senah hanow nowngta khai. Naiawng rakowi Amawnuüa dow sum ning mowr ning towng tai 85 mawn, püm 45,000 mawn hai iakmow 45,000 mawn aia kowi peah khai. <verse eid="2CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 27:6" />Mang Jotham dow uang kür ngamlam khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow kaah sakowmma hown CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai tiama kowi mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 27:7" />Jotham kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten, aia cham awng tasen mih lawnguan hai aia kowh chowm krang uowi krang lawnguan dow “Israel hai Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 27:8" />Aia dow 25 ning khe chowm mang khai. Aia dow laitaruk ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 27:9" />Akung kowi Jotham dow kowng hanow David marow kowi maru dupah khai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Ahaz mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2CH 27:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="2CH 28" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Ahaz chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 28:1" />Juda pren kowi Ahaz chowm mang mih dow pirmi ning khe chekhai. Aia dow laitaruk ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup a-pu David chang iawng tawi chang dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 28:2" />Aia dow Israel manguüa iawng tawi chang angak khai. Now aia nachupiiaah kownkow kri hown thawp Baal thurai rup khai. <verse eid="2CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 28:3" />Now aia dow Ben-Hinawm lawngrawi kowi chang tawncher phuchua khai. Aia dow aia kowh chapa kowi khowm padow maih kowi nawmah hanow phuchuala arup khai. Naiawng hai Israeluüa pur hownia kowh CHAKRAMANG prütta mih chenchapuüa iawng suiiai kaniaima mih lup aia tawi chang khai. <verse eid="2CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 28:4" />Aia dow arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi ün, hungh luk kowi ün hai aram chakma mih singh klim towng kowi ün tawncher hown chang phuchua reng chekhai. Now nam iungma mih maikhük paw towk reng chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judauüa kowi Siriauüa hai Israeluüa senah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 28:5" />Ahaz kowh naiawngün angak rakowi aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai mih Siria pren mang rut kowi ap-ah khai. Aia dow Siriauüa tut-e tasen sum khai, now aia kowh siphai sangrum mih kowi paw khümla hanow Damaska marow kowi pawla khai. Aia kowi mih Israel mang Peka rut kowi paw ap-ah khai, now Israel mang dow aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi ahuma saita pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 28:6" />Remalia chapa Peka dow pani sang Juda siphai 120,000 ia kowi saiah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Judauüa dow amatni pipu-uüa chupiiaah mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai kowi nuata khai. <verse eid="2CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 28:7" />Efraim chenchap tasen mih siphai Zikri dow mang Ahaz kowh chapa Maseia, mang kim khet mih maru iuk Azrikam hai mang Ahaz dak kowi kowh lang kri mih Elkana büah kowi saiah khai. <verse eid="2CH 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 28:8" />Now Israel siphaiuüa dow Judauüa kowh masi hai chauüa kowi khümla 200,000 ia büah khai. Now nakowi kowh dawngthawnguan paw Samari marow kowi ahuma pawla büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 28:9" />Samari marow kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh risi Oded pami uowi lowk ia chekhai. Israel siphaiuüa Samari marow kowi uang plan mih khin khe risi Oded dow amatni hown hawt takrum khai. Now Israel siphaiuüa kowi risi Oded tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG enni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai dow Judauüa luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi Judauüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih enni rut kowi apta enni khai. Tawkche enni dow amatni kowi mapaw saksing sanaah dowi matchang saiah khai. Nami satang dow Thurai tut-e ting khai bowt. <verse eid="2CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 28:10" />Now kawmat dow Judauüa hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi enni nachangla nar kown mih enni ka tuak khai. Tawkche enni paw CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai tut-e enni chang ngak mih enni tuk dowi ü? <verse eid="2CH 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 28:11" />Naiawng rakowi ang kowh laiklow sünta büa diah. Enni uang khümla mih Judauüa kowi tainau-uüa iawng tuakah now amatni pren kowi pe mangta büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowh kramra uowima mih kunmaraura dow enni luk kowi uang ting khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 28:12" />Israel aluchowuüa dow risi Oded kowh laiklow nauta ne khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow tasenra hownia uang mang mih maru-uüa pur kowi hawt iowng büah khai. Naiawngün Israel aluchowuüa dow Jehohanan kowh chapa Azaria, Mesilemawt kowh chapa Berekia, Salum kowh chapa Jehiskia hai Hadlai kowh chapa Amasa büah chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 28:13" />Nakhowk khe amatni hawt tek pe mih, “Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi enni nauang ia pawla kown nadowi. Enni che uang pawla hanow CHAKRAMANG tut-e a-i chang lup ngak mih chekhai. A-i kowh ngak aiawng uowi mih klen kowi enni uang plan bawng angak iawk kown ü? A-i kowh angak aiawng uowi towbowt, now CHAKRAMANG kowh kramra uowima mih kunmaraura paw a-i luk kowi uowi khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 28:14" />Naiawng rakowi siphaiuüa dow naiawngün uang khümla mih maru-uüa hai uang kala mih uanh aluchowuüa hai maru kawmuüa pur kowi towah khai. <verse eid="2CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 28:15" />Nami kung kowi Israel aluchowuüa dow Israel siphai hawmh uang pawla mih dawngthawnguan hownia khupdip tawngklai pawah now uang khümla mih maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi kowh tengiow tengklaima miuüa kowi khup pe khai. Now amatni kowi dow tawnguat, phanaikhawk hai chakkham mih peah khai, now ka arau miuüa kowi dow aia phawk pe kanrawn sau khai. Nowng mang dowi miuüa kowi dow kawrngaramchük luk kowi tangla now amatni uowi rah Jeriko marow kowi uang plan saah büah khai. Nami kung kowi amatni dow Samari marow kowi uang plan büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Asuria tut-e mang Ahaz uang lü khowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 28:16" />Nami khin khe mang Ahaz dow Asuria mang tut-e kowlü khowng khai. <verse eid="2CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 28:17" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Edawm siphaiuüa dow Judauüa kowi uang plan senah hanow khümla sangrum büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 28:18" />Now Filistinuüa dow Juda pren kowi kowh awkaw kowi kowh marow hai Negeb süng kowi kowh marow kowi krawi senah khai. Amatni dow Bet-Semes, Aijalawn, Gederawt, Soko Timna hai Gimzo marow ün krawi powngta pe khai. Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten paw krawi powngta pe khai. Nahanow naiawngün arah maten kowi amatni krawi hing uowi khai. <verse eid="2CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 28:19" />CHAKRAMANG dow mang Ahaz kowh ngak rakowi Judauüa kowi kuakah sum khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Ahaz dow Judauüa kowi pe changah ngak ngamlam khai, now aia paw CHAKRAMANG luk kowi mapaw kaah sakowm dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 28:20" />Naiawng rakowi Asuria mang Tiglat-Pileser dow aia tut-e uang hanow khowngah lak dow aia kowi uang senah khai. <verse eid="2CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 28:21" />Nakhowk khe mang Ahaz dow CHAKRAMANG kim, mang kim hai Juda aluchowuüa hownia asung khakma mih dawngthawnguan pawah now Asuria mang kowi krawi sa pe khai. Nachenganchepaw Asuria pren mang saktuak dow taklowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahaz kowh angak hai aia kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 28:22" />Naiawng akrat pusa hown aia uowi khowk chepaw aia dow CHAKRAMANG luk kowi lang kaah sakowm dowi iawng uowi ngamlam chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 28:23" />Aia dow Damaska marow kowi kowh thuraiuüa vüi chang tawncher phuchua khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia ka tuak mih, “Aram manguüa kowi naiawngün thuraiuüa mih khowngah khai. Naiawng rakowi ang nakala khowng kownkow naiawngün thuraiuüa vüi ang nachang pe tawncher phuchua kown,” pakhai. Tawkche aia hai Israel maten luk kowi piakra uang ting mih dow naiawngün thuraiuüa kowi chupiiara kowi chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 28:24" />Ahaz dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh uanh mih arasang chunah hanow tawpta neknek khai. Now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi miapaw uang ia chupiia dowi kownkow aia dow kimbüng maten krawi büngta bowk khai, now Jerusalem marow kowi kowh arah towng kowi dow akeng thuraiuüa vüi krawi thawp phuchuara khai. <verse eid="2CH 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 28:25" />Aia dow akeng mih thuraiuüa vüi nachangla phuchua kownkow Juda pren kowi kowh marow hai kua kowi arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara krawi thawp khai. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG aia pipu-uüa kowh Thurai kowi aia towkah kunmarau khai.<verse eid="2CH 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 28:26" />Ahaz changah mih lup lawnguan maten dow auown hownia achur pat “Juda hai Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 28:27" />Akung kowi Ahaz dow kowng hanow Jerusalem marow kowi maru dupah khai. Tawkche Israel manguüa chengrawng kowi nadowi chekhai. Now aia takcha achapa Hezekia mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2CH 28:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="2CH 29" />
  <para style="s">Mang Hezekia chimsai Thurai chup kim mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 29:1" />Juda pren kowi Hezekia dow 25 ning khe chowm mang khai. Aia dow 29 ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Zekaria chama Abija chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 29:2" />Hezekia dow a-pu David iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 29:3" />Aia chowm mang mih ning uown kowi kowh la uown khe aia dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh kimplawt uowi mih maten krawi uowah khai, now naiawngün kimplawt dow aia rawah khai. <verse eid="2CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 29:4" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG kim satlawt prakowi kowh viadawng kowi uamow hai Leviuüa kowi arasang kuaah lawmah khai. Now uamowuüa kowi mang Hezekia tek pe mih, <verse eid="2CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 29:5" />“Leviuüa low, ang laiklow sünta büah. Enni mih tachim tasai büa diah, now CHAKRAMANG enni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai chup kim paw chimsaiah büa diah. Nami chimsaima mih kim kowi kowh asür alawkma mih uanh maten henta büa diah. <verse eid="2CH 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 29:6" />A-i kowh pipu-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG kaah sakowm dowi iawng uowi khai; amatni dow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai mik kowi angakma mih lup chang reng chekhai, now CHAKRAMANG kowi nuata büah khai. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG uowi rah hownia cham dangta lumowr büah khai, now CHAKRAMANG pra dow dangta kung büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 29:7" />Amatni dow kimpuk prakowi kowh kimplawt ün paw büngta khai, now maibu ün paw mitta büah khai. Nami chimsaima mih arah kowi dow Israeluüa kowh Thurai vüi nam iungma mih maikhük towk büah dowi chekhai, now tikah mih uanap paw chang büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 29:8" />Naiawng rakowi Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura uang ting khai. Kramra uowima hai suiiai kaniaima amatni kowi CHAKRAMANG changah mih dow enni matia mik hown enni khi khowk chekhai. Maru kawmuüa dow amatni kowi khi hanow takrow khai. <verse eid="2CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 29:9" />Naiawng rakowi a-i kowh pipu-uüa dow tasenra kowi kowng khai, now a-i kowh masi hai chauüa paw cham takhang khai. <verse eid="2CH 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 29:10" />Naiawng rakowi a-i luk kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura natahenla kownkow kawmat mih CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai hown tatow sangbowk laitawm kown ang nau. <verse eid="2CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 29:11" />Ang chapauüa low, kawmat mih hang uowi phülü büah tham bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow aia pur kowi naiowng kown mih, aia lup nachang kown mih hai nachang phuchua kown mih lang klota enni khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 29:12" />Nami kung kowi Levi chenchapuüa dow naiawng hai lup chang prakowi tabak büah khai. Kohat machak hownia dow Amasai kowh chapa Mahat hai Azaria kowh chapa Joel iüah, Merari krungchak hownia dow Abdi kowh chapa Kis hai Jehalel kowh chapa Azaria iüah, Gersawn krungchak hownia dow Zima kowh chapa Joa hai Joa kowh chapa Eden iüah, <verse eid="2CH 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 29:13" />Elizafan krungchak hownia dow Simri hai Jeiel iüah, Asaf krungchak hownia dow Zekaria hai Matania iüah, <verse eid="2CH 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 29:14" />Heman krungchak hownia dow Jehiel hai Simei iüah, Jeduthun krungchak hownia dow Semaia hai Uziel iüah chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 29:15" />Amatni dow amatni tainau Leviuüa kowi kuaah lawmah hanow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi chimsaima towah khai. Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün maru-uüa mih mang Hezekia kowi CHAKRAMANG peah ana iawng CHAKRAMANG kim chimsaima nachang kownkow alak kowi kowkup büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 29:16" />Uamowuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh towklak kowi uowi mih asür alawkma mih uanh maten CHAKRAMANG kim viadawng kowi uang lawtla khai. Now naiawngün uanh dow Leviuüa mih kawtla hanow Kidrawn lawngrawi kowi pawla khai.<verse eid="2CH 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 29:17" />Amatni dow la uown kowi kowh lacher ani hownia CHAKRAMANG kim nachimsai kown mih tarowng khai bowt, now lacher raiat ni khe dow CHAKRAMANG kim kimpuk mowr uang ting büah khai bowt. Nami kung kowi amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kim krawi chimsai raiat ni tak chekhai. Now la uown kowi kowh laitaruk ni khe dow CHAKRAMANG kim krawi chimsai mih churta büah khai bowt.<verse eid="2CH 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 29:18" />Nami kung kowi amatni dow mang Hezekia tut-e kowkowiah now kowtek pe mih, “Tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara hai nakowi kowh bia hailawm CHAKRAMANG kim dow anging chimsaita khowk. Nami klen kowi CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh chimsaima mih kawmpah towk rah pawitang hai nami pawitang kowi kowh uanh maten paw anging chimsaita khowk chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 29:19" />Mang Ahaz dow aia chowm mang mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG kaah sakowm dowi mih lup chang khai. Nakhowk khe kowh aia cham henta mih uanh maten anging chimsaita hanow kamrütta khowk. Naiawngün uanh dow kawmat CHAKRAMANG phuchuara re-e chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kim kowi plan tarowng chupiia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 29:20" />Auai rau mur pah mang Hezekia dow marow kowi kowh maru iukuüa kowi kuala hanow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="2CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 29:21" />Amatni dow pren vüi, CHAKRAMANG kim vüi hai Juda maru-uüa vüi nachangla angak lawt lük müa kownkow chia ranit pum, ruapur ranit pum, ruapur chah ranit pum hai rua ranit pum uang pawla büah khai. Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün tawncher mih CHAKRAMANG phuchuara kowi naphuchuaah kownkow uamow Arawn krungchakuüa kowi mang Hezekia peah ana khai. <verse eid="2CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 29:22" />Naiawng rakowi uamowuüa dow naiawngün chiala rik ngenah hanow avi mih towngah khai, now nami vi dow phuchuara kowi krawi thetah khai. Nami kung kowi dow ruapurla mih ngenah hanow nami vi paw phuchuara kowi krawi thetah khai. Nami kung kowi dow ruapur chah mih ngenah hanow naiawngün vi paw phuchuara kowi krawi thetah büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 29:23" />Nami kung kowi uamowuüa mih angak lawt lük müa rua dow mang hai maru kawmuüa pur kowi uang pawla khai. Now amatni dow naiawngün rua lu kowi tang pe rut khai. <verse eid="2CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 29:24" />Now naiawngün rua mih uamow ngenah khai. Naiawngün rua vi hown dow Israeluüa maten kowh angak lawt lük müa uanap changla khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng hai Israel maten vüi tikah mih uanap hai angak lawt lük müa uanap nachang kown mih ana pe mih dow mang hownia chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 29:25" />Now mang David, risi Gad hai risi Nathan büah ana pek iawng klingchow ün, taraw ün hai tingteng ün hown CHAKRAMANG kim kowi amatni chowlowkkow uowi rah towng nakrawi uowi kownkow mang Hezekia mih Leviuüa kowi tek pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 29:26" />Naiawng rakowi Leviuüa dow mang David kowh tünteu chang müa hai uamowuüa kowh baw ün pawla hanow nakowi kowiowng khai.<verse eid="2CH 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 29:27" />Nakhowk khe mang Hezekia dow phuchuara luk kowi tikah mih uanap pawi nachang kown mih lawt ana khai. Nami tikah mih uanap pawi tarowng hanow meng tek miuüa paw CHAKRAMANG vüi tawi tarowng meng tek khai bowt. Now Israel mang David kowh tünteu chang müa hown tünteu chang miuüa paw tawi chang tünteu hai tawi tum baw khai. <verse eid="2CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 29:28" />Now maru maten CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia khai. Meng tek miuüa dow tek meng khai, now baw tum miuüa dow tum baw khai. Naiawng hai amatni dow tikah mih uanap chur dowi mowr chang büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 29:29" />Tikah mih uanap pawi chur kung kowi dow mang hai aia tut-e kowh uowi miuüa maten tua kung se CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiiaah khai. <verse eid="2CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 29:30" />Nami kung kowi dow David ruiah mih meng hai risi Asaf ruiah mih meng hown CHAKRAMANG kowi nakiowla kownkow mang Hezekia hai aia kowh maru iukuüa mih Leviuüa kowi peah ana khai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow awmrawm kowh tek Thurai kiow meng khai, now krawng kowi tabawk krawm se CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiiaah khai.<verse eid="2CH 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 29:31" />Nami kung kowi Hezekia tek pe maru kawmuüa mih, “Kawmat dow CHAKRAMANG vüi enni tachim tasai khowk. Naiawng rakowi khaleng dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh tawncher phuchua hai tekla awmrawm lai kown mih uanap chang müa uanh uang pawla büa diah,” pakhai. Nahanow amatni bowkbowk dow naiawngün uanh uang pawla büah khai, now sak nau miuüa dow tikah mih uanap chang müa uanh paw uang pawla büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 29:32" />Amatni dow tawncher uanap chang müa chiala 70 pum, ruapur 100 pum hai ruapur chah 200 pum uang pawla khai. Naiawngün tawncher dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh tikah mih uanap chang müa chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 29:33" />Uanap chang müa vüi kowi kowh lang kraah mih tawncher dow chiala 600 pum hai rua 3,000 pum chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 29:34" />Tawkchedow tachim tasai mih uamowuüa e lai rakowi tikah mih uanap kowi kowh tawncher maten pik mih nowng kleu büah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi lup chur dowi mowr hai akeng mih uamowuüa ia tachim tasai dowi mowr amatni tainau Leviuüa mih amatni kowh lup kowi tawi khowngah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow kowmatia chimsaima natowah kown mih lawnguan kowi uamowuüa lak-e Leviuüa mih lang towsak khai. <verse eid="2CH 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 29:35" />Naiawngün tikah mih uanap maten klen kowi paw taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh sau tik pawi, tikah mih uanap pawi hai hüngah mih uanap pawi hailawm ahuma chang pawi büah khai. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh lup chang dow plan tarowng büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 29:36" />Thurai dow maiawngün lup mih aia maru-uüa vüi alenma chang pe khai rakowi mang Hezekia hai maru kawmuüa mih lainowmma awmrawm khai.<verse eid="2CH 29:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="2CH 30" />
  <para style="s">Takat Pawi nachang kownkow kamrüt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-3" style="v" sid="2CH 30:1-3" />Israel hai Juda kowi kowh maru kawmuüa dow khowm bowkta mih pawi ni la uown khe Takat Pawi mih nowng chang büah dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nachang pawi kown mih vüi tachim tasai mih uamow talawk dowi tak chekhai, now maru kawmuüa maten paw Jerusalem marow kowi uang nowng takua talawm bowk dowi tak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi mang Hezekia, aia kowh maru iukuüa hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh maru maten mih pre la mih lacher khe Takat Pawi nachang kown mih nauta bowk khai. Now CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai vüi nachang Takat Pawi kownkow Israeluüa hai Judauüa kowi mang krawi phowng pe satang khai. Nami klen kowi Efraim krungchakuüa hai Manase krungchakuüa kowi paw nami pawi nauang tawi sun kownkow mang krawi pe pe chasak khai. <verse eid="2CH 30:1-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 30:4" />Takat Pawi nachang kownkow khowm bowkta mih akhin sar dow mang hai maru kawmuüa nauta bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 30:5" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai vüi Takat Pawi nauang tawi sunla kownkow Jerusalem marow kowi nauang kown mih Ber-Seba tawngphak hownia Dan marow mowr Israel pren maten kowi amatni krawi phowng satang khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ari arow iawng maru kawmma hown nami pawi nowng sun dowi mih ning krama khowk chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 30:6" />Satang phowng miuüa dow mang hai aia kowh maru iukuüa ruiah mih chasak pawla hanow mang ana pek iawng Israel pren hai Juda pren kowi kowh arah maten kowi cham krawi kowi khai. Nami chasak kowi arui uowi mih dow, “Aw Israeluüa, CHAKRAMANG tut-e, Abraham, Isak hai Israel kowh Thurai tut-e uang plan büa diah. Nahanow Asuria pren mang rut hownia kowh enni nowng plai miuüa tut-e paw aia nauang plan kown. <verse eid="2CH 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 30:7" />Enni mih enni kowh pipu-uüa hai enni kowh tainau-uüa iawng hang tawi chang büa diah. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai kaah sakowm dowi mih lup chang büah khai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow amatni kowi rip chamang ripah khai. Naiawng amatni kowi Thurai changah mih dow enni khi khowk. <verse eid="2CH 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 30:8" />Enni pipu-uüa iawng lai üa kürma hang uowi büah tham bowt. CHAKRAMANG tut-e phai taap büah bowt. Chowngchowng saksakma vüi ang lang krata mih chimsaima mih kim kowi uang büah bowt, now CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi uang chupiia büah bowt. Nahanow enni luk kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh kramra uowima mih kunmaraura dow naprowng kown towbowt. <verse eid="2CH 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 30:9" />CHAKRAMANG tut-e che enni uang plan hanow enni kowh tainau-uüa hai enni kowh chauüa kowi khümla mih maru-uüa dow amatni kowi nasaksing nasanaah kown taih. Nahanow amatni dow mami pren kowi uang nowng plan bowt kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow saksing sanara atekma chekhai. Aia tut-e enni uang plan hanow aia mih nanuata enni kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 30:10" />Satang phowng miuüa dow Efraim krungchakuüa hai Manase krungchakuüa kowh marow maten hai Zebulun krungchakuüa uowi rah mowr krawi kowi büah khai. Nachenganchepaw nakowi kowh maru-uüa dow satang phowng miuüa kowi hawt khareah hai changla rensi büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 30:11" />Nachenganchepaw Aser krungchak, Manase krungchak hai Zebulun krungchak hownia dow khamsum khamdaw hanow Jerusalem marow kowi kowkowi ne khai. <verse eid="2CH 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 30:12" />Juda maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi paw Thurai dow tawi chang lup reng chekhai. Aia dow aia kowh laiklow iawng mang hai maru iukuüa kowh ana pek naia chünla kownkow Juda prenchakuüa kowh saktuak katsang chang pe khai.<verse eid="2CH 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sun Takat Pawi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 30:13" />Naiawng rakowi pre la mih lacher kowi The pe tuah dowi mih kawm Pawi nauang sun kownkow Jerusalem kowi maru iun akawmma uang takua talawm khai. <verse eid="2CH 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 30:14" />Amatni dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh akeng thuraiuüa kowi changla phuchua mih phuchuara maten hai nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa phuchuara maten mih piakta hanow Kidrawn lawngrawi kowi cham kuakta büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 30:15" />Amatni dow pre la kowi kowh lacher laitali ni khe Takat Pawi vüi ngen ruapur chah khai. Nakhowk khe uamowuüa hai Leviuüa dow lainowmma rukrai khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni pungmadawng kowi tachim tasai mih talawk dowi tak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni mih kowmatia kowi tachim tasai büah khai. Now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi tikah mih uanap uang pawla büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 30:16" />Nami kung kowi dow Thurai maru Mosi rirow bowih kowi kowh arui uowi iawng Thurai chup kim kowi amatni kowh lup changra kowi kowiowng büah khai. Now changla phuchua mih tawncher vi dow uamowuüa kowi Leviuüa uang ap pe khai. Now uamowuüa dow phuchuara kowi nami vi krawi thetah khai. <verse eid="2CH 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 30:17" />Maru kawmuüa pungmadawng kowi tawngbak miuüa dow kowmatia kowi tachim tasai dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Takat Pawi kowi kowh ruapur chah mih CHAKRAMANG vüi nowng ngen dowi chekhai. Naiawngün maru-uüa vüi dow Leviuüa ngen pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 30:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="2CH 30:18-19" />Efraim krungchakuüa, Manase krungchakuüa, Isakar krungchakuüa hai Zebulun krungchakuüa hownia uang miuüa dow kowmatia kowi tachimsaila dowi mih lang kawm chekhai. Amatni dow rirow kowi uowi iawng chang dowi chepaw Takat Pawi kowi kowh ngar tawi cha büah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni vüi Thurai tut-e Hezekia awr lü mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, maiawngün maru-uüa dow kowmatia kowi tachim tasai büah dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai kowi sak maiow hown amatni uang chupiia khai. Naiawng rakowi en dow aiungma chedow amatni bowkbowk kowi lawtta diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="2CH 30:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 30:20" />Now CHAKRAMANG dow Hezekia awr tekah mih hawt sünta pe hanow maru-uüa kowi lawtta khai.<verse eid="2CH 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 30:21" />Naiawng hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uang mih maru kawmuüa dow apiawma hown ranit ni mowr The pe tuah dowi mih kawm Pawi sun büah khai. Now uamowuüa hai Leviuüa dow atünma tünteu iung hown CHAKRAMANG rowsi meng ni towng tek büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 30:22" />Leviuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowh lup klangiungma tuk chang khai rakowi amatni kowi Hezekia tek pe awmrawm lai khai. Maru kawmuüa dow ranit ni mowr pawi ngar cha büah khai, taking tasangra uanap chang büah khai, now CHAKRAMANG amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai kowi tek pe awmrawm lai büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Plan chang pawi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 30:23" />Nami kung kowi maru kawm maten dow pawi mih naplan sun ranit ni iawk kown mih nauta bowk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow apiawma hown pawi mih plan sun ranit ni iawk chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 30:24" />Nami pawi kowi kowh maru kawmuüa nachaah kown mih vüi mang Hezekia pe mih dow chiala 1,000 pum hai ruapur 7,000 pum chekhai. Now mang kowh maru iukuüa pe mih dow chiala 1,000 pum hai ruapur 10,000 pum chekhai. Nami takra kowi mih uamowuüa akawmma kowmatia kowi tachim tasai khai.<verse eid="2CH 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 30:25" />Juda pren kowi kowh maru maten, uamowuüa, Leviuüa, Israel prenchakuüa, now Israel hai Juda pren kowi kowh uowi mih prenlang maru-uüa dow piaw büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 30:26" />Naiawng rakowi Jerusalem marow kowi dow lainowmma piawpara uowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow David chapa Sawlawmawn chowm mang kung kowi dow Jerusalem kowi naiawng khowt mih pawi kri katpaw phaw dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 30:27" />Akung kowi uamowuüa hai Leviuüa dow iowng se maru kawmuüa kowi peah prasi khai. Amatni awr lüah mih dow mukuang kowi kowh aia uowi rah chimsaima mih hownia Thurai iu sünta pe khai.<verse eid="2CH 30:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="2CH 31" />
  <para style="s">Kawngmu lawnguan kowi kowh atawi Hezekia krawi plan thik mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 31:1" />Now Israeluüa maten dow Takat Pawi khowk kung kowi Judauüa kowh marow kowi kowkowi büah khai. Now nakowi kowh phuchuala mih hua ün, Asera limpu ün, arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi akeng thurai chup kim ün hai phuchuara ün krawi piakta bowk khai. Now Juda krungchak, Benjamin krungchak, Efraim krungchak hai Manase krungchakuüa uowi rah kowi kowh paw krawi piakta bowk büah khai. Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih amatni chowlowkkow kim prakowi mang büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 31:2" />Hezekia dow uamowuüa hai Leviuüa kowi mih pathum pathumchow bakah hanow amatni chowlowkkow kowh lup khowm pe khai. Tawngbak mih thum kowi dow tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap lup, tawngbak mih thum kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi chupiia lup, now tawngbak mih thum kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi natek awmrawm lai kown mih hai natek rowsi meng kown mih lup aia khowm pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 31:3" />Now CHAKRAMANG kowh rirow iawng rau towng hai iak pra towng tikah mih uanap, Tanai Ni Pawi, Lacher Pawi hai khowm bowkta mih pawi khe phuchuala Thurai kownkow Hezekia mih aia kowh tawncher hawmh hownia pe reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 31:4" />Now uamowuüa hai Leviuüa mih atungma naia changla CHAKRAMANG lup kownkow Hezekia dow uamowuüa hai Leviuüa kowh kakbak nauang pawla pe kown mih Jerusalem marowchakuüa kowi peah ana khai. <verse eid="2CH 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 31:5" />Nami ana tata hown krowksang Israeluüa dow uih müng pau müng, grep tui, kanrawn sau, kuai tui, now üa hai laih hownia kowh rik kuaah mih luprak paw uang pawla büah khai. Amatni kowh luprak maten hownia hamüt bak kowi pabak mih ahuma uang pawla büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 31:6" />Now Juda marow kowi kowh Israeluüa hai Judauüa dow amatni kowh chia hawmh, ruapur hawmh hai rua hawmh hownia hamüt pum kowi papum chi uang pawla büah khai. Now CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai vüi kowi kowh lang kraah mih uanh paw hamüt bak kowi pabak uang pawla büah khai, now naiawngün dow chun iukma changah büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 31:7" />Naiawng hai maru kawmuüa dow sum la hownia uang tarowng pawla hanow ranit la khe churta büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 31:8" />Naiawngün uanh ahuma mih khita hanow Hezekia hai aia kowh maru iukuüa dow CHAKRAMANG hai Israeluüa tut-e tek awmrawm lai khai. <verse eid="2CH 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 31:9" />Now Hezekia dow uamowuüa hai Leviuüa kowi lüntaah mih, “Maiawngün uanh tawng hownia kowh ngai chow?” pakhai. <verse eid="2CH 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 31:10" />Zadawk krungchak hownia kowh uamow lang kri mih Azaria klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG kim kowi maru kawmuüa uang pawla uanh hownia bowt now anging khawr chakkham dowi bowt chekhai, now marat paw ahuma marat khai. CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh maru kawmuüa kowi peah prasi khai. Mow, marat mih ahuma tak chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 31:11" />Naiawng rakowi Hezekia dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi nathawp uanh nungra kownkow Israeluüa kowi peah ana khai, now amatni dow uanh nungra kim mih thawp khai bowt. <verse eid="2CH 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 31:12" />Nami kung kowi dow maru kawmuüa mih awmrawm sung, hamüt bak kowi pabak mih uanh hai CHAKRAMANG vüi lang kraah mih uanh kaah sakowmma hown uang pawla büah khai, now naiawngün uanh mih anungra kowi uang towah büah khai. Naiawngün uanh naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Levi chenchap Konania luk kowi chekhai, now Konania kowi kowh khowng mih dow atainau Simei chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 31:13" />Amatchi dak kowi kowh uanh mingkhet mih dow Jehiel, Azazia, Nahat, Asahel, Jerimawt, Jozabad, Eliel, Ismakia, Mahat hai Benaia büah chekhai. Amatni kowi dow mang Hezekia hai Thurai chup kim kowi kowh maru iukuüa kowh lang kri mih Azaria iüah towah mih chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 31:14" />Thurai tut-e kowmatia sak nau hown uang chang phuchua khe kowh uanh mingkhet mih dow Thurai chup kim satlawt pra kowh tapplawt chawng mih Levi krungchak Imna chapa Karea chekhai. Now CHAKRAMANG tut-e uang pawla mih awmrawm sung hai lang chimsai mih uanh uamowuüa hai Leviuüa kowi naret pe kown mih kurdik paw aia luk kowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 31:15" />Aia kowh kaah sakowmma mih akhowng miuüa dow Eden, Miniamin, Jesua, Semaia, Amaria hai Sekania büah chekhai. Amatni dow Leviuüa uowi rah marow hai kua towng kowi aiuk asowm bowkbowk kowi naiawngün uanh krawi ret pe reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 31:16" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi ni towng kowh chang lup reng mih uamowuüa kowi paw ret pe uanh reng chekhai. Naiawngün uamowuüa dow 30 ning hownia nami luk kowi kowh chowlowkkow krungchak ming tang bowih kowi ming rui uowi miuüa chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 31:17" />Uamowuüa kowh ming dow amatni chowlowkkow machak ming tang bowih kowi ruiah khai, now pirmi ning hownia nami luk kowi kowh Leviuüa kowh ming dow amatni kowh lup bak uowi iawng chowlowkkow thumchak ming tang bowih kowi ruiah khai. <verse eid="2CH 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 31:18" />Nami klen kowi amatni bowkbowk kowh masi hai chauüa ming paw amatni krungchakuüa ming tang bowih kowi ruiah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow uamowuüa hai Leviuüa dow kaah sakowmma hai Thurai vüi kowi lang takra büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 31:19" />Nami klen kowi mang Hezekia dow Juda pren kowi kowh marow riaret kowi uowi mih Arawn krungchak uamowuüa kowi amatni kakbak napeah kownkow tow pe maru khai. Tawkche naiawngün maru-uüa peah mih dow Arawn krungchak uamowuüa hai ming tang bowih kowi ming rui uowi mih Leviuüa kowi chowtaih.<verse eid="2CH 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 31:20" />Naiawng hai Hezekia dow Juda pren kowi kowh arah maten kowi CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai mik kowi aiungma hai anowmma mih lup krawi chang khai. <verse eid="2CH 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 31:21" />Aia dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup hai ari aiang nachün kown mih lawnguan kowi aia changah mih lup maten sak maiow hown changah khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh lup dow chawn reng chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 31:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="2CH 32" />
  <para style="s">Judauüa tut-e Asuriauüa sum mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 32:1" />Naiawng hai lup maten kaah sakowmma Hezekia ki changta bowk kung kowi dow Asuria pren mang Senakerib mih Judauüa kowi uang senah khai. Senakerib mih Judauüa kowh tap uowi mih marow hai kua ün uang rumta lut khai. Aia dow naiawngün kua hai marow maten aia vüi napowngta bowk kown mih ka tuak khai.<verse eid="2CH 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 32:2" />Now naiawng Senakerib nauang sen Jerusalem marow kownkow kamrüt mih dow Hezekia mih tuk khai bowt. <verse eid="2CH 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 32:3" />Naiawng rakowi Hezekia mih aia kowh siphai aluchowuüa hai tasen kiakma miuüa hown tapaw prengia hanow marow uat pra kowh tui hawrra maten napitta kown mih kamrüt khai. <verse eid="2CH 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 32:4" />Nakhowk khe maru akawmma takua talawmah hanow marow uat pra kowh hawr mih aw hai awchawng tui maten krawi pitta bowk büah khai. Amatni tek mih, “Asuria pren manguüa hai siphaiuüa uang rum a-i khe ahuma hang pacham ka tui lah,” pakhai. <verse eid="2CH 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 32:5" />Now Hezekia mih tap takhue mih rah maten krawi plan raw khai, now tap luk kowi kowh kangchawngra kimkrowng akhawtma krawi thawp khai. Nami klen kowi aia dow tap uat kowi paw krawi plan thawp pe tap lowk tak chekhai, now David marow satlawt pra kowh thiaah mih arah paw akhawtma krawi thawpah ngamlam khai. Nami klen kowi aia dow tasen müa rutchün khawkleng hai kawngma ün ahuma thawpah khai.<verse eid="2CH 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 32:6" />Aia dow maru kawmuüa luk kowi tow pe siphai aluchowuüa khai, now amatni kowi dow marow tapplawt re-e kuaah lawmah hanow tek pe sak khawt lai khai. <verse eid="2CH 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 32:7" />Aia tek pe mih, “Akhawtma hai sakkraingma uowi büa diah. Asuria pren mang hai aia kowh siphai kawm kowi khita now hangkow kram büah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia hown kowh uowi miuüa lak-e a-i hown kowh uowi mih lang kri lang kraing chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 32:8" />Aia hown kowh uowi mih dow maru kür chowtaih. Nachenganchepaw nakhowng a-i kownkow hai a-i vüi nadowk tasen kownkow a-i hown tawi uowi mih dow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai chekhai,” pakhai. Now maru kawmuüa dow Juda pren mang Hezekia kowh laiklow tata hanow ka süngürra khai.<verse eid="2CH 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Senakerib khare Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 32:9" />Now Asuria pren mang Senakerib mih aia kowh siphaiuüa maten hown Lakhis marow umta hüah reng tak khe Jerusalem marow kowi kowchin maru sangrum khai. Now Juda pren mang Hezekia hai Judauüa maten kowi nakowtek pe kown mih laiklow naiawngün maru-uüa kowi aia krawi tek pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 32:10" />Aia krawi tek pe mih, “Asuria pren mang Senakerib tek mih maiawng, ‘Mia luk kowi chow enni neplawng nesak kowh rumta enni hüah khowk chepaw Jerusalem kowi enni uowi rengreng tak? <verse eid="2CH 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 32:11" />Tui sakkrai hawm sakkrai hown enni nakowng kown mih Hezekia nau chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Asuria pren mang rut hownia CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nalawng enni kown taih pahai aia kuan enni mih chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 32:12" />Arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara hai phuchuara krawi piakta mih dow Hezekia matia chowbowt nadowi bow? Jerusalem kowi kowh phuchuara lowkchow mih pur kowi taih naia chupiia kown mih hai nami luk kowi chowtaih naia chang phuchua kown pami Jerusalem marowchak hai Juda prenchakuüa kowi tek pe mih dow aia chowbowt nadowi bow?<verse eid="2CH 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 32:13" />“‘Akeng prenchakuüa maten kowi ang hai ang kowh pipu-uüa tawng chow changah mih enni tuk dowi bow? Naiawngün prenchakuüa kowh thuraiuüa ang rut hownia amatni kowh pren nowng lawng pe tak bow? <verse eid="2CH 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 32:14" />Ang pipu-uüa piakah mih prenchakuüa kowh thuraiuüa pungmadawng hownia amatni kowh maru-uüa kowi ang rut hownia nowng lawng mih mia chow uowi? Naiawng now tawng iawng chow enni kowh Thurai mih ang rut hownia nanowng lawng enni kown? <verse eid="2CH 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 32:15" />Hezekia kowi naiawng nakuan enni kown mih khin hangkow peah büah tham bowt. Aia kowi hangkow owm büah tham bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tawng iawng mih chenchap hai prenchak kowh thurai paw amatni kowh maru-uüa kowi ang hai ang pipu-uüa rut hownia nowng lawngah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi enni kowh thuraiuüa ngam padow ang rut hownia nowng lawng enni kown nadowi pami achima tukah mih towbowt,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 32:16" />Naiawngün klen kowi paw Senakerib kowh maru-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG Thurai hai aia kowh nar Hezekia kowi khareah mih laiklow ahuma tak tekla khai. <verse eid="2CH 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 32:17" />Now CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowi nakhareah kownkow aia kowh chasak kowi Senakerib ruila mih, “Akeng prenchakuüa kowh thuraiuüa mih amatni kowh maru-uüa kowi ang rut hownia lawngah dowi mih iawng Hezekia kowh Thurai paw ang rut hownia aia kowh maru-uüa kowi nalawngah kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 32:18" />Naiawngün laiklow dow Senakerib kowh maru-uüa mih Hebrai lai hown atün atünma uang krawi tekah khai. Naiawng amatni krawi tek mih dow Jerusalem marow tap luk kowi kowh maru-uüa mih ta hanow lainowmma pacham kram lah, now amatni Asuriauüa nanowng powngta kown towbowt pakowh chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 32:19" />Amatni dow rut hown kowh thawpah mih akeng chenchapuüa kowh thuraiuüa lawnguan iawng Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Thurai lawnguan kowi paw uang krawi tek khai.<verse eid="2CH 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem kowi CHAKRAMANG lawngah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 32:20" />Naiawng rakowi mang Hezekia hai Amawz kowh chapa risi Isai iüah mih kar se mukuang kowi kowh Thurai tut-e awr lü awr leng khai. <verse eid="2CH 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 32:21" />Nahanow CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh kramamu lowk ia kowi uang iu chin pe khai. Nami kramamu mih Asuria pren mang kowh tangbung khupra kowi uowi mih siphaiuüa maten, siphai aluchowuüa maten hai akeng mih aluchowuüa maten kowi asaima uang piakta khai. Naiawng rakowi mang Senakerib dow tawmpa rukrai hown aiamat pren kowi plan mang khai. Now aia kowh thurai chup kim kowi aia kowkup khe aia kowi dow aia kowh chapauüa pre sum ia mih saita khai.<verse eid="2CH 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 32:22" />Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG dow Asuria pren mang hai akeng mih ransu-uüa rut hownia Hezekia hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa kowi lawngah khai. Naiawng rakowi paprenma thaulangma hown uowi khai. <verse eid="2CH 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 32:23" />Nami khin hownia bowt now chenchapuüa maten mih mang Hezekia kowi lainowmma ringkawah khai. Aia kowi dow asung khakma mih uanh ün maru uang peah khai, now CHAKRAMANG vüi paw Jerusalem marow kowi maru akawmma uang pawla pe awmrawm sung khai.<verse eid="2CH 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezekia arau uowi mih hai bawrira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 32:24" />Nami khin khe Hezekia dow arau uowi kowh kowng ngialia khai. Nakhowk khe Hezekia mih chup Thurai hanow aia kowi dow Thurai uang klangah khai, now aia naiung kown mih amatra tüng pe lowk khai. <verse eid="2CH 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 32:25" />Nachenganchepaw Hezekia dow uang bawri khai; aia dow aia ka prasi chepaw tek awmrawm lai dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia luk kowi hai Jerusalem marow hown Juda pren luk kowi CHAKRAMANG mih kunmarau khai. <verse eid="2CH 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 32:26" />Nakhowk khe dow Hezekia mih aia kowh bawrira tukta hanow khamsum khamdaw khai, now Jerusalem marowchakuüa paw naiawng tawi chang khai. Naiawng rakowi Hezekia chowng kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura mih amatni luk kowi uang kla dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezekia kowh kurengra hai kri kraingra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 32:27" />Hezekia kowh dow dawngthawnguan hai ringkawra ahuma chekhai. Aia dow aia kowh kuh, tai, asung khakma mih hua, nam iungma mih paingbawng, kawngma hai akeng mih asung khakma mih uanh natowla kownkow thawp dawngthawnguan towk rah kim lowk khai. <verse eid="2CH 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 32:28" />Nami klen kowi luprak, grep tui sar hai kanrawn sau towk rah kim paw thawp lowk khai, now rua, ruapur hai akeng mih tawncher towk rah kim paw thawpla lowk khai. <verse eid="2CH 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 32:29" />Naiawngün klen kowi paw aia kowi dow Thurai mih ahuma peah kurengra khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh chia, rua hai ruapur mih ahuma prung khai. Now aia matia vüi marow paw ahuma aia thawpla khai.<verse eid="2CH 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 32:30" />Now Gihawn tuikuam mih owngta now David kowh marow Jerusalem kowi satkup prakowi uang pawla tui mih paw Hezekia chekhai. Aia dow aia changah mih lup maten chawn reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 32:31" />Now akat khe dow aia vüi kowi kowh Thurai kowh awdara lup lawnguan kowi nauang lüntaah kownkow Babulawn pren kowi kowh aluchowuüa mih Hezekia tut-e uang chin maru khai. Nakhowk khe dow aia prakowi Hezekia tape nowm chünchü pami natukla kownkow Thurai mih Hezekia kowi chaingah khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Hezekia hownia powt khai.<verse eid="2CH 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezekia kowh mangra chur mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 32:32" />Hezekia kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten hai Thurai kowi kowh aia ringkaw mih lawnguan dow Amawz kowh chapa Risi Isai Kowh Mukmang bowih kowi hai “Juda hai Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 32:33" />Akung kowi Hezekia dow kowng hanow David krungchakuüa chengrawng aluk prakowi maru dupah khai. Aia kowng khe aia kowi dow Juda prenchak maten hai Jerusalem marowchak maten mih tüng pe ringkawra khai. Now aia takcha kowi dow achapa Manase mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2CH 32:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="2CH 33" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Manase chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 33:1" />Mang Manase dow laipre ning khe chowm mang khai, now aia dow 55 ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2CH 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 33:2" />Manase dow Israeluüa pur hownia kowh CHAKRAMANG prütta mih chenchapuüa iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi suiiai kaniaima mih lup tawi chang khai. <verse eid="2CH 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 33:3" />A-pa Hezekia krawi piakta khowk mih arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara ün aia krawi plan chang khai iawk. Nami klen kowi aia dow Baal thuraiuüa vüi thawp phuchuara ün khai, now Asera limpu ün tawi thawp khai. Aia dow kuang dawng kowi kowh krek ün kowi chupiia khai. <verse eid="2CH 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 33:4" />“Jerusalem marow kowi ang nauowi kown” pahai CHAKRAMANG tekah mih CHAKRAMANG kowh nami kim kowi Manase dow akeng thuraiuüa vüi thawp phuchuara ün khai. <verse eid="2CH 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 33:5" />Aia dow kuang dawng kowi kowh krek maten kowi nachupiiala kownkow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh viadawng pre buk mih kowi thawp phuchuara ün khai. <verse eid="2CH 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 33:6" />Aia dow Hinawm lawngrawi kowi aia kowh chapauüa kowi maih kowi nawmah hanow phuchuala arup khai. Now mantan chang miuüa, hawra mük miuüa, süngnam hai lümla ngak hown taklawp taiua miuüa tut-e aia dow cham paw prengia khai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang hai CHAKRAMANG kowi towkah kunmarau khai.<verse eid="2CH 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 33:7" />Aia thawpah mih arup dow Thurai kim kowi aia towah khai. Nami kim lawnguan kowi David hai achapa Sawlawmawn kowi Thurai tek pe mih, “Jerusalem marow kowi kowh ang kowh kim kowi dow maru kawmuüa mih chowngchowng saksakma nauang chupiia ang kown. Nami marow dow Israel laipre chen hownia kowh ang lang kloah mih chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 33:8" />Mosi hownia kowh Israeluüa kowi ang peah mih ari aiang, ari arow hai ana maten che kaneuma amatni chün khai hanow amatni pipu-uüa kowi kowh ang peah mih pren hownia amatni kowi dow ang naprütah kown nadowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="2CH 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 33:9" />Nachenganchepaw Judauüa hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa kowi dow Manase pe changla angak khai. Amatni dow amatni pur hownia CHAKRAMANG prütta mih chenchapuüa lak-e lang chang angak khai.<verse eid="2CH 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manase leta saktuak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 33:10" />CHAKRAMANG dow Manase hai aia maru-uüa kowi uang klangah khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow sünta pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 33:11" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow amatni kowi nauang senah kownkow Asuria pren mang kowh siphai aluchowuüa kowi uang pawla pe khai. Now nami siphai aluchowuüa dow Manase kowi khümah hanow rut kowi krua pe lawngha kua khai, now kri leng hown tawmla hanow Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai. <verse eid="2CH 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 33:12" />Kla phih khin khe Manase dow CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai tut-e awr lü khowng khai, now aia dow aia pipu-uüa kowh Thurai pur kowi uang khamsum khamdaw khai. <verse eid="2CH 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 33:13" />Naiawng hai Manase dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr lü awr leng hanow CHAKRAMANG dow hawt sünta pe khai. Now Jerusalem marow hai aia kowh pren dow mang Manase kowi CHAKRAMANG plan peah khai iawk. Nami hownia bowt now Manase dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih Thurai pami tuk khai bowt. <verse eid="2CH 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 33:14" />Nami kung kowi aia dow David marow uat kowi kowh tap mih alowngma plan thawpah hanow akhawtma changah khai. Aia dow lawngrawi kowi kowh Gihawn tuikuam hownia Dam Tapplawt mowr krawi plan thawpah khai, now Dam Tapplawt hownia Ofel hungh mowr krawi plan thawp khai. Aia dow Judauüa kowh tap uowi mih marow ün kowi siphai aluchowuüa kowi towah khai.<verse eid="2CH 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 33:15" />Now akeng thuraiuüa kowh arup aren ün dow CHAKRAMANG kim hownia aia cham kuakta khai. Nami klen kowi Jerusalem marow hai CHAKRAMANG kim uowi rah hungh kowi kowh aia thawpah mih phuchuara maten paw marow uat kowi aia cham kuakta khai. <verse eid="2CH 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 33:16" />Nami kung kowi aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowh phuchuara mih plan rawah khai iawk, now nami phuchuara luk kowi dow taking tasangra uanap hai tekla awmrawm lai mih uanap pawi chang pe khai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowi nachupiia kownkow Juda maru-uüa kowi peah ana khai. <verse eid="2CH 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 33:17" />Nakhowk khe paw maru kawmuüa dow arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi chang tawncher phuchua reng tak chekhai. Tawkche amatni chang mih nami phuchua dow CHAKRAMANG Thurai vüi chowtaih.<verse eid="2CH 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 33:18" />Manase kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten, Thurai tut-e kowh aia awr lü awr leng mih lawnguan hai CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai ming hown risiuüa tek pe mih laiklow maten dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 33:19" />Now aia awr lü awr leng mih lawnguan, aia awr lü mih khin khe Thurai hawt sünta pe mih lawnguan, aia kowh angak maten hai CHAKRAMANG kaah sakowm dowi mih lup aia chang mih lawnguan maten dow Risiuüa Lawnguan pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. Nami klen kowi Thurai pur kowi aiamat khamsum khamdaw dowi rawn khe kowh arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara aia thawpah mih lawnguan, Asera limpu hai aia thawpah mih arup lawnguan maten paw Risiuüa Lawnguan pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 33:20" />Akung kowi Manase dow kowng hanow aia kim kowi maru dupah khai. Now aia takcha kowi dow achapa Amawn mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2CH 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Amawn chowng mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 33:21" />Juda pren kowi Amawn chowm mang mih dow 22 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow pre ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2CH 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 33:22" />Amawn dow a-pa Manase iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup tawi chang khai. A-pa Manase thawpah mih arup maten kowi Amawn dow chupiia khai, naiawngün arup kowi dow aia phuchua pe tawncher khai. <verse eid="2CH 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 33:23" />Tawkche aia dow a-pa Manase iawng CHAKRAMANG pur kowi khamsum dowi; aia dow chang angak rengreng chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 33:24" />Aia kowh maru iukuüa dow aia kowi nasaita kown sangkrang hanow aia kim kowi aia kowi dow saita khai. <verse eid="2CH 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 33:25" />Tawkche mang Amawn kowi sai miuüa maten kowi dow prenchakuüa mih saita bowk khai. Now aia takcha kowi dow achapa Josia kowi amatni ta pe chowmah mang khai.<verse eid="2CH 33:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="2CH 34" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Josia chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 34:1" />Juda pren kowi Josia chowm mang mih dow raiat ning khe chekhai. Aia dow 31 ning mowr Jerusalem marow mih kruitownla khai. <verse eid="2CH 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 34:2" />Josia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai. Aia dow akeng mih tiama pra cham powt dowi kowi a-pu David chang iawng tawi chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josia krawi piakta arup aren mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 34:3" />Josia chowm mang mih raiat ning khe aia dow ning diachow taih tak chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow a-pu David kowh Thurai kowi uown cham khai. Now aia chowm mang mih laipre ning khe dow Juda kowi kowh arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara, Asera limpu, herah mih arup hai sawnah mih arup aren mih Jerusalem marow hownia aia krawi uown piak khai. <verse eid="2CH 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 34:4" />Aia dow Baal thurai kowh phuchuara ün piakta khai, now nami phuchuara ria kowi kowh towkla maikhük mih phuchuara paw piakta naknak khai. Nami klen kowi Asera limpu, hua hown kowh herah mih arup hai sawnah mih arup aren mih dinchow iawng adichow dita pe khai. Nami di dow naiawngün arup aren kowi chupiia reng miuüa kowh tadupra kowi krawi pruiah khai. <verse eid="2CH 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 34:5" />Now Baal thurai uamowuüa kowh hut dow phuchuara luk kowi tikah khai. Naiawng hai aia dow Jerusalem marow hai Juda marow kowi chimsaiah khai. <verse eid="2CH 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 34:6" />Aia dow Manase süng, Efraim süng hai Simiawn süng kowi kowh marow hai ariaret kowi kowh arah maten klen kowi alakma kowi kowh Naptali süng mowr mih arah maten paw aia krawi chimsaiah khai. <verse eid="2CH 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 34:7" />Aia dow naiawngün marow hai kua kowi kowh phuchuara maten, Asera limpu, hua kowi herah mih arup hai sawnah mih arup aren ün krawi piakta bowk khai. Nami klen kowi Israel pren kowi kowh maikhük towk müa phuchuara paw aia krawi tawpta pe nak khai. Nami kung kowi aia dow Jerusalem marow kowi uang plan khai.<verse eid="2CH 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 34:8" />Pren hai CHAKRAMANG kim chimsaita kung kowi aia chowm mang mih lairaiat ning khe Josia mih CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai kim nakowraw kownkow kowchin maru khai. Aia kowchinah miuüa dow Azalia kowh chapa Safan, marow kruitown mih Maseia hai Jehoahaz kowh chapa mang kowh chownglawng lawnguan rui mih Joa büah chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 34:9" />Amatni dow uamow lang kri mih Hilkia tut-e kowkowi khai, now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh maru kawmuüa uang pawla mih tangka pawisa maten uamow lang kri mih kowi peah büah khai. Naiawngün tangka pawisa dow Manase krungchakuüa, Efraim krungchakuüa, akeng mih Israeluüa, Juda krungchakuüa, Benjamin krungchakuüa maten hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa hownia kowh kimplawt chawng mih Leviuüa hawt pawah mih chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 34:10" />Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün tangka pawisa mih Thurai chup kim rawk miuüa luk kowi kowh mingkhet miuüa rut kowi peah khai. Now amatni dow naiawngün tangka pawisa mih Thurai chup kim rawk miuüa kowi pela sukkri kha khai. <verse eid="2CH 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 34:11" />Nami klen kowi amatni dow singh hown kowh lup chang miuüa hai akeng mih lup chang miuüa kowi ngala khai, now Juda manguüa piakta mih kim rawla kownkow klangiungma bawpah mih hua hai phen paw ranla büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 34:12" />Naiawngün kim chang sarauüa dow kaah sakowmma hown chang lup büah khai. Kim chang sarauüa luk kowi kowh mingkhet miuüa dow Levi chenchap Merari machak hownia kowh Jahat hai Obadia iüah, Kohat machak hownia kowh Zekaria hai Mesulam iüah chekhai. Now Levi chenchap hownia kowh tünteu tep kiakma miuüa dow <verse eid="2CH 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 34:13" />kurdik kur miuüa hai akeng mih lup chang miuüa luk kowi kowh mingkhet mih chekhai. Naiawngün Leviuüa pungmadawng kowi tawngbak mih dow cha rui mih ne, maru iuk ne, now kangchawng mih ne chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamow Hilkia ka rirow bowih mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 34:14" />Now amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh towah mih tangka pawisa mih uang lawtla büah khai. Nakhowk khe Uamow Hilkia dow Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah mih rirow chabowih mih aia kata khai. <verse eid="2CH 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 34:15" />Now cha rui mih Safan kowi uamow Hilkia tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh rirow bowih dow ang ka khowk,” pakhai. Now nami <char style="w">charam tua</char> dow Hilkia mih Safan kowi peah khai.<verse eid="2CH 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 34:16" />Nami kung kowi Safan dow nami charam tua mih mang tut-e uang pawla khai. Now aia tek pe mang mih, “En kowh maru iukuüa mih en pe changah mih lup maten ki changta bowk khowk. <verse eid="2CH 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 34:17" />Amatni dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh tangka pawisa uang lawtla hanow lup chang miuüa hai mingkhet miuüa rut kowi apta khowk,” pakhai. <verse eid="2CH 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 34:18" />Nami kung kowi cha rui mih Safan tek pe mang mih, “Uamow Hilkia pe ang charam tua lowk,” pakhai. Now Safan dow nami charam tua kowi kowh arui uowi mih laiklow mang kowi phat pe khai.<verse eid="2CH 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 34:19" />Now mang dow nami rirow bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih laiklow tata hanow aia khupah mih tawnguat thekta khai. <verse eid="2CH 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 34:20" />Now aia dow uamow Hilkia, Safan kowh chapa Ahikam, Mikaia kowh chapa Akbawr, Safan hai mang kowh maru iuk Asai büah kowi peah ana mih, <verse eid="2CH 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 34:21" />“Mami ka chamta mih bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih lawnguan ang vüi hai makowi kowh Judauüa hai Israeluüa vüi CHAKRAMANG tut-e kowlünta büa diah. CHAKRAMANG dow a-i luk kowi kunmarau mih lün pluplup towbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow a-i kowh pipu-uüa mih mami bowih kowi kowh arui uowi iawng chün dowi chekhai, now nachünah kownkow mami bowih kowi kowh arui uowi iawng amatni dow chang büah dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 34:22" />Now nami laiklow tata hanow uamow Hilkia, Ahikam, Akbawr, Safan hai Asai büah dow masiuüa risi Hulda kowi kowphowk pe khai. Hulda dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh tawnguat mingkhet mih Salum kowh masi chekhai. Now Salum dow Tikva kowh chapa (Harhas kowh chu) chekhai. Hulda uowi mih dow Jerusalem marow lak kowi kowh arah sar kowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 34:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="2CH 34:23-24" />Amatni kowi Hulda tek pe mih, “Israeluüa kowh Thurai pe tek ang mih maiawng: Uang chin enni mih maru tut-e kowkowi hanow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow kowtek pe diah. CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Mami bowih kowi kowh Juda pren mang phat mih kowi kowh arui uowi mih piati maten mami arah kowi hai aia maru-uüa luk kowi ang nauang pawla pe ripra kown. <verse eid="2CH 34:23-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 34:25" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ang kowi nuata ang hanow akeng mih thuraiuüa vüi cham towk maikhük büah khai, now amatni thawpah mih arup aren hown towk ang kunmarau büah khai. Naiawng rakowi mami arah kowi mih ang kowh kunmarau nalün pluplup kown, now nami dow naia mitah kown nadowi,’ pakhai. <verse eid="2CH 34:25" /><verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="2CH 34:26-27" />CHAKRAMANG kowh naukrang natukla kownkow uang chin enni mih Juda pren mang kowi kowtek pe büa diah. CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Mami arah hai aia maru luk kowi kowh piati hai piakra nauang ting kown mih laiklow en ta hanow en kowh sak mih rau khai, now ang CHAKRAMANG pur kowi dow en uang khamsum khai. En matia khupah mih tawnguat dow en thekah khai, now ang pur kowi en uang kar khai. Naiawng rakowi en kowh prasi lük klow dow ang hawt sünta en khowk. <verse eid="2CH 34:26-27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 34:28" />Naiawng rakowi kowng hanow en kowi dow en pipu-uüa tut-e alenma ang napawla en kown, now thaulangma en naka tadupra kown. Mami marow hai marowchakuüa luk kowi phih akraingma ang nauang pawla kown mih dow en natawi khi kown nadowi bowt,’ pakhai,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 34:28">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow kowmang hanow masiuüa risi Hulda krawi tek pe mih naiawngün laiklow mang kowi kowtek pe büah khai.<verse eid="2CH 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow nachün kownkow takham mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 34:29" />Akung kowi mang Josia dow kowchin maru hanow Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa maten kowi uang hawla khai, now amatni kowi dow arasang aia kuaah lawmah khai. <verse eid="2CH 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 34:30" />Now aia dow Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh aiuk asowm uowi mih maten kowi pawla now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowkup khai. Amatni pungmadawng kowi dow uamowuüa hai risiuüa paw tawi uowi chekhai. Now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kaah mih chabowih kowi kowh laiklow maten amatni kowi aia phat pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 34:31" />Nami kung kowi mang Josia dow kimchüng ria kowi iowng se nami bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih sangbowk laitawm maten nachün kownkow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi maiawng takham khai, “CHAKRAMANG tiama kowi ang namang kown, ang kowh sak maiow hown aia kowh ana pek hai ari aiang ang nachün kown,” pakhai. Nakhowk khe maru maten mih naiawng mang hown tawi takham khai. <verse eid="2CH 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 34:32" />Nami kung kowi aia dow Jerusalem marowchakuüa hai Benjamin krungchakuüa uang takua talawm miuüa kowi Thurai kowh rirow nachün kownkow pe takhamah khai. Now Jerusalem marowchakuüa dow amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai sangbowk laitawm mih uown chün büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 34:33" />Josia dow Israeluüa krawi powngah mih pren maten kowi kowh suiiai kaniaima mih arup aren krawi piakta bowk khai, now Israeluüa maten kowi CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai kowi kür hown pe chupiiaah khai. Naiawng hown Josia sing uowi sak uowi mowr dow maru kawmuüa mih CHAKRAMANG amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai tiama kowi mang büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 34:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="2CH 35" />
  <para style="s">Mang Josia chang Takat Pawi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 35:1" />Now Josia mih CHAKRAMANG vüi Jerusalem marow kowi chang Takat Pawi khai. Maru kawmuüa mih ning uown kowi kowh la uown laitali ni mih ni khe Takat Pawi kowi kowh sunah kown mih ruapur chah ngenah khai. <verse eid="2CH 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 35:2" />Josia mih uamowuüa kowi amatni kowh lup bowk pe khai, now CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi nachang lup kownkow peah sakkhawtra khai. <verse eid="2CH 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 35:3" />Now Israeluüa maten kowi kowh tüngsang mih hai CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh lang kraah mih Leviuüa kowi Josia tek pe mih, “Israel mang David kowh chapa Sawlawmawn thawpah mih CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi chimsaima mih sangbowk laitawm tawkpla towah büa diah. Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih enni akawt takla dowi bowt. Kawmat hownia dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowh lup hai aia kowh maru-uüa kowh lup chang büah towbowt. <verse eid="2CH 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 35:4" />Israel mang David hai achapa Sawlawmawn ruila mih ana pek iawng enni matia chowlowkkow machak kowi kowh lup bak uowi iawng nachang kown mih kamrüt büa diah.<verse eid="2CH 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 35:5" />“CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi Israeluüa uang pawla uanap khe Israel maten kowi naia khowngla kownkow enni Leviuüa mih chowlowkkow machak athum athumchow tabakah büa diah. <verse eid="2CH 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 35:6" />Now enni dow Takat Pawi vüi kowi kowh ruapur chah ngen mih chekhai rakowi kowmatia kowi tachim tasai büa diah, now Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih ana iawng Israeluüa naia changla Takat Pawi kownkow achang takla mih chang pe büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 35:7" />Nami kung kowi dow Josia mih nami re-e kowh uowi mih maten vüi Takat Pawi kowi nachangla phuchua kown mih rua hai ruapur chah 30,000 pum hai chiala 3,000 pum peah khai. Naiawngün maten dow mang Josia mih aiamat dawngthawnguan hownia kowh peah mih chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 35:8" />Now mang kowh maru iukuüa paw amatni kowh tawncher hownia amatni sak nau hown maru-uüa kowi, uamowuüa kowi hai Leviuüa kowi nachangla phuchua kownkow tawi pe khai. Now Thurai chup kim kowi kowh aluchow Hilkia, Zekaria hai Jehiel büah paw nachangla Takat Pawi kownkow rua hai ruapur 2,600 pum hai chiala 300 pum uamowuüa kowi tawi pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 35:9" />Now Levi krungchak kowi kowh aluchow Konania, aia naumow Semaia hai Nethanel, Hasabia, Jeiel hai Jozabad büah paw Leviuüa nachangla phuchua kownkow rua hai ruapur 5,000 pum hai chiala 500 pum tawi pe khai.<verse eid="2CH 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 35:10" />Naiawng hai nachang Thurai lup kown mih kamrüt büah khai, now mang kowh ana pek iawng uamowuüa hai Leviuüa mih amatni chowlowkkow uowi rah kowi iowng büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 35:11" />Takat Pawi chang müa rua hai ruapur Leviuüa ngenta khowk hanow uamowuüa mih Leviuüa rut hownia tawi paw avi reng chekhai, now naiawngün vi mih phuchuara kowi krawi thetah büah reng, now Leviuüa mih naiawngün tawncher kowi kleu pe apik reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 35:12" />Now amatni dow nami chaknga mih chowlowkkow machak kowi kowh thumchak uowi iawng naia changla tikah mih uanap kownkow bak pe khai. Amatni dow Mosi ruila mih ana pek iawng naia changla uanap kownkow naiawng chang mih chekhai. Now chiala nga kowi paw naiawng changah büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 35:13" />Amatni dow Takat Pawi kowi kowh tawncher mih ari kowi uowi iawng maih kowi tikah büah khai, now changla phuchua mih chaknga dow puh achaing achaing hown engah hanow alenma maru kawmuüa kowi pe chaah büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 35:14" />Naiawng hai ni chut chi phuchuara kowi uamowuüa dow phuchua hai tikah mih uanap chang khai. Now naiawngün chur khe dow Leviuüa mih amatni matia vüi hai Arawn krungchak hownia kowh uamowuüa vüi Takat Pawi chang müa tawncher kamrüt khai.<verse eid="2CH 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 35:15" />Naiawng sun Takat Pawi mih khin khe David, Asaf, Heman hai risi Jeduthun büah kowh ana pek iawng Asaf krungchak hownia kowh meng sarauüa hai tingteng, prui, towmmow hai taraw sarauüa dow amatni chowlowkkow uowi rah kowi uowi khai. Nami khin khe tapplawt maten kowi dow achawng mih uowi bowk chekhai. Amatni dow towla lup hüah now cham kowi kla dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni vüi Takat Pawi kowi lakke takla mih chap maten Leviuüa kamrüt pe khai. <verse eid="2CH 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 35:16" />Naiawng hai nami ni dow mang Josia ana pek iawng CHAKRAMANG vüi chang Takat Pawi büah khai, now phuchuara luk kowi tikah mih uanap pawi chang büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 35:17" />Nami khin khe nakowi kowh Israeluüa uowi mih maten dow Takat Pawi hai The pe tuah dowi mih kawm Pawi ranit ni mowr sun büah khai. <verse eid="2CH 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 35:18" />Naiawng mih Takat Pawi dow risi Samuel chowng hownia Israeluüa mih katpaw sun dowi tak chekhai. Uamowuüa, Leviuüa, Jerusalem marowchakuüa, Judauüa hai Israeluüa maten hown Josia sun Takat Pawi mih iawng Israel manguüa pungmadawng kowi miapaw sun dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 35:19" />Naiawng Josia sun Takat Pawi mih dow aia chowm mang mih lairaiat ning khe chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josia kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 35:20" />Thurai chup kim lup maten Josia ki changta bowk kung kowi dow Aigupta pren mang Nekaw mih Iufratis aw re-e kowh Karkemis marow kowi nauang senah kownkow uang khai. Nakhowk khe mang Nekaw kowi nakowsenah kownkow Josia mih kowtarü khai. <verse eid="2CH 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 35:21" />Nachenganchepaw Josia tut-e mang Nekaw uang chin pe maru hanow krawi tek pe mih, “Aw Juda pren mang, tawng chow achi kowh ran uowi? Kawmat kowh ang uang tarü tasen mih dow ang uang sen en mih nadowi; ang ransu-uüa kowi nasenah kownkow ang uang mih chowtaih. Thurai mih alenma ransu-uüa kowi nasen kownkow tek ang khai. Naiawng rakowi ang hown kowh uowi mih Thurai kowi hauang hangah diah; en che hangah hanow aia mih napiakta en kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 35:22" />Nachenganchepaw Josia mih naplan lak dow mang Nekaw kowi nasenah kown kamrüt khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia kowi maru natuk matah dowi kownkow tawnguat achap kawm hown tatawng khai. Thurai ana pek iawng mang Nekaw tek pe mih kowi aia dow sünta dowi kowi Megido dowm kowi nakowsenah kownkow kowtarü khai.<verse eid="2CH 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 35:23" />Nami khin khe aia kowi dow leba dowk miuüa ap-ah hanow aia buk kowi leba sek kak khai. Nakhowk khe aia kowh maru-uüa kowi Josia tek pe mih, “Cham pawla ang büah bowt, ang ka arau mih ahuma chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="2CH 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 35:24" />Naiawng rakowi aia kowh kawrnga kari hownia aia kowi klala now akeng mih kawrnga kari kowi aia kowh maru-uüa tangah khai. Now aia kowi dow Jerusalem marow kowi uang pawla khai, now aia dow nakowi hing kowng khai. Now aia kowh uak dow aia pipu-uüa tadupra kowi maru dupah khai. Nakhowk khe Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh maru maten mih aia vüi kowi uowila uiting uangtak khai.<verse eid="2CH 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 35:25" />Josia vüi kowi Jeremia mih thawn pe kar meng khai, now Josia lawnguan kowi kowh nami kar meng dow kawmat paw meng sarauüa mih tek reng tak chekhai. Naiawngün meng dow Israeluüa vüi uang hing chowng rirow khai, now naiawngün meng dow Kar Meng pami bowih kowi ruiah khai.<verse eid="2CH 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="2CH 35:26-27" />Josia kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten hai CHAKRAMANG kowh ari aiang iawng Thurai kowi aia ringkaw mih lawnguan dow auown hownia achur pat “Israel hai Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 35:26-27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="2CH 36" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Jehoahaz chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 36:1" />Akung kowi prenchak maru-uüa dow Josia chapa Jehoahaz kowi Jerusalem marow kowi pawla hanow apa takcha aia kowi ta pe chowmah mang khai. <verse eid="2CH 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 36:2" />Juda pren kowi Jehoahaz chowm mang mih dow 23 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow sum la mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2CH 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 36:3" />Aigupta pren mang Faraw-Nekaw dow Jehoahaz kowi Jerusalem kowi kowh aia kowh mang chowm rah khünta pe khai. Now Faraw-Nekaw dow tai 90 mawn ngia hai kuh 35 set ngia mangmu nauang pe kownkow Juda prenchakuüa luk kowi peah kurdik khai. <verse eid="2CH 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 36:4" />Aia dow Jehoahaz kowh alowk mih tainau Eliakim pami kowi Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow luk kowi pe chowmah mang khai, now aia dow Eliakim pami ming takcha kowi Jehoiakim pahai chap pe ming khai. Nachenganchepaw Jehoahaz kowi dow khümla hanow Aigupta pren kowi Faraw-Nekaw pawla khai.<verse eid="2CH 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Jehoiakim chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 36:5" />Juda pren kowi Jehoiakim chowm mang mih dow 25 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow lailowk ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. Jehoiakim dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 36:6" />Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar dow Jerusalem kowi uang senah hanow Jehoiakim kowi khümah khai, now aia kowi dow kri leng hown tawmah hanow Babulawn pren kowi Nebuknezar pawla khai. <verse eid="2CH 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 36:7" />CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh asung khakma mih uanh paw Babulawn pren kowi pawla ne hanow Nebuknezar mih aia kowh mang kim kowi towah khai.<verse eid="2CH 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 36:8" />Jehoiakim kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten hai aia kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup ngak lawnguan maten dow “Israel hai Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. Akung kowi aia takcha kowi dow achapa Jehoiakin mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2CH 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Jehoiakin chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 36:9" />Juda pren kowi Jehoiakin chowm mang mih dow lairaiat ning khe chekhai. Aia dow sum la hown hamüt ni mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. Jehoiakin dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 36:10" />Chungrau khin chur pra khe mang Nebuknezar dow Jehoiakin kowi khümla hanow Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai. Nakhowk khe mang Nebuknezar dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh asung khakma mih uanh ahuma pawla khai. Aia dow Jehoiakin takcha apahi Zedekia kowi Juda pren hai Israel pren luk kowi ta pe chowmah mang khai.<verse eid="2CH 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Zedekia chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 36:11" />Juda pren kowi Zedekia chowm mang mih dow 21 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow lailowk ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2CH 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 36:12" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai mik kowi angakma mih lup chang reng chekhai. CHAKRAMANG laiklow phuang mih risi Jeremia tek pe mih laiklow dow khamsumma hown aia sünta pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 36:13" />Nami klen kowi CHAKRAMANG ming hown pe khamah sawi mih mang Nebuknezar kowi paw aia kingküaah khai. Aia dow lai üa kürma hai saktuak khawtma rakowi CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tut-e uang plan dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 36:14" />Nami klen kowi uamowuüa kowh aluchowuüa maten hai Juda maru-uüa dow kaah sakowm dowi chekhai. Amatni riaret kowi kowh prenchakuüa iawng suiiai kaniaima mih thuraiuüa kowi tawi chupiia büah khai, now Jerusalem marow kowi kowh aia vüi lang krata mih kim dow amatni sürlawkta pe khai.<verse eid="2CH 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow piak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 36:15" />CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa pipu-uüa kowh Thurai dow amatni tut-e uang chin pe risiuüa hanow nataripla kownkow plan plan uang tek pe khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia maru-uüa hai aia kim kowi dow CHAKRAMANG saksing reng chekhai. <verse eid="2CH 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 36:16" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai uang chinah mih satang phowng miuüa kowi amatni hawt khareah khai, aia kowh laiklow amatni nuata khai, now aia kowh risiuüa kowi dow changla rensi büah khai. Achur kowi amatni luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura uang ting khe dow amatni mih tawngpaw nowng changra uowi dowi bowt. <verse eid="2CH 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 36:17" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi nauang senah kownkow Babulawn pren mang kowi CHAKRAMANG uang pawla pe khai. Nami mang dow Juda pren kowi kowh klanguüa hawmh kowi krawi saiah khai; aia dow CHAKRAMANG kim lak kowi khowm padow klanguüa hawmh kowi saila khai. Aia dow sana dowi kowi malauüa klanguüa, kimrengchowuüa hai lawngtanguüa bowkbowk kowi saila khai. Amatni kowi dow nami mang rut kowi CHAKRAMANG ap-ah khai. <verse eid="2CH 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 36:18" />Babulawn pren mang dow Thurai kim kowi kowh aiukma mih hai asowmchow mih uanh, asung khakma mih uanh maten, now mang hai mang kowh maru iukuüa kowh dawngthawnguan maten Babulawn pren kowi pawla bowk khai. <verse eid="2CH 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 36:19" />Nebuknezar kowh maru-uüa dow Thurai chup kim towkta pe bowk khai, now Jerusalem marow tap krawi piakta pe bowk khai. Amatni dow nakowi kowh aiuk aiukma mih kim maten towkta pe khai, now asung khakma mih uanh maten paw piakta pe bowk khai. <verse eid="2CH 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 36:20" />Tawi kowng dowi miuüa kowi dow Babulawn pren mang mih aia pren kowi pawla khai. Now Persia pren mang awr kür dowi mowr dow naiawngün maru-uüa mih mang Nebuknezar hai aia krungchakuüa nimkrüa kowi tawi chang nar lup khai.<verse eid="2CH 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 36:21" />Nami khin khe dow Israel pren kowi kowh krawng bawn maten mih 70 ning chih dowi mowr ka tanai khai bowt. Nami dow risi Jeremia tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow uang tachih mih chekhai.<verse eid="2CH 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judauüa kowi mang Kuras uang plan pawla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 36:22" />Persia pren kowi Kuras uown chowm mang mih ning khe risi Jeremia tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow uang tachih khai bowt. CHAKRAMANG peah saktuak rakowi Kuras dow mami laiklow ruiah hanow aia kowh pren maten kowi maiawng krawi phuang khai: <verse eid="2CH 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 36:23" />“Mami dow Persia pren mang ang Kuras kowh ana pek chekhai. Palusama luk kowi pe chowm ang mang mih dow CHAKRAMANG mukuang kowi kowh Thurai chekhai. Aia dow Juda pren kowi kowh Jerusalem marow kowi aia vüi nathawp pe kim lowk kown mih kurdik pe ang khai. Enni Thurai maru-uüa maten dow Jerusalem kowi kowkowi büa diah. CHAKRAMANG pacham tawi uowila enni reng lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2CH 36:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 36" />
</usx>